trong>錯誤</strong>: 此使用者名稱含有不合法的字元，因此無效。請輸入有效的使用者名稱。','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account (i.e. you can overbook). Emails are not resent automatically.'=>'<strong>附註：</strong>不會考慮票券的可用數量（即可超額預訂）。電子郵件不會自動重新寄送。','<strong>Notes:</strong> Ticket availability not taken into account when approving new bookings (i.e. you can overbook).'=>'<strong>附註：</strong>核准新預訂時不會考慮票券的可用數量（即可超額預訂）。','<strong>Warning : </strong> By enabling this, registered users will not be able to see bookings they make as guests in their "My Bookings" page.'=>'<strong>警告:</strong>啟用此項後，已註冊的使用者將無法在其「我的預訂」頁面中看到以訪客身分進行的預訂。','<strong>Warning : </strong> Various features afforded to users with an account will not be available, e.g. viewing bookings. Once you enable this and select a user, modifying these values will prevent older non-user bookings from displaying the correct information.'=>'<strong>警告:</strong>擁有帳號的使用者可享有的各種功能將無法使用，例如檢視預訂。啟用此項並選取使用者後，修改這些值將導致較早的無使用者預訂無法顯示正確的資訊。','A booking intent cannot have its status changed.'=>'預訂意向的狀態無法變更。','A booking was cancelled'=>'有預訂已取消','A booking\'s payment gateway is set when the booking is made and cannot be changed.'=>'預訂的付款閘道會在預訂完成時設定，之後無法變更。','A guest-accessible cancellation flow for the EU statutory <strong>right of withdrawal</strong>. Enable this only if you sell to consumers who have a right of withdrawal — <strong>fixed-date events are generally exempt</strong>. Events Manager provides the mechanism; you supply your own legal withdrawal policy text below.'=>'供訪客使用的取消流程，用於歐盟法定<strong>撤回權</strong>。僅在你向享有撤回權的消費者銷售時才啟用，<strong>固定日期的活動通常可豁免</strong>。Events Manager 提供機制；你需要在下方提供自己的法定撤回政策文字。','A hybrid event needs a physical venue.'=>'混合活動需要實體場地。','A list of further dates, such as 2027-03-11|2027-03-18, used alone or with a rule.'=>'其他日期的清單,例如 2027-03-11|2027-03-18,可單獨使用,也可搭配規則使用。','A location with this name is already on this site (location %d).'=>'此網站上已有同名地點(地點 %d)。','A location with this name is already on this site.'=>'此網站上已