ected from the user requesting their personal data, which would also include events and locations where they are the author.'=>'以下所有選項都與要求取得個人資料的使用者所提交或收集的資料有關，其中也包括由該使用者擔任作者的活動和地點。','All our sold add-ons'=>'我們販售的所有附加元件','All regions text'=>'所有地區文字','All settings, events and bookings for every site on this network will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'此網路中所有站台的設定、活動與預訂都將被永久刪除，且無法復原。','All states text'=>'所有州/省文字','All towns/cities text'=>'所有鄉鎮/城市文字','All translations of this event will be detached from the recurring event.'=>'此活動的所有翻譯都將與週期性活動解除關聯。','All your settings and events will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone.'=>'你所有的設定與活動都將被永久刪除，且無法復原。','All your settings, including email templates and template formats for Events Manager will be deleted.'=>'你所有的設定，包括 Events Manager 的電子郵件範本與格式範本，都將被刪除。','Allow %s to appear in the built-in search results.'=>'允許 %s 出現在內建搜尋結果中。','Allow Maybe?'=>'允許「可能」？','Allow Multiple Uploads'=>'允許多檔上傳','Allow RSVP Actions'=>'開放回覆出席操作','Allow WordPress post-style archives.'=>'允許 WordPress 文章式彙整。','Allow anonymous event submissions?'=>'允許匿名提交活動？','Allow bookings with registered emails?'=>'允許使用已註冊的電子郵件地址預訂？','Allow double bookings?'=>'開放重複預訂？','Allow format shortcode parameters?'=>'要允許格式短代碼參數嗎？','Allow guest bookings?'=>'開放訪客預訂？','Allow overbooking when approving?'=>'核准時允許超額預訂？','Allow subsites to create their own'=>'允許子網站自行建立','Allow users to respond with a \'Maybe\' status rather than Attending or Not Attending'=>'允許使用者以「可能」狀態回覆，而不只是出席或不出席','Allowed Extensions'=>'允許的副檔名','Already Booked'=>'已預訂','Already attending'=>'已報名參加','Already booked'=>'已預訂','Already have a license? Download the plugin from %s, upload it under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'已有授權?請從 %s 下載外掛,在「外掛 > 新增外掛」下上傳,然後在其設定中啟用您的授權。','Already migrated: %s'=>'已遷移:%s','Also, the following will occur:'=>'此外，還會發生以下情況：','Always check the latest stable version?'=>'一律檢查最新穩定版本？','Always show and ask for consent'=>'一律顯示並要求同意','An email will be sent to an administrator of your choice when an event is published by users who are not administrators.'=>'當非管理員的使用者發佈活動時，系統會寄送電子郵件給你指定的管理員。','An email will be sent to the event contact if someone cancels their booking.'=>'若有人取消其預訂，系統會寄送電子郵件給活動聯絡人。','An email will be sent to the event owner when their event is approved. Users requiring event approval do not have the <code>publish_events</code> capability.'=>'當活動獲得核准時，系統會寄送電子郵件給活動擁有者。需要活動核准的使用者不具備 <code>publish_events</code> 權限。','An email will be sent to your administrator emails when an event is submitted and pending approval.'=>'當活動提交並等待核准時，系統會寄送電子郵件給你的管理員電子郵件地址。','An error has occurred, not all sites were upgraded successfully.'=>'發生錯誤，並非所有網站都成功升級。','An error occurred.'=>'發生錯誤。','An event with no bookings.'=>'沒有預訂功能的活動。','An event with this name and start is already on this site (event %d).'=>'此網站上已有同名且開始時間相同的活動(活動 %d)。','An import is running. Wait for it to finish, or pause it first.'=>'正在進行匯入。請等待其完成,或先將其暫停。','An organizer with this name is already on this site.'=>'此網站上已有同名主辦者。','And much more'=>'以及更多功能','Anonymous Submitter Info'=>'匿名提交者資訊','Anonymous event submissions'=>'匿名活動提交','Anonymous submitters cannot see or modify their event once submitted. You can customize the success message they see here.'=>'匿名提交者在提交後無法查看或修改自己的活動。你可以在此自訂他們看到的成功訊息。','Another request is already updating this online location.'=>'已有另一個請求正在更新此線上地點。','Any Type'=>'任何類型','Appears as the first default search option.'=>'顯示為第一個預設搜尋選項。','Appears as the label for this search option.'=>'顯示為此搜尋選項的標籤。','Appears on the text search filter above the categories list.'=>'顯示於分類清單上方的文字搜尋篩選器。','Appears on the text search filter above the tags list.'=>'顯示於標籤清單上方的文字搜尋篩選器。','Appears within the input box.'=>'顯示於輸入框內。','Apply global capabilities?'=>'套用全域權限？','Approval Required?'=>'需要核准？','Approve'=>'核准','Approved'=>'已核准','Archetype'=>'原型','Archetypes UI Builder'=>'原型 UI 建構器','Are current events past events?'=>'進行中的活動算是過去的活動嗎？','Are you sure you want to cancel your booking?'=>'確定要取消你的預訂嗎？','Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'確定要繼續嗎？','Are you sure you want to convert all repeating events into recurring events?'=>'確定要將所有重複活動轉換為週期性活動嗎？','Are you sure you want to convert this repeating event?'=>'確定要轉換此重複活動嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete all recurrences of this event?'=>'確定要刪除此活動的所有重複項目嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this archetype? This action cannot be undone.'=>'確定要刪除此原型嗎？此動作無法復原。','Are you sure you want to delete this file? It will be deleted upon submission.'=>'確定要刪除此檔案嗎？它將在送出時被刪除。','Are you sure you want to delete this item? This action cannot be undone.'=>'確定要刪除此項目嗎？此操作無法復原。','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket?'=>'確定要刪除此票券嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this ticket? All bookings related to this ticket will be deleted once you save this %s.'=>'確定要刪除此票券嗎？儲存此%s後，與此票券相關的所有預訂都會被刪除。','Are you sure you want to delete?'=>'確定要刪除嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete? This action cannot be undone.'=>'確定要刪除嗎？此操作無法復原。','Are you sure you want to detach this event? By doing so, this event will be independent of the recurring set of events.'=>'確定要解除此活動的關聯嗎？這麼做之後，此活動將獨立於週期性活動組之外。','Are you sure you want to disable bookings? If you do this and save, you will lose all previous bookings. If you wish to prevent further bookings, reduce the number of spaces available to the amount of bookings you currently have'=>'確定要停用預訂嗎？若這麼做並儲存，你將失去所有先前的預訂。若要避免後續預訂，請將可用名額減少至目前的預訂數量','Are you sure you want to proceed? We recommend you back up your database first, just in case!'=>'確定要繼續嗎？建議你先備份資料庫，以防萬一！','Are you sure you want to reset Events Manager?'=>'確定要重設 Events Manager 嗎？','Are you sure you want to uninstall Events Manager?'=>'確定要解除安裝 Events Manager 嗎？','As a site admin, you see all group events, users will only be able to choose groups they are admins of.'=>'身為網站管理員，你可以看到所有社團活動；一般使用者只能選擇自己擔任管理員的社團。','Ascending'=>'遞增','Aside from pages we automatically generate and include certain jQuery files, if you are using Widgets, Shortcode or PHP to display specific items you may need to tell us where you are using them for them to work properly. Below are options for you to include specific jQuery dependencies only on certain pages.'=>'除了我們自動產生並包含特定 jQuery 檔案的頁面之外，如果你使用小工具、短代碼或 PHP 顯示特定項目，可能需要告訴我們你在哪裡使用，它們才能正常運作。以下選項可讓你只在特定頁面包含特定的 jQuery 相依性項目。','Attachment ID not found.'=>'找不到附件 ID。','Attendee %d'=>'參加者 %d','Attendee %s'=>'參加者 %s','Attendee (Per Space Booked)'=>'參加者（每個預訂名額）','Attendee names, answers to attendee fields and check-in status are copied and kept with each ticket. Without Events Manager Pro they are not shown, so you will see each booking, its tickets and the person who booked. If you add Events Manager Pro later, run the migration again to set up its attendee forms and check-ins.'=>'參加者姓名、參加者欄位的回答和報到狀態會被複製並保存在每張票券中。沒有 Events Manager Pro 時這些內容不會顯示,因此您會看到每筆預訂、其票券以及預訂人。若之後新增 Events Manager Pro,請再次執行遷移,以設定其參加者表單和報到。','Attendees'=>'參加者','Attending'=>'出席','Attributes'=>'屬性','AutoTLS'=>'AutoTLS','Avail. Spaces'=>'可用名額','Availability'=>'名額狀況','Available'=>'可預訂','Available Archetypes'=>'可用的原型','Available Spaces'=>'可用名額','Available for'=>'開放對象','Available from'=>'開放時間起','Available spaces'=>'可用名額','Available until'=>'開放時間至','Average Sale'=>'平均銷售額','Average Ticket'=>'平均票價','Awaiting Online Payment'=>'等待線上付款','Awaiting Payment'=>'等待付款','Bar Graph'=>'長條圖','Base Event Settings'=>'基礎活動設定','Base Location Settings'=>'基礎地點設定','Base font size'=>'基本字型大小','Base font weight'=>'基本字重','Base line height'=>'基本行高','Basic HTML is allowed in ticket labels and descriptions.'=>'票券標籤與說明可使用基本 HTML。','Basic Only'=>'僅限基本','Be aware that some themes will not work with this option, if so (or you want to make your own changes), you can create a file named <code>single-%s.php</code> <a href=\'#\'>as shown on the WordPress codex</a>, and leave this set to Posts.'=>'請注意，部分佈景主題無法搭配此選項運作，若遇到這種情況（或你想自行修改），可以建立名為 <code>single-%s.php</code> 的檔案（<a href=\'#\'>如 WordPress Codex 所示</a>），並將此項維持設為文章。','Before'=>'稅前','Before you save your changes, you can quickly send yourself a test email by clicking this button.'=>'在儲存變更之前，你可以點擊此按鈕快速寄一封測試電子郵件給自己。','Below are translations for your location address. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'以下是地點地址的翻譯。若留空，將使用原始活動的語言。','Below are translations for your tickets. If left blank, the language of the original event will be used.'=>'以下是票券的翻譯。若留空，將使用原始活動的語言。','Below you will find texts that will be displayed to users in various areas during the bookings process, particularly on booking forms.'=>'以下是預訂流程中各個環節（特別是預訂表單）向使用者顯示的文字。','Between %1$d and %2$d.'=>'介於 %1$d 和 %2$d 之間。','Block Editor (Gutenberg)'=>'區塊編輯器 (Gutenberg)','Block Editor development is still ongoing, switch back to the Classic Editor if you experience issues.'=>'區塊編輯器仍在開發中，如果遇到問題，請切換回傳統編輯器。','Block editor layout'=>'區塊編輯器版面配置','Blog Default Timezone'=>'部落格預設時區','Body Classes'=>'Body 類別','Book Now'=>'立即預訂','Book Now!'=>'立即預訂！','Booked'=>'已預訂','Booked Spaces'=>'已預訂名額','Booked User Emails'=>'預訂者電子郵件','Booked/Available'=>'已預訂/可用','Booking'=>'預訂','Booking %s'=>'預訂 %s','Booking %s.'=>'預訂%s。','Booking Actions'=>'預訂操作','Booking Cancellation Warning'=>'預訂取消警告','Booking Cancelled'=>'預訂已取消','Booking Chart'=>'預訂圖表','Booking Comment'=>'預訂留言','Booking Confirmation'=>'預訂確認','Booking Confirmed'=>'預訂已確認','Booking Cut-Off Date'=>'預訂截止日期','Booking Data'=>'預訂資料','Booking Date'=>'預訂日期','Booking Details'=>'預訂詳細資料','Booking Email Templates'=>'預訂電子郵件範本','Booking Form'=>'預訂表單','Booking ID'=>'預訂 ID','Booking ID.'=>'預訂 ID。','Booking Intent'=>'預訂意向','Booking Management Pages'=>'預訂管理頁面','Booking Meta'=>'預訂 Meta','Booking Notes'=>'預訂備註','Booking Pending'=>'預訂待處理','Booking RSVP'=>'預訂回覆出席','Booking RSVP status set to \'%s\'.'=>'預訂的回覆出席狀態已設為「%s」。','Booking Rejected'=>'預訂已拒絕','Booking Related Placeholders'=>'預訂相關預留位置','Booking Status'=>'預訂狀態','Booking Statuses'=>'預訂狀態','Booking Submit Button'=>'預訂送出按鈕','Booking Summary'=>'預訂摘要','Booking admin pages'=>'預訂管理頁面','Booking already 