 has started).'=>'預訂已截止（例如活動已開始）。','Bookings that are uncancelled are returned to their previous state (if available), the %1$s PHP constant value or if previous options are not available then pending/approved according to your booking approval settings.'=>'取消後又恢復的預訂會回到先前的狀態（若有），或採用 %1$s PHP 常數的值；若無法取得先前狀態，則依照你的預訂核准設定變為待審閱或已核准。','Bookings to individual %s recurrences will be preserved unless you delete tickets or choose to reschedule and delete rescheduled recurrences.'=>'各個%s重複項目的預訂將會保留，除非你刪除票券，或選擇重新排程並刪除重新排程的重複項目。','Bookings to individual event recurrences will be preserved if event times and ticket settings are not modified.'=>'若未修改活動時間與票券設定，各個活動重複項目的預訂將會保留。','Bookings will be automatically cancelled.'=>'預訂將自動取消。','Bookings will not be confirmed until the event administrator approves it.'=>'在活動管理員核准之前，預訂不會被確認。','Bookings/Registration'=>'預訂/報名','Buffer'=>'緩衝時間','Bulk Actions'=>'批次操作','Bulk actions'=>'批次操作','Button & page labels'=>'按鈕與頁面標籤','Buy %s'=>'購買 %s','Buy on Woo.com'=>'在 Woo.com 購買','By default, event spaces become unavailable once there are enough CONFIRMED bookings. To reserve spaces even if unapproved, choose yes.'=>'依預設，當已確認的預訂達到足夠數量時，活動名額就會不再開放。若要在尚未核准時也保留名額，請選擇是。','By default, events that have an end date later than today will be included in searches, set this to yes to consider events that started \'yesterday\' as past.'=>'預設情況下，結束日期晚於今天的活動會包含在搜尋中，設為「是」則會將「昨天」開始的活動視為過去的活動。','By default, if a calendar day only has one event, it display a single event when clicking on the link of that calendar date. If you select Yes here, you will get always see a list of events.'=>'預設情況下，若某個月曆日期只有一個活動，點擊該日期連結時會顯示單一活動。若在此選擇「是」，則一律會顯示活動清單。','By default, if a guest tries to book an event using the email of a user account on your site they will be asked to log in, selecting yes will bypass this security measure.'=>'依預設，如果訪客嘗試使用網站上某個使用者帳號的電子郵件地址預訂活動，系統會要求其登入；選擇是將略過此安全措施。','By default, when a booking is made by a user, this booking is tied to a user account, if the user is not registered nor logged in and guest bookings are enabled, an account will be created for them.'=>'依預設，使用者進行預訂時，該預訂會綁定到一個使用者帳號；如果使用者尚未註冊或登入，且已開放訪客預訂，系統會為其建立帳號。','By editing your primary recurrence set, you will change all subsequent default values of your other recurrences.'=>'編輯你的主要重複組，將會變更其他重複項目之後所有的預設值。','By using formats, you can control how your %s are displayed from within the Events Manager <a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>Formatting</a> tab above without having to edit your theme files.'=>'透過格式功能，你可以直接在上方 Events Manager 的<a href=\'#formats\' class=\'nav-tab-link\' rel=\'#em-menu-formats\'>格式化</a>分頁中控制 %s 的顯示方式，而不必編輯佈景主題檔案。','CPT'=>'CPT','CPT (Plural)'=>'CPT（複數）','CPT (Single)'=>'CPT（單數）','CPT name (plural) must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT 名稱（複數）只能包含小寫字母、數字和底線。','CPT name must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, and underscores.'=>'CPT 名稱只能包含小寫字母、數字和底線。','CPTs'=>'CPT','CSS File'=>'CSS 檔案','CSS box'=>'CSS 方塊','CSV file'=>'CSV 檔案','CSV file does not appear to contain valid data.'=>'CSV 檔案似乎不包含有效資料。','Calendar'=>'月曆','Calendar Day Event List Settings'=>'月曆日期活動清單設定','Calendar Selection'=>'月曆選擇','Calendar Size'=>'月曆尺寸','Calendar events/day limit'=>'月曆每日活動數量上限','Calendar settings'=>'月曆設定','Calendar size'=>'月曆尺寸','Call get-booking-requirements with this event\'s ID for the exact required fields, their payload locations (attendee fields go under em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee), and a ready-to-submit example.'=>'請以此活動的 ID 呼叫 get-booking-requirements，以取得確切的必填欄位、其資料位置（參加者欄位位於 em_tickets[<ticket_id>].ticket_bookings[].attendee 之下），以及可直接提交的範例。','Calling em_get_option() too early whilst EM\\Archetypes class is not available.'=>'在 EM\\Archetypes 類別尚不可用時過早呼叫 em_get_option()。','Can attendees change their RSVP status? You can choose whether they can uncancel an RSVP below as well.'=>'參加者可以變更其回覆出席狀態嗎？你也可以在下方選擇是否允許他們恢復已取消的回覆。','Can be in form of pixels or a percentage such as %s or %s.'=>'可以使用像素或百分比，例如 %s 或 %s。','Can users cancel their booking?'=>'使用者可以取消自己的預訂嗎？','Can users uncancel their booking?'=>'使用者可以恢復已取消的預訂嗎？','Cancel'=>'取消','Cancel Ticket Recreation'=>'取消重新建立票券','Cancel all confirmed and pending bookings automatically.'=>'自動取消所有已確認和待審閱的預訂。','Cancel bookings?'=>'取消預訂？','Cancelation complete'=>'取消完成','Cancelation error'=>'取消錯誤','Cancelation in progress'=>'取消處理中','Canceling...'=>'取消中...','Cancellation'=>'取消','Cancellation Actions'=>'取消動作','Cancellations'=>'取消','Cancellations are not permitted for this booking.'=>'此預訂不允許取消。','Cancelled'=>'已取消','Cancelled event email'=>'活動取消電子郵件','Cannot create a Archetype CPT name %s, this must be at most 20 characters long, containing letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'無法建立名為 %s 的 Archetype CPT，名稱最多 20 個字元，且只能包含字母、數字、連字號和底線。','Canvas tabs'=>'畫布分頁','Categories'=>'分類','Categories dropdown label'=>'分類下拉選單標籤','Categories list page'=>'分類清單頁面','Category'=>'分類','Category IDs'=>'分類 ID','Category Related Placeholders'=>'分類相關預留位置','Category pages'=>'分類頁面','Category:'=>'分類:','Change'=>'變更','Changed timeslots get %s'=>'已變更的時段會被%s','Changes a booking status, such as approving, rejecting, or cancelling it.'=>'變更預訂狀態，例如核准、拒絕或取消。','Changes saved'=>'變更已儲存','Changes saved.'=>'設定已儲存。','Changing the location of this event will delete its %s meeting or broadcast, and anyone holding the old link will no longer be able to join.'=>'變更此活動的地點將刪除其 %s 會議或直播,持有舊連結的任何人都將無法再加入。','Chart Options'=>'圖表選項','Chart Type'=>'圖表類型','Check Dev Versions'=>'檢查開發版本','Check attendees in at the door by scanning tickets, manage events and bookings, and follow booking and sales status from your phone. Available on the App Store for iPhone and iPad. Included with Pro Plus, or available by subscription for any Events Manager site.'=>'透過掃描票券在入口為參加者報到,管理活動和預訂,並在手機上追蹤預訂和銷售狀態。可在 App Store 下載,支援 iPhone 和 iPad。Pro Plus 已包含,也可為任何 Events Manager 網站訂閱使用。','Check this option if you want the event contact to receive an email when someone books places. An email will be sent when a booking is first made (regardless if confirmed or pending)'=>'若希望活動聯絡人在有人預訂名額時收到電子郵件，請勾選此選項。預訂首次建立時就會寄出（不論已確認或待審閱）。','Check this option if you want to prevent the WordPress registration email from going out when a user anonymously books an event.'=>'若要在使用者以匿名方式預訂活動時，避免寄出 WordPress 註冊電子郵件，請勾選此選項。','Check this option to enable Google Map integration.'=>'勾選此選項可啟用 Google 地圖整合。','Checking for dev versions.'=>'正在檢查開發版本。','Checking for the latest stable version.'=>'正在檢查最新的穩定版本。','Checking...'=>'檢查中...','Checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release, skipping the staggered rollout delay (which can take up to 24 hours). Any newer stable version will appear on your Plugins or Updates page for a manual update.'=>'直接向 WordPress.org 檢查最新的穩定版本，略過分批推出的等待時間（最多可能需要 24 小時）。任何較新的穩定版本都會顯示在你的外掛或更新頁面，供你手動更新。','Choose a color for your %s. You can access this using the %s placeholder.'=>'為你的%s選擇色彩。你可以使用 %s 預留位置來取得。','Choose a settings file saved from a backup or another Events Manager installation and click the \'%s\' button.'=>'選擇從備份或其他 Events Manager 安裝儲存的設定檔，然後點擊「%s」按鈕。','Choose an image for your %s, which can be displayed using the %s placeholder.'=>'為你的%s選擇圖片，可使用 %s 預留位置顯示。','Choose another file'=>'選擇其他檔案','Choose from most used %s'=>'從最常使用的%s中選擇','Choose from most used event categories'=>'從最常使用的活動分類中選擇','Choose from most used event tags'=>'從最常使用的活動標籤中選擇','Choose graph type and stacking view options. Some views and stacking may not be available for all setting combinations.'=>'選擇圖表類型與堆疊檢視選項。部分檢視與堆疊方式可能無法用於所有設定組合。','Choose how prices are displayed. <code>@</code> will be replaced by the currency symbol, and <code>#</code> will be replaced by the number.'=>'選擇價格的顯示方式。<code>@</code> 會被取代為貨幣符號，<code>#</code> 會被取代為數字。','Choose how timeslots are listed in booking forms for recurring events and events with multiple timeslots.'=>'選擇在週期性活動與多時段活動的預訂表單中，時段的列出方式。','Choose how to format your group heading dates. Leave blank for default.'=>'選擇如何格式化群組標題日期。留空則使用預設值。','Choose how to format your group headings.'=>'選擇如何格式化群組標題。','Choose how to show a information about an event when clicking or hovering over a single event on the calendar.'=>'選擇在月曆上點擊或將滑鼠移至單一活動時，如何顯示活動資訊。','Choose the start date for comparing equivalent date ranges. The latest comparison end date is day before main duration start date.'=>'選擇比較同等日期範圍的起始日期。最晚的比較結束日期為主要期間起始日期的前一天。','Choose to show events within a specific time range.'=>'選擇顯示特定時間範圍內的活動。','Choose what to show users on their booking management page.'=>'選擇在使用者的預訂管理頁面顯示哪些內容。','Choose whether or not to display a login form in the booking form area to remind your members to log in before booking.'=>'選擇是否在預訂表單區域顯示登入表單，提醒會員在預訂前先登入。','Choose whether to display the main search bar. If disabled, advanced search fields will be shown in \'Inline\' mode automatically. You must also choose to enable at least one advanced search field, to avoid having an emtpy search form.'=>'選擇是否顯示主要搜尋列。若停用，進階搜尋欄位會自動以「內嵌」模式顯示。你也必須至少啟用一個進階搜尋欄位，以避免搜尋表單空白。','Choose whether to show a preview of the upcoming events for the date clicked on, or directly link to the calendar day.'=>'選擇要顯示所點擊日期的近期活動預覽，或直接連結至該月曆日期。','Choose which %s account hosts this event.'=>'選擇由哪個 %s 帳號主辦此活動。','Choose which order your tickets appear.'=>'選擇票券的顯示順序。','Choose your currency for displaying event pricing.'=>'選擇用於顯示活動價格的貨幣。','Choose/Upload Image'=>'選擇/上傳圖片','City'=>'城市','City/Town'=>'城市/鄉鎮','City/Town:'=>'城市/鄉鎮:','Classic Editor'=>'傳統編輯器','Clear All'=>'全部清除','Click the button below to mass-convert all your repeating events into recurring events.'=>'點擊下方按鈕，將你所有的重複活動大量轉換為週期性活動。','Click to toggle'=>'點擊以切換','Clicking these buttons will not have any effect until you save your settings!'=>'在儲存設定之前，點擊這些按鈕不會有任何效果！','Close Ticket Editor'=>'關閉票券編輯器','Collapse All'=>'全部收合','Color'=>'色彩','Column %d'=>'第 %d 欄','Column in the file'=>'檔案中的欄位','Columns for repeating events'=>'重複活動的欄位','Columns to choose'=>'可選擇的欄位','Columns to export'=>'要匯出的欄位','Columns to show'=>'要顯示的欄位','Comma-separated address(es) notified of each withdrawal for manual review. Leave blank to use the site admin email.'=>'以逗號分隔的地址，每次撤回都會通知這些地址以便人工審閱。留空則使用網站管理員的電子郵件。','Comma-separated list of allowed file extensions: %s. Leave blank to allow any.'=>'以逗號分隔的允許副檔名清單：%s。留空表示允許任何副檔名。','Comment'=>'備註','Communications Consent'=>'通訊同意','Compare With'=>'比較對象','Compare features'=>'比較功能','Compared to'=>'比較對象為','Configure the base settings for your events. These settings affect how events are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'設定活動的基礎設定。這些設定會影響活動在資料庫中的儲存與存取方式。','Configure the base settings for your locations. These settings affect how locations are stored and accessed in the database.'=>'設定地點的基礎設定。這些設定會影響地點在資料庫中的儲存與存取方式。','Confirm'=>'確認','Confirm button'=>'確認按鈕','Confirmation email could not be sent to admin. Registrant should have gotten their email (only admin see this warning).'=>'無法將確認電子郵件傳送給管理員。報名者應已收到他們的電子郵件（只有管理員會看到此警告）。','Confirmations'=>'確認','Confirmed'=>'已確認','Confirmed Spaces'=>'已確認名額','Confirmed booking email'=>'預訂確認電子郵件','Congratulations! Your email settings work.'=>'恭喜！你的電子郵件設定運作正常。','Connect'=>'連線','Connect Events Manager to MCP-compatible AI clients (Claude, Cursor, ChatGPT custom connectors, VS Code, Codex) by exposing Events Manager Abilities through the WordPress MCP Adapter. Clients authenticate through a one-click consent screen and a refreshable Application Password — no manual key juggling.'=>'透過 WordPress MCP Adapter 公開 Events Manager 功能，將 Events Manager 連接至相容 MCP 的 AI 用戶端（Claude、Cursor、ChatGPT 自訂連接器、VS Code、Codex）。用戶端透過一鍵同意畫面和可更新的應用程式密碼進行驗證，不需要手動處理金鑰。','Connect a %s account in the Events Manager settings before using it as an event location.'=>'請先在 Events Manager 設定中連線 %s 帳號,然後再將其用作活動地點。','Connect an account'=>'連線帳號','Connect to import events and locations from %s.'=>'連線以從 %s 匯入活動和地點。','Consent'=>'同意','Consent %s on %s'=>'同意 %s，於 %s','Consent Error'=>'同意錯誤','Consent Text'=>'同意文字','Consent previously %s on %s'=>'先前同意狀態為 %s，時間為 %s','Consented By Default'=>'預設為已同意','Contact a site administrator for your password.'=>'請聯絡網站管理員取得你的密碼。','Content'=>'內容','Content supplied within shortcode tags and the %s parameters will be HTML entity-decoded and sanitized.'=>'短代碼標籤內提供的內容與 %s 參數將進行 HTML 實體解碼並清理。','Content supplied within shortcode tags like %s will be HTML entity-decoded.'=>'像 %s 這類短代碼標籤內提供的內容將進行 HTML 實體解碼。','Control how subsites use Archetypes. Define network-wide types here and decide whether subsites can create, choose, or must use your list. You can also allow/deny renaming specific base settings.'=>'控制子網站如何使用原型。在此定義全網路通用的類型，並決定子網站可以自行建立、從清單中選擇，或必須使用你的清單。你也可以允許或禁止重新命名特定的基礎設定。','Controls how many events being held at a location are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等預留位置時，每頁顯示多少個在該地點舉辦的活動。留空表示不限制。','Controls how many events belonging to a category are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等預留位置時，每頁顯示多少個屬於某分類的活動。留空表示不限制。','Controls how many events belonging to a tag are shown per page when using placeholders such as %s. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'控制使用 %s 等預留位置時，每頁顯示多少個屬於某標籤的活動。留空表示不限制。','Convert ALL Repeating Events'=>'轉換所有重複活動','Convert Recurring'=>'轉換週期性','Convert and Deactivate Repeating Events'=>'轉換並停用重複活動','Coordinates'=>'座標','Copies your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %s into Events Manager. Nothing in the original plugin is changed or deleted, so you can run this, check the result, and roll it back or run it again.'=>'將您的 %s 資料複製到 Events Manager。原外掛中的任何內容都不會被變更或刪除,因此您可以執行此操作、檢查結果,然後還原或再次執行。','Copy default value'=>'複製預設值','Copy over our new v6 formats to make the best of our new UI design!'=>'複製我們的新 v6 格式，充分運用全新的介面設計！','Cost'=>'費用','Could not check event validation. Saving without pre-check — please verify the event details.'=>'無法檢查活動驗證。將不經預先檢查直接儲存，請確認活動詳細資料。','Could not open the PDF file for inspection.'=>'無法開啟 PDF 檔案進行檢查。','Could not open the file for inspection.'=>'無法開啟檔案進行檢查。','Could not read image size information.'=>'無法讀取圖片尺寸資訊。','Count'=>'項目數量','Country'=>'國家/地區','Coupons and discount codes'=>'優惠券和折扣碼','Create %s'=>'建立%s','Create Zoom meetings and webinars from the event editor, and register attendees on Zoom when they book. With Pro, attendees are registered once they pay and receive their own join links.'=>'在活動編輯器中建立 Zoom 會議和網路研討會,並在參加者預訂時將其註冊到 Zoom。使用 Pro 時,參加者在付款後即完成註冊,並取得各自的加入連結。','Create a location or start typing to search a previously created location.'=>'建立地點，或輸入文字搜尋先前建立的地點。','Create booking'=>'建立預訂','Create event'=>'建立活動','Create event ticket'=>'建立活動票券','Create location'=>'建立地點','Creates a ticket for an Events Manager event.'=>'為 Events Manager 活動建立票券。','Creates an Events Manager %s.'=>'建立 Events Manager %s。','Creates an Events Manager booking. Call get-booking-requirements first to get this event\'s required fields, payload locations, and an example payload.'=>'建立 Events Manager 預訂。請先呼叫 get-booking-requirements，以取得此活動的必填欄位、資料位置和範例資料。','Creates an Events Manager event.'=>'建立 Events Manager 活動。','Creates an Events Manager location.'=>'建立 Events Manager 地點。','Currency'=>'貨幣','Currency Format'=>'貨幣格式','Currency code'=>'貨幣代碼','Currency position (prefix or suffix)'=>'貨幣符號位置(prefix 或 suffix)','Currency symbol'=>'貨幣符號','Currently overridden by the EM_GUTENBERG constant in wp-config.php (%s).'=>'目前已被 wp-config.php 中的 EM_GUTENBERG 常數覆寫 (%s)。','Custom Dates'=>'自訂日期','Custom Link'=>'自訂連結','Custom Links'=>'自訂連結','Custom booking forms and individual attendee forms'=>'自訂預訂表單和個別參加者表單','Custom fields are the same as attributes, except you cannot restrict specific values, users can add any kind of custom field name/value pair. Only available in the WordPress admin area.'=>'自訂欄位與屬性相同，差別在於你無法限制特定的值，使用者可以新增任何種類的自訂欄位名稱/值組合。僅能在 WordPress 管理區使用。','Customize Feedback Messages'=>'自訂回饋訊息','Customize the format of the selected search dates, we recommend a brief format to keep things short.'=>'自訂所選搜尋日期的格式，建議使用簡短格式以保持精簡。','Customize the message your user sees when they resubmit/update their event.'=>'自訂使用者重新提交/更新活動後看到的訊息。','Customize the message your user sees when they submitted their event.'=>'自訂使用者提交活動後看到的訊息。','Customizer'=>'外觀自訂器','Daily'=>'每日','Database Cleanup'=>'資料庫清理','Date'=>'日期','Date Format'=>'日期格式','Date Picker Format'=>'日期選擇器格式','Date Preview Mode'=>'日期預覽模式','Date Separator'=>'日期分隔符號','Date and Time'=>'日期與時間','Date and Time formats follow the <a href="%s">WordPress time formatting conventions</a>'=>'日期與時間格式遵循 <a href="%s">WordPress 時間格式慣例</a>','Date and time'=>'日期和時間','Date/Time'=>'日期/時間','Dates'=>'日期','Dates must have correct formatting. Please use the date picker provided.'=>'日期格式必須正確，請使用所提供的日期選擇器。','Dates such as 2027-03-04 or March 4, 2027 are always read the same way.'=>'2027-03-04 或 March 4, 2027 等日期一律以相同方式解讀。','Dates written as numbers'=>'以數字書寫的日期','Day %d'=>'第 %d 天','Day first: 03/04/2027 is April 3'=>'日在前:03/04/2027 為 4 月 3 日','Days of week'=>'星期幾','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have requested #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Your booking is currently pending approval by our administrators. Once approved you will receive an automatic confirmation.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'親愛的 #_BOOKINGNAME，<br/>你已為 #_EVENTNAME 申請 #_BOOKINGSPACES 個名額。<br/>時間 : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>地點 : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>你的預訂目前正等待管理員核准，核准後你會收到自動確認通知。<br/>敬上，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>You have successfully reserved #_BOOKINGSPACES space/spaces for #_EVENTNAME.<br/>When : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>Where : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'親愛的 #_BOOKINGNAME，<br/>你已成功為 #_EVENTNAME 預訂 #_BOOKINGSPACES 個名額。<br/>時間 : #_EVENTDATES @ #_EVENTTIMES<br/>地點 : #_LOCATIONNAME - #_LOCATIONFULLLINE<br/>敬上，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'親愛的 #_BOOKINGNAME，<br/>你為 #_EVENTNAME (#_EVENTDATES) 申請的 #_BOOKINGSPACES 個名額預訂已被取消。<br/>敬上，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear #_BOOKINGNAME, <br/>Your requested booking for #_BOOKINGSPACES spaces at #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been rejected.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'親愛的 #_BOOKINGNAME，<br/>你為 #_EVENTNAME (#_EVENTDATES) 申請的 #_BOOKINGSPACES 個名額預訂已被拒絕。<br/>敬上，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Dear %s'=>'親愛的 %s','Dear Guest, <br/>We regret to inform you that #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been cancelled.<br/>Yours faithfully,<br/>#_CONTACTNAME'=>'親愛的來賓，<br/>很遺憾通知你，#_EVENTNAME (#_EVENTDATES) 已取消。<br/>敬上，<br/>#_CONTACTNAME','Decimal Point'=>'小數點','Decode shortcode content?'=>'要解碼短代碼內容嗎？','Decode shortcode format parameters?'=>'要解碼短代碼格式參數嗎？','Default'=>'預設','Default %s color'=>'預設 %s 色彩','Default %s list format'=>'預設 %s 清單格式','Default %s list options'=>'預設 %s 清單選項','Default (site setting)'=>'預設 (網站設定)','Default Category'=>'預設分類','Default Country'=>'預設國家/地區','Default List Scope'=>'預設清單範圍','Default Location'=>'預設地點','Default Location Country'=>'預設地點國家/地區','Default Timezone'=>'預設時區','Default View'=>'預設檢視','Default archive ordering'=>'預設彙整順序','Default calendar size'=>'預設月曆尺寸','Default distance'=>'預設距離','Default distance unit'=>'預設距離單位','Default event archive ordering'=>'預設活動彙整排序','Default event list format'=>'預設活動清單格式','Default event list format footer'=>'預設活動清單格式頁尾','Default event list format header'=>'預設活動清單格式頁首','Default event list ordering'=>'預設活動清單排序','Default event style'=>'預設活動樣式','Default font family'=>'預設字型系列','Default list ordering'=>'預設清單順序','Default map height'=>'預設地圖高度','Default map width'=>'預設地圖寬度','Default plugin setting'=>'外掛預設設定','Default scope to show your events in shortcodes, widgets and any other displays where scope is not defined. Events page and archive scopes can be defined in the %s settings section.'=>'在短代碼、小工具及其他未定義範圍的顯示處，用來顯示活動的預設範圍。活動頁面和彙整範圍可在 %s 設定區段中定義。','Default: %s'=>'預設：%s','Delete'=>'刪除','Delete %s'=>'刪除%s','Delete User'=>'刪除使用者','Delete booking'=>'刪除預訂','Delete event'=>'刪除活動','Delete everything migrated from %s (events, locations, tickets, bookings, terms) and restore converted content? The original data is not affected.'=>'刪除從 %s 遷移的所有內容(活動、地點、票券、預訂、分類項目)並還原已轉換的內容?原始資料不受影響。','Delete everything the import of %s created (events, locations, organizers, categories, tags and downloaded images)? Items that were already on the site are not affected.'=>'要刪除 %s 的匯入所建立的全部內容(活動、地點、主辦者、分類、標籤和已下載的圖片)嗎?網站上原有的項目不受影響。','Delete location'=>'刪除地點','Delete selected'=>'刪除所選項目','Delete ticket'=>'刪除票券','Deleted'=>'已刪除','Deletes an Events Manager %s.'=>'刪除 Events Manager %s。','Deletes an Events Manager ticket if it has no bookings.'=>'若 Events Manager 票券沒有預訂，則將其刪除。','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager event.'=>'刪除 Events Manager 活動或將其移至回收桶。','Deletes or trashes an Events Manager location.'=>'刪除 Events Manager 地點或將其移至回收桶。','Depending on server settings, some sending methods may ignore this settings.'=>'視伺服器設定而定，部分寄送方式可能會忽略此設定。','Depending on the nature of your site, you will be subject to one or more national and international privacy/data protection laws such as the %s. Below are some options that you can use to tailor how Events Manager interacts with WordPress privacy tools.'=>'依據你網站的性質，你可能需要遵守一項或多項國家與國際隱私權/資料保護法規，例如 %s。以下是一些選項，可用來調整 Events Manager 與 WordPress 隱私權工具的互動方式。','Descending'=>'遞減','Description'=>'說明','Design Options'=>'設計選項','Detach'=>'解除關聯','Details'=>'詳細資料','Details about the event.'=>'活動的詳細資訊。','Details about the location.'=>'地點的詳細資料。','Detect User Country'=>'偵測使用者國家/地區','Dev Mode active: Just a friendly reminder that you are updating to development versions. Only admins see this message, and it will go away when you disable this <a href="#pro-api">here</a> in your settings.'=>'開發模式已啟用：溫馨提醒，你目前正在更新為開發版本。只有管理員會看到此訊息，在設定中<a href="#pro-api">停用此項目</a>後，訊息即會消失。','Development Versions &amp; Updates'=>'開發版本 &amp; 更新','Difference from the price paid at the time of sale'=>'與銷售時已付價格的差額','Direct Link'=>'直接連結','Disable'=>'停用','Disable  WordPress Thumbnails?'=>'停用 WordPress 縮圖？','Disable %s'=>'停用 %s','Disable new registration email?'=>'停用新註冊電子郵件？','Disable thumbnails?'=>'停用縮圖？','Disable title rewriting?'=>'停用標題改寫？','Disabled'=>'已停用','Disconnect'=>'中斷連線','Disconnect All'=>'全部中斷連線','Discounts (After Taxes)'=>'折扣（稅後）','Discounts Before Taxes'=>'稅前折扣','Dismiss'=>'關閉','Dismiss Message'=>'關閉訊息','Display %s as'=>'將 %s 顯示為','Display %s on your blog.'=>'在你的部落格上顯示%s。','Display Settings'=>'顯示設定','Display Status'=>'顯示狀態','Display a geolocation search textbox which syncs with the main search geolocation box (if enabled).'=>'顯示地理位置搜尋文字方塊，並與主要搜尋地理位置方塊同步（若已啟用）。','Display a list of event locations on Events Manager.'=>'在 Events Manager 上顯示活動地點清單。','Display a list of event locations.'=>'顯示活動地點清單。','Display a list of events on Events Manager.'=>'在 Events Manager 上顯示活動清單。','Display a list of events with filtering and ordering.'=>'顯示具備篩選與排序功能的活動清單。','Display a prominent "Withdraw from contract" link in the site footer, since the law expects the function to be continuously and easily reachable.'=>'在網站頁尾顯示醒目的「撤銷契約」連結，因為法律要求此功能必須隨時且容易取得。','Display booking summary?'=>'顯示預訂摘要？','Display calendar in events page?'=>'在活動頁面中顯示月曆？','Display events in a monthly calendar grid.'=>'在月曆格狀中顯示活動。','Display events on your blog.'=>'在你的網站上顯示活動。','Display free booking summary?'=>'顯示免費預訂摘要？','Display global %s on main blog?'=>'在主部落格顯示全域%s？','Display global events on main blog?'=>'在主部落格顯示全域活動？','Display locations on your blog.'=>'在你的網站上顯示地點。','Display login form?'=>'顯示登入表單？','Display on Frontend'=>'顯示於前台','Display on WP Dashboard'=>'顯示於 WP 控制台','Display on bookings dashboard'=>'顯示於預訂控制台','Display on event bookings admin'=>'顯示於活動預訂管理','Display only locations with upcoming events.'=>'僅顯示有即將舉行活動的地點。','Display subsection titles above groups of line items, such as taxes, discounts and surcharges.'=>'在稅金、折扣和附加費等各組明細項目上方顯示小節標題。','Display subsection titles?'=>'顯示小節標題？','Display taxes separately?'=>'分開顯示稅金？','Display the booking summary if the event is free. If there are any available tickets worth more than 0 then the event is not considered free.'=>'活動免費時也顯示預訂摘要。只要有任何可用票券的價格大於 0，該活動就不視為免費。','Display the number of available spaces (or booking status if full/closed/cancelled) in each timeslot button or dropdown option.'=>'在每個時段按鈕或下拉選項中，顯示可用名額數量（若已額滿、已關閉或已取消，則顯示預訂狀態）。','Display the timeslot date as well as the time when viewing a specific calendar day.'=>'檢視特定月曆日期時，除了時間之外也顯示時段日期。','Display ticket prices without tax and calculate the tax total separately.'=>'顯示未含稅的票券價格，並另外計算稅金總額。','Display your events in a calendar widget.'=>'以月曆小工具顯示你的活動。','Displaying %1$s&#8211;%2$s of %3$s'=>'顯示第 %1$s&#8211;%2$s 筆，共 %3$s 筆','Displays %s from all sites on the network by default. You can still restrict %s by blog using shortcodes and template tags coupled with the <code>blog</code> attribute. Requires global tables to be turned on.'=>'預設顯示網路中所有站台的%s。你仍可搭配 <code>blog</code> 屬性，透過短代碼與範本標籤依部落格限制%s。需要啟用全域資料表。','Displays a booking summary including itemized subtotals, taxes, discounts, surcharges and totals where applicable.'=>'顯示預訂摘要，包括逐項小計，以及適用的稅金、折扣、附加費和總計。','Distance Values'=>'距離值','Do not import'=>'不匯入','Do not include'=>'不包含','Do you already have an account with us? %s'=>'你已經有我們的帳號了嗎？%s','Document'=>'文件','Documentation'=>'說明文件','Don\'t have it? Leave this blank and we\'ll email you a secure link to choose your booking.'=>'沒有預訂編號嗎？請將此欄留空，我們會寄送安全連結到你的電子郵件，讓你選擇預訂。','Download %s'=>'下載%s','Download featured images given as web addresses'=>'下載以網址形式提供的精選圖片','Draft'=>'草稿','Drafts'=>'草稿','Dropdown Selection'=>'下拉式選單','Due to how we change how this custom taxonomy is displayed when overriding with formats it is strongly advised that you assign a %s page below, which increases compatibility with various plugins and themes.'=>'由於以格式覆蓋時，我們會變更此自訂分類法的顯示方式，強烈建議你在下方指定%s頁面，以提升與各種外掛和佈景主題的相容性。','Duplicate'=>'重複','Duplicate %s'=>'複製%s','Duplicate this event'=>'複製此活動','Duplicating Events and Locations has been disabled by Events Manager, to avoid breaking data. You can use our Events Manager duplication features instead.'=>'為避免資料損毀，Events Manager 已停用活動和地點的複製功能。你可以改用 Events Manager 的複製功能。','Duration'=>'持續時間','During'=>'期間','E-mail'=>'電子郵件地址','E-mail: %s'=>'電子郵件地址: %s','ERROR : Email Not Sent.'=>'錯誤：電子郵件未傳送。','Each event can have its own timezone if enabled. If set to no, then all newly created events will have the blog timezone, which currently is set to %s'=>'啟用後，每場活動都可以有自己的時區。若設為「否」，所有新建立的活動都會使用網站時區，目前設定為 %s','Earlier Dates'=>'較早的日期','Edit'=>'編輯','Edit %s'=>'編輯%s','Edit Booking'=>'編輯預訂','Edit Details'=>'編輯詳細資料','Edit Event'=>'編輯活動','Edit Event Category'=>'編輯活動分類','Edit Event Tag'=>'編輯活動標籤','Edit Location'=>'編輯地點','Edit Recurring Event'=>'編輯週期性活動','Edit Repeating Event'=>'編輯重複活動','Edit User'=>'編輯使用者','Edit events'=>'編輯活動','Edit location'=>'編輯地點','Edit locations'=>'編輯地點','Edit/View'=>'編輯/檢視','Editor'=>'編輯器','Email'=>'電子郵件地址','Email Address'=>'電子郵件地址','Email Exists'=>'電子郵件地址已存在','Email Message'=>'電子郵件訊息','Email Sent.'=>'電子郵件已傳送。','Email Settings'=>'電子郵件設定','Email Subject'=>'電子郵件主旨','Email address'=>'電子郵件地址','Email event owner?'=>'寄送電子郵件給活動擁有者？','Email events admin?'=>'寄送電子郵件給活動管理員？','Email not sent.'=>'電子郵件未寄出。','Email sent successfully to %s'=>'電子郵件已成功寄送至 %s','Email: %s'=>'電子郵件：%s','Emails'=>'電子郵件','Embed Display Type'=>'嵌入顯示類型','Enable'=>'啟用','Enable %s'=>'啟用 %s','Enable %s attributes?'=>'啟用 %s 屬性？','Enable %s custom fields?'=>'啟用 %s 自訂欄位？','Enable All Styling?'=>'啟用所有樣式？','Enable Archives?'=>'啟用彙整？','Enable Code Editor for Formats'=>'啟用格式程式碼編輯器','Enable Comments?'=>'啟用留言？','Enable Dev Updates?'=>'啟用開發版更新？','Enable Event Dynamic Timeslots?'=>'啟用活動動態時段？','Enable Event Status?'=>'啟用活動狀態？','Enable Event Timeslots?'=>'啟用活動時段？','Enable Google Maps integration?'=>'啟用 Google 地圖整合？','Enable No-User Booking Mode?'=>'啟用無使用者預訂模式？','Enable Theme Styling?'=>'啟用佈景主題樣式？','Enable Timezone Support?'=>'啟用時區支援？','Enable Visual Uploader'=>'啟用視覺化上傳工具','Enable a code/syntax highlighter when clicking on the larger formatting textbox options below, for easier editing of larger HTML parts.'=>'點擊下方較大的格式文字方塊選項時，啟用程式碼/語法醒目提示功能，方便編輯較長的 HTML 內容。','Enable a modern visual uploader UI.'=>'啟用現代化的視覺上傳介面。','Enable advanced fields?'=>'啟用進階欄位？','Enable bookings?'=>'啟用預訂？','Enable categories?'=>'啟用分類？','Enable custom event archetypes?'=>'啟用自訂活動原型？','Enable custom ticket ordering?'=>'啟用自訂票券排序？','Enable global tables mode?'=>'啟用全域資料表模式？','Enable locations?'=>'啟用地點？','Enable multiple file uploads by default.'=>'預設啟用多檔案上傳。','Enable or disable each notification type. The event/item owner and managers can further control their own preferences from the mobile app.'=>'啟用或停用各個通知類型。活動/項目擁有者和管理員可以在行動應用程式中進一步控制自己的偏好設定。','Enable organizers?'=>'啟用主辦者?','Enable push notifications?'=>'啟用推播通知？','Enable recurrence?'=>'啟用重複？','Enable registration for this event'=>'啟用此活動的報名功能','Enable repeated events?'=>'啟用重複活動？','Enable right-of-withdrawal button?'=>'啟用撤回權按鈕？','Enable tags?'=>'啟用標籤？','Enabled'=>'已啟用','Enabled (off by default)'=>'已啟用(預設關閉)','Enabled (on by default)'=>'已啟用(預設開啟)','Enables additional advanced search fields such as dates, country, etc.'=>'啟用額外的進階搜尋欄位，例如日期、國家/地區等。','Enabling this will prevent us from loading our CSS file on every page, and will only load on specific pages generated by Events Manager.'=>'啟用後，我們就不會在每個頁面上載入 CSS 檔案，而只會在 Events Manager 產生的特定頁面上載入。','Encryption is always recommended if your SMTP server supports it. If your server supports TLS, this is also the most recommended method.'=>'若你的 SMTP 伺服器支援加密，一律建議使用。如果伺服器支援 TLS，這也是最推薦的方式。','End'=>'結束','End Date'=>'結束日期','End Time'=>'結束時間','End date'=>'結束日期','End time'=>'結束時間','End time is required.'=>'必須填寫結束時間。','Ends in %s'=>'%s 後結束','Enjoying Events Manager? Help Us Improve!'=>'喜歡 Events Manager 嗎？協助我們改進！','Enter a maximum number of spaces (required).'=>'請輸入名額上限 (必填)。','Enter a number.'=>'請輸入數字。','Enter a ticket name.'=>'請輸入票券名稱。','Enter the number of hours before an event starts for when users can cancel a booking. Leave blank for the start time of the event.'=>'輸入活動開始前幾小時，使用者仍可取消預訂。留空則表示至活動開始時間為止。','Enter your booking reference and email to withdraw. No account or login is required.'=>'請輸入預訂編號與電子郵件地址以撤回預訂。不需要帳號或登入。','Error mailing user'=>'寄送電子郵件給使用者時發生錯誤','Error uploading file, please try again!'=>'上傳檔案時發生錯誤，請再試一次！','Errors'=>'錯誤','Event'=>'活動','Event Admin Emails'=>'活動管理員電子郵件','Event Admin/Owner Emails'=>'活動管理員/擁有者電子郵件','Event Approved'=>'活動已核准','Event Bookings Dashboard'=>'活動預訂控制台','Event Cancellation'=>'活動取消','Event Categories'=>'活動分類','Event Category'=>'活動分類','Event Date(s)'=>'活動日期','Event Dates'=>'活動日期','Event Dates '=>'活動日期 ','Event Details'=>'活動詳細資料','Event Edit and Submission Forms'=>'活動編輯與提交表單','Event ID or event ID with timeslot suffix.'=>'活動 ID，或附有時段後綴的活動 ID。','Event ID.'=>'活動 ID。','Event Image'=>'活動圖片','Event List Limits'=>'活動清單上限','Event Location Placeholders'=>'活動地點預留位置','Event Locations'=>'活動地點','Event Manager Options'=>'Events Manager 選項','Event Manager titles'=>'Event Manager 標題','Event Name'=>'活動名稱','Event Options'=>'活動選項','Event Preview Mode'=>'活動預覽模式','Event Published'=>'活動已發佈','Event Re-Submitted'=>'活動已重新提交','Event Reapproved'=>'活動已重新核准','Event Related Placeholders'=>'活動相關預留位置','Event Status'=>'活動狀態','Event Style'=>'活動樣式','Event Submission Forms'=>'活動提交表單','Event Submission Templates'=>'活動提交範本','Event Submitted'=>'活動已提交','Event Submitter Emails'=>'活動提交者電子郵件','Event Summary'=>'活動摘要','Event Tag'=>'活動標籤','Event Tags'=>'活動標籤','Event Tickets Plus sells tickets as WooCommerce products. Linking keeps each booking attached to its original WooCommerce order.'=>'Event Tickets Plus 將票券作為 WooCommerce 商品販售。連結後,每筆預訂將保持關聯其原始 WooCommerce 訂單。','Event Time(s)'=>'活動時間','Event Type'=>'活動類型','Event and venue descriptions'=>'活動和場地說明','Event approved email'=>'活動已核准電子郵件','Event approved subject'=>'活動已核准主旨','Event archives scope'=>'活動彙整範圍','Event attached to %s.'=>'活動已關聯至%s。','Event booking forms'=>'活動預訂表單','Event cancelled'=>'活動已取消','Event cancelled '=>'活動已取消 ','Event categories'=>'活動分類','Event could not be attached.'=>'無法關聯活動。','Event could not be deleted.'=>'無法刪除活動。','Event could not be detached.'=>'無法解除活動關聯。','Event could not be saved.'=>'無法儲存活動。','Event data is invalid.'=>'活動資料無效。','Event detached.'=>'已解除活動關聯。','Event format'=>'活動格式','Event fully booked'=>'活動已額滿','Event is fully booked.'=>'活動已額滿。','Event list scope'=>'活動清單範圍','Event modal preview format'=>'活動彈出視窗預覽格式','Event name'=>'活動名稱','Event not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'找不到活動，因此上傳的圖片未設為其精選圖片。','Event not found.'=>'找不到活動。','Event pages'=>'活動頁面','Event published email'=>'活動已發佈電子郵件','Event published subject'=>'活動已發佈主旨','Event re-attached to %s.'=>'活動已重新關聯至%s。','Event reapproved email'=>'活動重新核准電子郵件','Event reapproved subject'=>'活動重新核准主旨','Event registration and booking management for WordPress. Recurring events, locations, webinars, google maps, rss, ical, booking registration and more!'=>'WordPress 活動報名與預訂管理外掛。支援週期性活動、地點、網路研討會、Google 地圖、RSS、iCal、預訂報名等功能！','Event resubmitted email'=>'活動重新提交電子郵件','Event resubmitted subject'=>'活動重新提交主旨','Event start date/time, location name'=>'活動開始日期/時間、地點名稱','Event style'=>'活動樣式','Event submission notifications will be sent to emails added here.'=>'活動提交通知會寄送到此處新增的電子郵件地址。','Event submitted email'=>'活動已提交電子郵件','Event submitted subject'=>'活動已提交主旨','Event timezones for blog %s have been reset to %s.'=>'部落格 %s 的活動時區已重設為 %s。','Event timezones have been reset to %s.'=>'活動時區已重設為 %s。','Event timezones on all blogs have been reset to %s.'=>'所有部落格的活動時區已重設為 %s。','Event title format'=>'活動標題格式','Event tooltip preview format'=>'活動工具提示預覽格式','Event tooltips format'=>'活動提示格式','Event website'=>'活動網站','Event.'=>'活動。','Event/Location admin pages'=>'活動/地點管理頁面','Eventful Locations?'=>'有活動的地點？','Events'=>'活動','Events Calendar'=>'活動月曆','Events Duration'=>'活動持續時間','Events I\'m Attending'=>'我參加的活動','Events List'=>'活動清單','Events Manager'=>'Events Manager','Events Manager - %s'=>'Events Manager - %s','Events Manager 5.9 introduced timezone functionality, which does not require certain fields in your database. To maintain backwards compatibility with earlier versions, these fields will still be created.'=>'Events Manager 5.9 引入了時區功能，該功能不需要資料庫中的某些欄位。為了與舊版維持向下相容，這些欄位仍會被建立。','Events Manager 6 onwards has optional styling that maximizes consistency accross different themes. If you\'d like your theme to take over in some or all aspects of our plugin, you can disable our styling here.'=>'Events Manager 6 起提供選用的樣式，可讓不同佈景主題間的外觀最大程度保持一致。如果你希望佈景主題接管外掛的部分或所有面向，可以在此停用我們的樣式。','Events Manager Add-ons'=>'Events Manager 附加元件','Events Manager Bookings'=>'Events Manager 預訂','Events Manager Data'=>'Events Manager 資料','Events Manager Management'=>'Events Manager 管理','Events Manager Pro'=>'Events Manager Pro','Events Manager Pro %s has received a major security update. Please <a href="%s">read our announcement</a> and log into your account for upgrade options.'=>'Events Manager Pro %s 已推出重大安全性更新。請<a href="%s">閱讀我們的公告</a>並登入你的帳號查看升級選項。','Events Manager Settings'=>'Events Manager 設定','Events Manager Test Email'=>'Events Manager 測試電子郵件','Events Manager app'=>'Events Manager 應用程式','Events Manager bookings'=>'Events Manager 預訂','Events Manager bookings linked to their WooCommerce orders (Events Manager for WooCommerce)'=>'已連結 WooCommerce 訂單的 Events Manager 預訂(Events Manager for WooCommerce)','Events Manager can copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from %1$s. Nothing in %1$s is changed, so you can check the result before switching it off.'=>'Events Manager 可以複製您在 %1$s 中的活動、場地、主辦者、票券和參加者。%1$s 中的任何內容都不會被變更,因此您可以在將其關閉之前檢查結果。','Events Manager can now show you the latest stable release as soon as it is published, we <b>strongly</b> recommend you do this. Enable this under %1$s. %2$s'=>'Events Manager 現在可以在最新穩定版發佈後立即顯示給你，我們<b>強烈</b>建議你啟用此功能。請在 %1$s 下啟用。%2$s','Events Manager cannot be uninstalled from this site.'=>'無法從此站台解除安裝 Events Manager。','Events Manager for WooCommerce'=>'Events Manager for WooCommerce','Events Manager found events from %s on this site and can copy them, with their venues, organizers, tickets and attendees.'=>'Events Manager 在此網站上發現了來自 %s 的活動,可以將其連同場地、主辦者、票券和參加者一起複製。','Events Manager has been maintained, developed and supported for free since it was released in 2008, positive reviews are one that help us keep going.'=>'Events Manager 自 2008 年發佈以來一直免費維護、開發並提供支援，好評正是支持我們持續前進的動力。','Events Manager has implemented multiple ways to help prevent or reduce these costs drastically, please check our %s page for more information.'=>'Events Manager 已實作多種方法，可大幅避免或降低這些費用，詳情請參閱我們的 %s 頁面。','Events Manager has introduced location types, which can include online locations such as a URL or integrations with webinar platforms such as Zoom! Enable different location types in your settings page, for more information see our %s.'=>'Events Manager 新增了地點類型，包括網址等線上地點，或與 Zoom 等網路研討會平台的整合！請在設定頁面啟用不同的地點類型，詳情請參閱我們的 %s。','Events Manager has introduced new privacy tools to help you comply with international laws such as the GDPR, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a> for more information.'=>'Events Manager 新增了隱私權工具，協助你遵守 GDPR 等國際法規，詳情請<a href="%s">參閱我們的說明文件</a>。','Events Manager has no rule for %1$s, so this was imported as %2$d date.'=>'Events Manager 暫無適用於 %1$s 的規則,因此已將其匯入為包含 %2$d 個日期的清單。','Events Manager has no rule for %s.'=>'Events Manager 暫無適用於 %s 的規則。','Events Manager has no rule for these yet. Such rows are imported as a list of dates, or skipped if you choose that, and the result report names each one.'=>'Events Manager 目前沒有這些規則。此類列將作為日期清單匯入,如果您選擇略過,則會被略過,結果報告會列出每一列。','Events Manager now has a <a href="">mobile app</a> 🥳 🎉, download it now!'=>'Events Manager 現已推出<a href="">行動應用程式</a> 🥳 🎉，立即下載！','Events Manager now supports multiple timezones for your events! Your events will initially match your blog timezone.'=>'Events Manager 現在支援為你的活動設定多個時區！你的活動一開始會與網站時區一致。','Events Manager repeats daily, weekly, monthly on a weekday such as the second Tuesday, and yearly, up to an end date. It has no rule for a day of the month or for ending after a number of times. Either way the result report names each row.'=>'Events Manager 支援每日、每週、在某個星期幾(例如第二個星期二)每月以及每年重複,直至結束日期。它沒有依每月某一天重複或在重複指定次數後結束的規則。無論哪種情況,結果報告都會列出每一列。','Events Manager tools — create and manage events, bookings, locations, tickets and media — for MCP-compatible AI clients.'=>'Events Manager 工具，可供相容 MCP 的 AI 用戶端建立和管理活動、預訂、地點、票券與媒體。','Events Manager validation errors from the last save, if any.'=>'上次儲存時的 Events Manager 驗證錯誤（若有）。','Events Manager was not uninstalled. This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'Events Manager 尚未解除安裝。此網路共用一組活動與預訂資料表，因此從這個站台解除安裝會永久刪除網路中所有站台的活動與預訂。請改從%s解除安裝。','Events Manager\'s permalink settings are changed to match, so links to your events keep working without redirects.'=>'Events Manager 的永久連結設定會隨之變更,因此指向您活動的連結無需重新導向即可繼續使用。','Events Types (Archetypes)'=>'活動類型（原型）','Events With Bookings Enabled'=>'已啟用預訂的活動','Events can choose their own?'=>'活動可以自行選擇嗎?','Events can have a status associated with them, such as a cancelled event, which can then be filtered out of search listings. By default, or if disabled, events have an %s status.'=>'活動可以有相關聯的狀態，例如已取消的活動，之後可從搜尋清單中篩除。預設情況下或停用時，活動的狀態為 %s。','Events can have multiple times per day, the timeslots can be selected from booking forms, timeslots do not have their own event page and are housed under the same event.'=>'活動每天可以有多個時間，時段可從預訂表單中選取，時段沒有自己的活動頁面，而是歸屬於同一場活動之下。','Events cannot start after they end.'=>'活動不能在結束之後才開始。','Events current and next month'=>'本月和下個月的活動','Events date modal preview format'=>'活動日期彈出視窗預覽格式','Events imported from CSV files'=>'從 CSV 檔案匯入的活動','Events list page'=>'活動清單頁面','Events list settings'=>'活動清單設定','Events next month'=>'下個月的活動','Events on %s'=>'%s 的活動','Events page'=>'活動頁面','Events per day'=>'每日活動數','Events require a user to own them. In order to allow events to be submitted anonymously you need to assign that event a specific user. We recommend you create a "Anonymous" subscriber with a very good password and use that. Guests will have the same event permissions as this user when submitting.'=>'活動需要有使用者擁有。為了允許匿名提交活動，你需要為該活動指派特定的使用者。我們建議你建立一個密碼強度很高的「Anonymous」訂閱者並使用該帳號。訪客提交時將擁有與此使用者相同的活動權限。','Events shown'=>'顯示的活動','Events this month'=>'本月的活動','Events this month (today onwards)'=>'本月的活動 (今天起)','Events this week (today to %s)'=>'本週的活動 (今天至 %s)','Events this whole week (%s to %s)'=>'本週整週的活動 (%s 至 %s)','Events with multiple dates will appear on each of those dates in the calendar.'=>'跨多個日期的活動會顯示在月曆中的每一個日期上。','Events with timeslots can further break up timeslots dynamically by adding timeslot durations, buffers and frequencies to create multiple timeslots from one time range. For example, in the mornings, you can have a timeslot every 45 minutes at the start of each hour.'=>'有時段的活動可以透過加入時段長度、緩衝時間和頻率，進一步動態拆分時段，從一個時間範圍建立多個時段。例如在早上，你可以在每個整點開始時，每 45 分鐘設一個時段。','Events within 12 months'=>'12 個月內的活動','Events within 2 months'=>'2 個月內的活動','Events within 3 months'=>'3 個月內的活動','Events within 6 months'=>'6 個月內的活動','Events won\'t recurr on the following dates:'=>'活動不會在下列日期重複：','Every Minute'=>'每分鐘','Everyone'=>'所有人','Everyone else sees the link text without the link. Attendees whose booking includes virtual access get their own join link once the booking is approved. Without bookings, the link is always shown.'=>'其他所有人只會看到沒有連結的連結文字。預訂包含虛擬參與權限的參加者在預訂獲核准後會取得各自的加入連結。沒有預訂時,一律顯示連結。','Everything in Pro'=>'Pro 中的全部功能','Everything in Pro, plus every add-on listed here, on a single license.'=>'Pro 中的全部功能,外加此處列出的所有附加元件,只需一個授權。','Everything on %s is public, so the link appears on the event page and in calendar feeds.'=>'%s 上的所有內容都是公開的,因此連結會顯示在活動頁面和月曆訂閱源中。','Example Input'=>'輸入範例','Example:'=>'範例：','Excerpt'=>'摘要','Exclude %s'=>'排除%s','Exclude Countries'=>'排除的國家/地區','Exclude on'=>'排除於','Exclude taxes from subtotal?'=>'小計不含稅金？','Expand All'=>'全部展開','Export'=>'匯出','Export Bookings'=>'匯出預訂','Export CSV'=>'匯出 CSV','Export Settings'=>'匯出設定','Export these bookings.'=>'匯出這些預訂。','Export your Events Manager settings and restore them here or on another website running this plugin.'=>'匯出你的 Events Manager 設定，並在此處或另一個執行此外掛的網站還原。','Exported on %s'=>'匯出時間：%s','Exporter'=>'匯出程式','Extra class name'=>'額外類別名稱','Failed to write upload to temporary file.'=>'無法將上傳內容寫入暫存檔。','Fallback panels'=>'備援面板','Featured'=>'精選','Featured (yes or no)'=>'精選(yes 或 no)','Featured image (web address or media ID)'=>'精選圖片(網址或媒體 ID)','Fields marked * are needed. A field can be given to one column only.'=>'標有 * 的欄位為必填。一個欄位只能指定給一欄。','File'=>'檔案','File Type'=>'檔案類型','File upload is required'=>'必須上傳檔案','File upload is required.'=>'必須上傳檔案。','Finalize Timezones Upgrade'=>'完成時區升級','Find more dates from the calendar.'=>'從月曆中尋找更多日期。','Finished'=>'已完成','Finishing'=>'正在完成','First Name'=>'名字','First page'=>'第一頁','First row'=>'第一列','For monthly: first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'適用於 monthly:first、second、third、fourth 或 last。','For more information see our %s.'=>'詳情請參閱我們的%s。','For more information see our <a href="%s">data privacy documentation</a>.'=>'如需更多資訊，請參閱我們的<a href="%s">資料隱私權文件</a>。','For multiple emails, separate by commas (e.g. email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.)'=>'若有多個電子郵件地址，請以逗號分隔（例如 email1@test.com,email2@test.com,etc.）','For use with the %s placeholder'=>'搭配 %s 預留位置使用','For weekly: one or more, such as Mon, Wed. For monthly: one, used with the week of the month.'=>'適用於 weekly:一個或多個,例如 Mon、Wed。適用於 monthly:一個,與當月的第幾週搭配使用。','For when start/end %s are present, this will separate the two (include spaces here if necessary).'=>'當同時有開始/結束%s時，用來分隔兩者（必要時請在此加入空格）。','Force network-defined list (no subsite choice)'=>'強制使用網路定義的清單（子網站無法選擇）','Formatting'=>'格式化','Found %d orphaned events, deleted %d successfully'=>'找到 %d 個孤立活動，已成功刪除 %d 個','Found in %s'=>'在 %s 中找到','Free'=>'免費','Free companion plugins'=>'免費搭配外掛','Free plugins from the Events Manager team, available on WordPress.org.'=>'Events Manager 團隊提供的免費外掛,可在 WordPress.org 取得。','Frequency'=>'頻率','From '=>'從 ','From %1$s to %2$s'=>'從 %1$s 到 %2$s','From %s a year'=>'每年 %s 起','Front-end management pages'=>'前台管理頁面','Full Calendar Options'=>'FullCalendar 選項','Full-Size Calendar'=>'全尺寸月曆','Fully Booked'=>'已額滿','Fully booked'=>'已額滿','Further Information'=>'進一步資訊','Future'=>'未來','Future Events Only?'=>'僅顯示未來活動？','Future events'=>'未來的活動','Future events only'=>'僅顯示未來活動','Gather panels that can\'t run in the canvas into a tabbed "Event Details" box'=>'將無法在畫布中執行的面板集中到分頁式的「活動詳細資料」方塊中','General'=>'一般','General JS'=>'一般 JS','General Options'=>'一般選項','General settings'=>'一般設定','Geolocation Search'=>'地理位置搜尋','Get %s'=>'取得%s','Get booking'=>'取得預訂','Get booking requirements'=>'取得預訂需求','Get event'=>'取得活動','Get event availability'=>'取得活動名額狀況','Get location'=>'取得地點','Get ticket'=>'取得票券','Getting Help for Events Manager'=>'取得 Events Manager 的協助','Give each date of a recurring event its own meeting link'=>'為週期性活動的每個日期提供各自的會議連結','Give the file to import with --file=<path>.'=>'使用 --file=<path> 指定要匯入的檔案。','Global %s slug'=>'全域%s代稱','Global Map Format'=>'全域地圖格式','Google Calendar'=>'Google 日曆','Google Map Type'=>'Google 地圖類型','Google Maps API Browser Key'=>'Google Maps API 瀏覽器金鑰','Google Maps API provides you with ways to display maps of your locations and help site visitors find events near their desired locations.'=>'Google Maps API 可讓你顯示地點的地圖，並協助網站訪客尋找他們想要的地點附近的活動。','Google Maps Style'=>'Google 地圖樣式','Google Maps Styling Wizard'=>'Google 地圖樣式精靈','Google Maps and Location Services'=>'Google 地圖與定位服務','Google Maps require an API key, please see our %s page for instructions on obtaining one.'=>'Google 地圖需要 API 金鑰，取得方式請參閱我們的%s頁面。','Google has introduced new pricing for displaying maps on your site. If you have moderate traffic levels, this may likely affect you with surprise and unexpected costs!'=>'Google 針對在你的網站上顯示地圖推出了新的定價。如果你的流量中等，這可能會讓你意外面臨未預期的費用！','Google may charge you for usage, depending on how much traffic your site receives. For more information about how and where Events Manager uses the Google Maps API, and how to manage costs, please see our %s page.'=>'Google 可能會依據你網站的流量向你收取使用費用。如需 Events Manager 如何以及在何處使用 Google Maps API，以及如何管理費用的詳細資訊，請參閱我們的%s頁面。','Google offers different map displays, each with varying prices and free usage allowance. See our %s page for more information on these display options.'=>'Google 提供不同的地圖顯示方式，各自有不同的價格和免費使用額度。如需這些顯示選項的詳細資訊，請參閱我們的%s頁面。','Grid'=>'格狀','Group By'=>'分組依據','Group Events'=>'群組活動','Group Ownership'=>'群組擁有權','Grouped Lists'=>'分組清單','Grouped Lists View'=>'分組清單檢視','Grouped list default'=>'分組清單預設值','Grouped list format'=>'分組清單格式','Grouped list header'=>'分組清單標題','Guest Default User'=>'訪客預設使用者','Guest User'=>'訪客使用者','Guest Users'=>'訪客','HTML Allowed.'=>'允許使用 HTML。','HTML allowed.'=>'允許使用 HTML。','HTML entity-decoded shortcode content will be sanitized after being decoded, we STRONGLY recommend leaving this enabled.'=>'經 HTML 實體解碼的短代碼內容會在解碼後進行清理，我們強烈建議保持啟用。','HTML is not accepted.'=>'不接受 HTML。','Headings'=>'標題','Help'=>'使用說明','Here you can disable individual item styling eompletely or just allow basic styling. Basic styling will try to impose general structuring (such as calendar structures) but won\'t use our Strict styling rules.'=>'你可以在此完全停用個別項目的樣式，或僅允許基本樣式。基本樣式會嘗試套用一般結構（例如月曆結構），但不會使用我們的嚴格樣式規則。','Hidden Links'=>'隱藏連結','Hidden by default?'=>'預設隱藏？','Hidden from listings (yes or no)'=>'在清單中隱藏(yes 或 no)','Hidden from upcoming'=>'在即將舉行的活動中隱藏','Hidden link text'=>'隱藏連結文字','Hidden links'=>'隱藏連結','Hide'=>'隱藏','Hide Advanced Options'=>'隱藏進階設定','Hide Advanced Search'=>'隱藏進階搜尋','Hide Search'=>'隱藏搜尋','Hide form until tickets selected?'=>'選取票券前隱藏表單？','Hide label'=>'隱藏標籤','Hide link until %s minutes before the event starts'=>'在活動開始前 %s 分鐘之前隱藏連結','Hide on %s screen size?'=>'在%s螢幕尺寸時隱藏？','Hold spaces while booking?'=>'預訂時保留名額？','Hold time'=>'保留時間','Holds'=>'保留','Host account'=>'主辦帳號','Hosted by %s'=>'主辦者:%s','Hours'=>'小時','How events appear on each calendar day: a labelled pill per event, a single dot, one dot per event (up to the day limit), or a coloured ring around the date. Override per calendar with the %s parameter.'=>'活動在每個月曆日期上的呈現方式：每個活動一個帶標籤的膠囊、單一圓點、每個活動一個圓點（最多至每日上限），或日期周圍的彩色圓環。可使用 %s 參數針對個別月曆覆寫。','How long before an event can users cancel?'=>'使用者最晚可在活動前多久取消？','How many minutes before an event starts its link is shown, when the event has no time of its own.'=>'當活動沒有自己的時間時,在活動開始前多少分鐘顯示其連結。','How many minutes the picked spaces are held for a visitor who has not submitted their booking yet.'=>'尚未送出預訂的訪客，其選取的名額會保留多少分鐘。','How the first rows will import with the columns and options as last previewed. Nothing has been saved yet.'=>'依最近預覽的欄位和選項,前幾列的匯入效果如下。尚未儲存任何內容。','However, there were some problems whilst sending confirmation emails to you and/or the event contact person. You may want to contact them directly and letting them know of this error.'=>'不過，傳送確認電子郵件給你和/或活動聯絡人時發生了一些問題。建議你直接聯絡對方，告知此錯誤。','Hundreds of free hours have gone into making this free plugin, show your support and add a small link to the plugin website at the bottom of your event pages.'=>'這個免費外掛投入了數百小時的心血，歡迎在活動頁面底部加上外掛網站的小連結來表示支持。','Hybrid'=>'混合','Hybrid (Physical/Virtual)'=>'混合(實體/虛擬)','Hybrid Venue (Physical/Virtual)'=>'混合場地(實體/虛擬)','I consent to my submitted data being collected and stored as outlined by the site %s.'=>'我同意本網站 %s 所述的方式收集並儲存我送出的資料。','I consent to the use of my provided contact information for communication purposes.'=>'我同意使用我提供的聯絡資訊進行聯繫。','I hereby withdraw from the contract for the following booking: %1$s (#%2$d).'=>'我在此撤回以下預訂的契約：%1$s (#%2$d)。','ID'=>'ID','IP: %s'=>'IP：%s','Icon to appear in dashboard admin menu for this Archetype. Accepts URLs to PNG/SVG images, %s or leave blank for default.'=>'此原型在後台管理選單中顯示的圖示。可接受 PNG/SVG 圖片網址、%s，或留空使用預設圖示。','If File Type is also set, only these extensions within the permitted File Type will be permitted.'=>'如果同時設定了檔案類型，則只有在允許的檔案類型範圍內的這些副檔名會被接受。','If HTML emails are enabled, br tags will automatically be added for new lines.'=>'啟用 HTML 電子郵件時，會自動在換行處加入 br 標籤。','If a booking exists for that email address, we have sent a link to manage your withdrawal. Please check your inbox.'=>'若該電子郵件地址有預訂記錄，我們已寄出管理撤回的連結。請檢查你的收件匣。','If a booking is made and an email cannot be sent, this is added to the success message.'=>'預訂完成但無法寄出電子郵件時，會將此訊息加到成功訊息中。','If a calendar day has only one event, you can force a direct link to the event (recommended to avoid duplicate content).'=>'若某個月曆日期只有一個活動，你可以強制直接連結至該活動（建議使用，以避免重複內容）。','If a user has not previously given or revoked consent for a specific submitted data type (such as bookings), do we assume user has given consent by default?'=>'若使用者先前未針對特定提交的資料類型（例如預訂）給予或撤銷同意，是否預設視為使用者已同意？','If already attending and double bookings are disabled, this message will be displayed, followed by a link to the users booking page.'=>'如果使用者已報名參加且已停用重複預訂，將顯示此訊息，後面接著前往使用者預訂頁面的連結。','If an event does not have a category assigned when editing, this one will be assigned automatically.'=>'如果活動在編輯時未指派分類，就會自動指派此分類。','If an event is cancelled, the following actions can be taken upon cancellation.'=>'活動取消時，可以採取以下動作。','If an event is cancelled, you can exclude them from event lists. You can display cancelled events in shortcode using the %s parameter.'=>'如果活動已取消，你可以將其從活動清單中排除。你可以使用 %s 參數在短代碼中顯示已取消的活動。','If an event lasts all day, this text will show if using the %s placeholder'=>'若活動持續一整天，使用 %s 預留位置時會顯示此文字','If checked every booking must select one or the minimum number of this ticket.'=>'勾選後，每筆預訂都必須選擇一張此票券，或達到此票券的最低數量。','If enabled replies to these automated emails will be sent to the person who made the booking. This takes precedence over the event owner Reply-To.'=>'啟用後，這些自動寄出之電子郵件的回信會寄給完成預訂的人。此設定優先於活動擁有者的 Reply-To。','If enabled replies to these automated emails will, by default, be sent to the email of the event owner.'=>'啟用後，這些自動寄出之電子郵件的回信預設會寄到活動擁有者的電子郵件地址。','If enabled, Events Manager checks WordPress.org directly for the latest stable release rather than waiting for the staggered update rollout, which can take up to 24 hours. Releases found this way are shown for a manual update only and are never auto-installed, unless you define the %1$s constant. %2$s'=>'啟用後，Events Manager 會直接向 WordPress.org 檢查最新的穩定版本，而不是等待分批推出的更新（最多可能需要 24 小時）。以這種方式找到的版本僅會提示手動更新，絕不會自動安裝，除非你定義了 %1$s 常數。%2$s','If enabled, fully booked timeslots remain visible but cannot be selected.'=>'啟用後，已額滿的時段仍會顯示，但無法選取。','If enabled, guest visitors can supply an email address and a user account will automatically be created for them along with their booking. They will be also be able to log back in with that newly created account.'=>'啟用後，訪客可以提供電子郵件地址，系統會在預訂時自動為其建立使用者帳號，之後他們也能使用這個新建立的帳號重新登入。','If enabled, the entire booking form will show once a space is selected, or if an ticket is already pre-selected with minimum spaces.'=>'啟用後，只有在選取名額，或已預先選取具有最低名額的票券時，才會顯示整個預訂表單。','If enabled, the latest dev version will always be checked instead of the latest stable version of the plugin.'=>'啟用後，將一律檢查最新的開發版本，而非外掛的最新穩定版本。','If enabled, the spaces a visitor picks on the booking form are held for them while they fill in the rest of the form, so nobody else can take them before they submit. Held spaces count as taken for everyone else until the booking is submitted or the hold runs out. A hold can be no larger than one booking, so set a maximum number of spaces per booking on your events or tickets to limit how much of an event one visitor can hold.'=>'啟用後，訪客在預訂表單上選取的名額會在其填寫其餘表單時為其保留，避免他人在送出前搶先預訂。在預訂送出或保留時間結束前，保留的名額對其他人而言視為已被佔用。保留的名額不能超過一筆預訂，因此請在活動或票券上設定每筆預訂的名額上限，以限制單一訪客可保留活動的多少名額。','If enabled, users can book an event more than once.'=>'啟用後，使用者可以重複預訂同一個活動。','If enabled, users can cancel their bookings themselves from their bookings page.'=>'啟用後，使用者可以從自己的預訂頁面自行取消預訂。','If guests cannot make bookings, they will be asked to register in order to book. However, enabling this will still show available tickets.'=>'如果訪客無法預訂，系統會要求他們先註冊才能預訂。不過，啟用此項後仍會顯示可用的票券。','If inclusion rules are entered above, this setting is ignored.'=>'若上方已輸入包含規則，則會忽略此設定。','If left blank, no emails will be sent. Separate emails with commas for more than one email.'=>'若留空，將不會寄出任何電子郵件。若有多個電子郵件地址，請以逗號分隔。','If left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'若留空，將使用預設值。','If left blank, this email will not be sent.'=>'若留空，將不會寄出此電子郵件。','If set to yes the capabilities will be applied all your network blogs and you will not be able to set custom capabilities each blog. You can select no later and visit specific blog settings pages to add/remove capabilities.'=>'設為「是」時，權限會套用到網路中的所有部落格，且你將無法為各部落格設定自訂權限。你之後可以改選「否」，再前往特定部落格的設定頁面新增/移除權限。','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of events.'=>'若設為「是」，活動清單上方會顯示搜尋表單。','If set to yes, a search form will appear just above your list of locations.'=>'設為「是」時，地點清單上方會顯示搜尋表單。','If set to yes, advanced search fields can toggled by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'若設為是，可點擊「進階搜尋」圖示來切換進階搜尋欄位。','If set to yes, advanced search fields will be hidden by default and can be revealed by clicking the "Advanced Search" icon.'=>'若設為是，進階搜尋欄位預設會隱藏，並可點擊「進階搜尋」圖示來顯示。','If set to yes, full sized images will be used and HTML width and height attributes will be used to determine the size.'=>'若設為「是」，將使用完整尺寸的圖片，並以 HTML 的寬度和高度屬性決定大小。','If set to yes, the FullCalendar will be used instead of the standard calendar on the events page.'=>'設為「是」時，活動頁面將使用 FullCalendar 取代標準月曆。','If set to yes, your emails will be sent in HTML format, otherwise plaintext.'=>'設為「是」時，電子郵件會以 HTML 格式寄出，否則為純文字。','If set, the total number of spaces for a single booking to this event cannot exceed this amount.'=>'設定後，單筆預訂此活動的名額總數不得超過此數量。','If syncing is turned on for a booking status below, when a user RSVPs, the booking status will automatically be changed along with RSVP status.'=>'如果下方針對某個預訂狀態開啟了同步，當使用者回覆出席時，預訂狀態會隨著回覆出席狀態自動變更。','If the booking is free, this will be displayed instead of the %s heading.'=>'如果預訂免費，將顯示此標題，而不是 %s 標題。','If the consent checkbox is not checked during a booking, this error will be returned.'=>'若預訂時未勾選同意核取方塊，將傳回此錯誤。','If the consent checkbox is not checked when submitting information such as events or locations, this error will be returned.'=>'若提交活動或地點等資訊時未勾選同意核取方塊，將傳回此錯誤。','If the user made a previous booking and cannot double-book.'=>'使用者先前已預訂且不能重複預訂時。','If the user tries to make a booking with spaces that exceeds the maximum number of spaces per booking.'=>'使用者嘗試預訂的名額超過每筆預訂的名額上限時。','If the user tries to make a booking without requesting any spaces.'=>'使用者嘗試在未要求任何名額的情況下進行預訂時。','If there are any new updates, you should now see them in your Plugins or Updates admin pages.'=>'若有任何新的更新，你現在應該會在「外掛」或「更新」管理頁面中看到。','If there are member-only tickets, you can choose whether or not to show these tickets to guests.'=>'如果有會員專屬票券，你可以選擇是否向訪客顯示這些票券。','If there\'s no fields to show in the main search section, this button will be used instead at the bottom of the advanced fields.'=>'若主要搜尋區段沒有可顯示的欄位，則會改為在進階欄位底部使用此按鈕。','If this is incorrect, click cancel and try a more specific address.'=>'若這不正確，請按一下取消，並嘗試更精確的地址。','If translations are left blank, the default value will be used.'=>'若翻譯留空，將使用預設值。','If viewing a page for events on a specific date, this is the title that would show up. To insert date values, use <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP time format characters</a>  with a <code>#</code> symbol before them, i.e. <code>#m</code>, <code>#M</code>, <code>#j</code>, etc.<br/>'=>'檢視特定日期的活動頁面時，會顯示此標題。若要插入日期值，請使用 <a href="http://www.php.net/manual/en/function.date.php">PHP 時間格式字元</a>，並在前方加上 <code>#</code> 符號，例如 <code>#m</code>、<code>#M</code>、<code>#j</code> 等。<br/>','If you are experiencing errors when trying to use any of these accounts, try disconnecting and connecting again.'=>'如果在使用任何這些帳號時發生錯誤，請嘗試中斷連線後重新連線。','If you change time patterns such as start times or durations, any previously created timeslots falling outside the new settings will be %s.'=>'若你變更開始時間或持續時間等時間模式，落在新設定外的先前建立的時段將被%s。','If you choose \'Pages\' then %s will be shown using your theme default page template, alternatively choose from page templates that come with your specific theme.'=>'如果你選擇「頁面」，%s 將使用佈景主題的預設頁面範本顯示，或者你也可以從特定佈景主題附帶的頁面範本中選擇。','If you choose a group by mode, your events page will display events in groups of your chosen time range.'=>'若選擇分組方式，活動頁面會依你選擇的時間範圍將活動分組顯示。','If you choose the Event post type whilst Events Manager is activated, you can also visit the <a href="%s">Events Manager settings page</a> for a few more options when displaying event information on your calendar.'=>'若你在啟用 Events Manager 的情況下選擇活動文章類型，也可以前往 <a href="%s">Events Manager 設定頁面</a>，查看在月曆上顯示活動資訊的更多選項。','If you choose to cancel your event, after you save this event, no further bookings will be possible for this event.'=>'如果你選擇取消活動，在儲存此活動後，將無法再對此活動進行預訂。','If you collect personal data, you may want to request their consent. The options below will automatically add checkboxes requesting this consent.'=>'若你收集個人資料，可能需要取得他們的同意。以下選項會自動加入要求此同意的核取方塊。','If you could spare a few minutes, we would appreciate it if you could please leave us a review.'=>'若你能撥冗幾分鐘，我們將非常感謝你為我們留下評論。','If you disable locations, bear in mind that you should remove your location page, shortcodes and related placeholders from your <a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">formats</a>.'=>'如果停用地點，請記得從<a href="#formats" class="nav-tab-link" rel="#em-menu-formats">格式</a>中移除你的地點頁面、短代碼和相關預留位置。','If you enable tips, this information will be shown, which can include HTML.'=>'若啟用提示，將顯示此資訊，其中可包含 HTML。','If you extend or add more dates, the new recurrences will be added to your recurrence set without affecting previously created ones.'=>'若你延長日期範圍或新增更多日期，新的重複項目將加入你的重複組合，不會影響先前建立的項目。','If you extend or add more times, this will not affect previous timeslots.'=>'若你延長時間或新增更多時間，不會影響先前的時段。','If you get a lot of pending bookings and you decide to allow more bookings than spaces allow, setting this to yes will allow you to override the event space limit when manually approving.'=>'如果你有大量待審閱的預訂，並決定接受超過名額的預訂，將此項設為是，即可在手動核准時略過活動名額上限。','If you hare happy with the migration, you can dismiss this message and your old formatting options (i.e. this undo option) will be deleted.'=>'若你對遷移結果滿意，可以關閉此訊息，你的舊格式選項 (即此復原選項) 將被刪除。','If you just want to deactivate the plugin, <a href="%s">go to your plugins page</a>.'=>'如果你只是想停用外掛，請<a href="%s">前往外掛頁面</a>。','If you modify the dates where recurrences will not occur on, any recurrences falling within these dates will be %s. New recurrences will be created if you remove unavailable dates which previously blocked recurrnce dates.'=>'若你修改不重複的日期，落在這些日期內的重複項目將被%s。若你移除先前阻擋重複日期的不開放日期，則會建立新的重複項目。','If you prefer a ticket table like with multiple tickets, even for single ticket events, enable this.'=>'如果你希望即使是單一票券的活動，也像多張票券時一樣顯示票券表格，請啟用此項。','If you select a default country, that will be pre-selected when creating a new location.'=>'如果你選取預設國家/地區，建立新地點時會預先選取該國家/地區。','If you shorten the date range or limit your recurrence dates, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be %s.'=>'若你縮短日期範圍或限制重複日期，落在新日期範圍外的重複項目將被%s。','If you update this event data and save, it could get overwritten if you edit the repeating event template. To make it an independent, <a href="%s">detach it</a>.'=>'如果你更新並儲存此活動資料，在你編輯重複活動範本時可能會被覆寫。若要使其獨立，請<a href="%s">解除關聯</a>。','If you use the %s <a href="%s">shortcode</a>, you can display a map of all your locations and events, the settings below will be used.'=>'如果你使用 %s <a href="%s">短代碼</a>，就能顯示所有地點和活動的地圖，並會套用以下設定。','If you use the <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">placeholder</a> when displaying individual event and location information, the settings below will be used.'=>'如果在顯示個別活動和地點資訊時使用 <code>#_LOCATIONMAP</code> <a href="%s">預留位置</a>，就會套用以下設定。','If you want to edit general options for Events Manager, visit the main %s.'=>'如果你想編輯 Events Manager 的一般選項，請前往主要的%s。','If you would like every event booking confirmation email sent to an administrator write their email here (leave blank to not send an email).'=>'如果你希望每封活動預訂確認電子郵件都寄給管理員，請在此填寫其電子郵件地址（留空則不寄送）。','If you would like to add extra classes to your body html tag when a single %s page is displayed, enter it here. May be useful or necessary if your theme requires special class names for specific templates.'=>'如果你想在顯示單一 %s 頁面時，為 body HTML 標籤加入額外的類別，請在此輸入。如果你的佈景主題需要針對特定範本使用特殊的類別名稱，這可能會很有用或有其必要。','If you would like to disable comments entirely, disable this, otherwise you can disable comments on each single %s. Note that %s with comments enabled will still be until you resave them.'=>'如果你想完全停用留言，請停用此項，否則你可以在每個單一 %s 上停用留言。請注意，已啟用留言的 %s 在你重新儲存之前仍會維持原狀。','If you would like to download a dev version, but just as a one-off, you can force a dev version check by clicking the button below. If there is one available, it should appear in your plugin updates page as a regular update.'=>'如果你只想一次性下載開發版本，可以點擊下方按鈕強制檢查開發版本。若有可用的版本，它會像一般更新一樣出現在外掛更新頁面。','If you would prefer all your locations to belong to your main blog, users in sub-sites will still be able to create locations, but the actual locations are created and reside in the main blog.'=>'如果你希望所有地點都屬於主部落格，子站台的使用者仍可建立地點，但實際的地點會建立並存放在主部落格中。','If you would prefer to hide this page, add %s to your wp-config.php file.'=>'如果您想隱藏此頁面,請將 %s 新增到 wp-config.php 檔案中。','If you\'re using the Google Maps, the more detail you provide, the more accurate Google can be at finding your location. If your address isn\'t being found, please <a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>try it on maps.google.com</a> by adding all the fields below separated by commas.'=>'若你使用 Google 地圖，提供的資料越詳細，Google 就越能準確找到你的地點。若找不到你的地址，請將下方所有欄位以逗號分隔後，<a href=\'http://maps.google.com\'>到 maps.google.com 試試看</a>。','Image'=>'圖片','Image Dimensions'=>'圖片尺寸','Image input must be an attachment ID, URL, or object with source_url / content_base64 / file.'=>'圖片輸入必須是附件 ID、網址，或包含 source_url / content_base64 / file 的物件。','Import'=>'匯入','Import %1$s, %2$s'=>'匯入 %1$s,%2$s','Import Settings'=>'匯入設定','Import a %s'=>'匯入 %s','Import and Migrate'=>'匯入與遷移','Import as'=>'匯入為','Import as a list of dates'=>'匯入為日期清單','Import events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, or copy your events, venues, organizers, tickets and attendees from another events plugin. Either can be rolled back, and the original data is left untouched.'=>'從 CSV 檔案匯入活動、地點或主辦者,或從其他活動外掛複製您的活動、場地、主辦者、票券和參加者。兩種方式都可以還原,原始資料不會被更動。','Import into Events Manager'=>'匯入至 Events Manager','Import/Export Settings'=>'匯入/匯出設定','Imported, with a note'=>'已匯入,附帶說明','Importing rows'=>'正在匯入列','Imports'=>'匯入','Imports events, locations or organizers from a CSV file, one row for each. A repeating event is one row too. Run it, check the result, and roll the import back if it is not what you wanted.'=>'從 CSV 檔案匯入活動、地點或主辦者,每項佔一列。重複活動同樣佔一列。執行匯入,檢查結果,如果不是您想要的,可以還原匯入。','In order to use attributes, you must define some in your templates, otherwise they\'ll never show. Go to Events > Settings > General to add attribute placeholders.'=>'若要使用屬性，你必須先在範本中定義，否則它們不會顯示。請前往「活動」>「設定」>「一般」新增屬性預留位置。','In single ticket mode, users can only create one ticket per event (and will not see options to add more tickets).'=>'在單一票券模式下，使用者每個活動只能建立一張票券（也不會看到新增更多票券的選項）。','In the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>, you\'ll find various textboxes where you can edit how event information looks, such as for event and location lists. Using the placeholders below, you can choose what information should be displayed.'=>'在<a href=\'%s\'>設定頁面</a>中，你會看到多個文字方塊，可用來編輯活動資訊的顯示方式，例如活動與地點清單。你可以使用下方的預留位置來選擇要顯示哪些資訊。','In the boxes below, you are expected to write the page IDs. For multiple pages, use comma-separated values e.g. 1,2,3. Entering 0 means EVERY page, -1 means the home page.'=>'請在以下方塊中填入頁面 ID。多個頁面請使用以逗號分隔的值，例如 1,2,3。輸入 0 代表每個頁面，-1 代表首頁。','In this case, a user can confirm their own booking even if the booking is pending.'=>'在這種情況下，即使預訂仍待審閱，使用者也可以自行確認其預訂。','Include %s'=>'包含%s','Include Countries'=>'包含的國家/地區','Include all'=>'全部包含','Include cancelled events?'=>'包含已取消的活動？','Include in WordPress Searches?'=>'包含在 WordPress 搜尋中？','Include on'=>'包含於','Include only guest submissions'=>'僅包含訪客提交的內容','Include only these %1$s IDs, for multiple values separate by commas such as %2$s.'=>'僅包含這些%1$s ID，若有多個值請以逗號分隔，例如 %2$s。','Include pages where you use shortcode or PHP to display event submission forms.'=>'包含你使用短代碼或 PHP 顯示活動提交表單的頁面。','Include pages where you use shortcodes or widgets to display event search forms.'=>'包含你使用短代碼或小工具顯示活動搜尋表單的頁面。','Include past events'=>'包含過去的活動','Included in %s'=>'包含於 %s','Included with your %s'=>'已包含在您的 %s 中','Includes hybrid events, which can also be attended physically.'=>'包括混合活動,也可以親自到場參加。','Incomplete Bookings'=>'未完成的預訂','Individual Components'=>'個別元件','Individual tickets with remaining spaces will not be available if total booking spaces reach this limit. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'若預訂名額總數達到此上限，即使個別票券仍有剩餘名額也將無法預訂。留空表示不設上限。','Inherit your theme settings'=>'繼承你的佈景主題設定','Initial lengths'=>'起始長度','Inline'=>'內嵌','Insert the address of the notification sender.'=>'輸入通知寄件者的地址。','Insert the display name of the notification sender.'=>'輸入通知寄件者的顯示名稱。','Insert the password to be used to access your SMTP server'=>'輸入用於存取 SMTP 伺服器的密碼','Insert the username to be used to access your SMTP server.'=>'輸入用於存取 SMTP 伺服器的使用者名稱。','Install'=>'安裝','Installed'=>'已安裝','Installed, not active'=>'已安裝,未啟用','Invalid Number'=>'無效的數字','Invalid file upload.'=>'檔案上傳無效。','Invalid interval format for %s'=>'%s 的間隔格式無效','Invalid request'=>'無效的要求','Invalid source URL.'=>'來源網址無效。','Involid token credentials, the folloiwng are missing: %s.'=>'權杖憑證無效，缺少以下項目：%s。','Is consent required?'=>'是否必須同意？','It looks like you have WPML enabled on your site. We advise you also install our extra <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a> plugin which helps the two work better together. <a href="%s">Dismiss message</a>'=>'看來你的網站已啟用 WPML。建議你同時安裝我們的額外外掛 <a href="%s">Events Manager WPML Connector</a>，讓兩者搭配運作得更順暢。<a href="%s">關閉訊息</a>','JavaScript Files'=>'JavaScript 檔案','Join'=>'加入','Join online'=>'線上加入','Keep The Events Calendar\'s web addresses for events, venues, organizers, categories and tags'=>'保留 The Events Calendar 的活動、場地、主辦者、分類和標籤網址','Keep your current settings, or individuall revert to default formats.'=>'保留你目前的設定，或個別還原為預設格式。','Kilometers'=>'公里','Label'=>'標籤','Labels'=>'標籤','Language Booked'=>'預訂語言','Large'=>'大型','Last %d Months'=>'過去 %d 個月','Last Month'=>'上個月','Last Name'=>'姓氏','Last Year'=>'去年','Last checked via %1$s on %2$s.'=>'上次透過 %1$s 於 %2$s 檢查。','Last page'=>'最後一頁','Last sync failed: %s'=>'上次同步失敗:%s','Latitude'=>'緯度','Learn More'=>'瞭解更多','Learn more'=>'瞭解更多','Leave blank for default archetype setting.'=>'留空則使用預設的原型設定。','Leave blank for no limit.'=>'留空表示不設上限。','Leave blank to use the built-in default for your site\'s language.'=>'留空則使用內建的網站語言預設值。','Leave blank to use the default format from Settings.'=>'留空即使用「設定」中的預設格式。','Leave blank to use the default format. Accepts event placeholders such as #_EVENTLINK.'=>'留空則使用預設格式。支援活動預留位置,例如 #_EVENTLINK。','Leave blank to use the default format. Accepts location placeholders such as #_LOCATIONLINK.'=>'留空則使用預設格式。支援地點預留位置,例如 #_LOCATIONLINK。','Leave either blank for no upper/lower limit.'=>'任一欄位留空表示不設上限/下限。','Leave this field empty'=>'請將此欄位留空','License expired'=>'授權已過期','License not activated'=>'授權未啟用','Licensed'=>'已授權','Limit JS file loading?'=>'限制 JS 檔案載入？','Limit loading of our CSS files?'=>'限制載入我們的 CSS 檔案？','Limits the number of events on each calendar day. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'限制每個月曆日期上的活動數量。留空則不限制。','Limits the number of future events shown (0 = unlimited).'=>'限制顯示的未來活動數量（0 = 不限制）。','Line Graph'=>'折線圖','Link'=>'連結','Link Text'=>'連結文字','Link directly to event on day with single event?'=>'單一活動的日期直接連結至活動？','Link sub-site %s directly to sub-site?'=>'將子站台%s直接連結至子站台？','Link text used for link to user bookings.'=>'前往使用者預訂的連結所使用的文字。','List'=>'清單','List %s'=>'列出%s','List Limits'=>'清單數量限制','List bookings'=>'列出預訂','List event tickets'=>'列出活動票券','List events'=>'列出活動','List events by date title'=>'依日期列出活動的標題','List footer format'=>'清單頁尾格式','List header format'=>'清單頁首格式','List item footer format'=>'清單項目頁尾格式','List item format'=>'清單項目格式','List item header format'=>'清單項目頁首格式','List location countries'=>'列出地點國家/地區','List location regions'=>'列出地點區域','List location states'=>'列出地點州/省','List location towns'=>'列出地點鄉鎮市','List locations'=>'列出地點','Load minified %s files?'=>'載入壓縮版 %s 檔案？','Load minified/compressed files, reducing the file size, load times and bandwidth usage on your site.'=>'載入壓縮檔案，以減少檔案大小、載入時間和網站頻寬用量。','Loading Map....'=>'正在載入地圖....','Loading...'=>'載入中…','Loads our own JS file if no other dependencies are already loaded, which is still needed for many items generated by EM using JavaScript such as Calendars, Maps and Booking Forms/Buttons'=>'若沒有載入其他相依性項目，則載入我們自己的 JS 檔案；由 EM 使用 JavaScript 產生的許多項目仍需要此檔案，例如月曆、地圖和預訂表單/按鈕','Location'=>'地點','Location ID.'=>'地點 ID。','Location Image'=>'地點圖片','Location Name'=>'地點名稱','Location Related Placeholders'=>'地點相關預留位置','Location Submission Forms'=>'地點提交表單','Location Type'=>'地點類型','Location Types'=>'地點類型','Location balloon format'=>'地點氣泡格式','Location coordinates'=>'地點座標','Location could not be deleted.'=>'無法刪除地點。','Location could not be saved.'=>'無法儲存地點。','Location data is invalid.'=>'地點資料無效。','Location map and coordinates have been updated. Please re-save your location to update the map.'=>'地點地圖與座標已更新。請重新儲存你的地點以更新地圖。','Location name'=>'地點名稱','Location name and address'=>'地點名稱和地址','Location not found'=>'找不到地點','Location not found, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'找不到地點，因此上傳的圖片未設為其精選圖片。','Location not found.'=>'找不到地點。','Location pages'=>'地點頁面','Locations'=>'地點','Locations imported from CSV files'=>'從 CSV 檔案匯入的地點','Locations list page'=>'地點清單頁面','Locations list settings'=>'地點清單設定','Locations on main blog?'=>'地點放在主部落格？','Locations submitted by guest users are not