無活動訊息','No events with this tag'=>'沒有帶有此標籤的活動','No groups defined yet.'=>'尚未建立任何社團。','No location associated with this event.'=>'此活動沒有關聯的地點。','No locations'=>'沒有地點','No locations have been inserted yet!'=>'尚未新增任何地點！','No locations message'=>'無地點訊息','No responses yet!'=>'尚無回應！','No spaces booked'=>'未預訂任何名額','No supported plugin data was found on this site.'=>'在此網站上找不到支援的外掛資料。','No upcoming dates/times.'=>'沒有即將到來的日期/時間。','No upcoming events'=>'沒有即將舉行的活動','No valid files were uploaded'=>'未上傳任何有效檔案','No-User Booking Mode'=>'無使用者預訂模式','None'=>'無','Not Attending'=>'不出席','Not Required'=>'非必填','Not Supplied'=>'未提供','Not a Group Event'=>'非社團活動','Not approved, spaces full.'=>'未核准，名額已滿。','Not attending any events yet.'=>'尚未參加任何活動。','Not enough spaces'=>'名額不足','Not finished'=>'未完成','Not in sync with the provider'=>'未與服務提供者同步','Not started'=>'尚未開始','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default setting, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'請注意，如果網址衝突，上方指派的 %s 頁面會覆寫此彙整（這是預設設定，也是為了最大程度的外掛相容性而建議的做法）。你可以同時使用兩者，但必須確保頁面和 %s 的代稱不同。','Note that assigning a %s page above will override this archive if the URLs collide (which is the default settings, and is recommended for maximum plugin compatibility). You can have both at the same time, but you must ensure that your page and %s slugs are different.'=>'請注意，若網址衝突，上方指定的%s頁面會覆蓋此彙整頁（這是預設設定，也建議保持不變以獲得最佳外掛相容性）。你可以同時使用兩者，但必須確保頁面和%s的代稱不同。','Note: %s'=>'備註：%s','Notfication email?'=>'通知電子郵件？','Nothing, migrate the tickets only'=>'無,僅遷移票券','Notification sender address'=>'通知寄件者地址','Notification sender name'=>'通知寄件者名稱','Notification types'=>'通知類型','Notify admin email(s)'=>'通知管理員電子郵件','Now there are #_BOOKEDSPACES spaces reserved, #_AVAILABLESPACES are still available.'=>'目前已預訂 #_BOOKEDSPACES 個名額，還剩 #_AVAILABLESPACES 個名額。','Number of events'=>'活動數量','Number of locations'=>'地點數量','OAuth application information incomplete.'=>'OAuth 應用程式資訊不完整。','On'=>'於','On by default hides the link of every virtual event until the default time below. Off by default only hides the link of an event that is given a time of its own.'=>'預設開啟時,會在下方的預設時間之前隱藏每個虛擬活動的連結。預設關閉時,只會隱藏設定了自己時間的活動的連結。','Once a booking has been made, you can also allow a user to RSVP that booking, which confirms their intention of attending. This can be independent of the booking status itself.'=>'完成預訂後，你也可以允許使用者回覆出席該預訂，確認其出席意願。這可以獨立於預訂狀態本身。','Once cancelled, you can allow susers to re-instate their booking, provided there are still enough spaces.'=>'取消後，只要名額仍足夠，你可以允許使用者恢復其預訂。','Once you have entered valid API information, you will see a button below to connect your site to %s.'=>'輸入有效的 API 資訊後，下方會出現一個按鈕，可將你的網站連線到%s。','One Line'=>'單行','Online bookings are not available for this event.'=>'此活動不開放線上預訂。','Only %1$d space is left for %2$s.'=>'%2$s 只剩 %1$d 個名額。','Only show events starting within a certain time limit on the events page. Default is future events with no end time limit.'=>'在活動頁面上只顯示在特定時間限制內開始的活動。預設為未來活動，且沒有結束時間限制。','Only show this link to attendees with virtual access'=>'僅向擁有虛擬參與權限的參加者顯示此連結','Only site admins see these changes.'=>'只有網站管理員會看到這些變更。','Only the selected countries will be included in the country selection list. This takes precedence over excluded countries.'=>'國家/地區選取清單中只會包含所選的國家/地區。此設定優先於排除的國家/地區。','Option value has been reverted. Please save your settings for it to take effect.'=>'選項值已還原。請儲存設定才會生效。','Optional PHP date format for timeslot dates. Leave blank to use the default event date format. Example: %s'=>'時段日期的選填 PHP 日期格式。留空則使用預設的活動日期格式。範例：%s','Optional PHP date format for timeslot times. Leave blank to use the default event time format. Example: %s'=>'時段時間的選填 PHP 日期格式。留空則使用預設的活動時間格式。範例：%s','Options'=>'選項','Order'=>'順序','Order By'=>'排序依據','Order Tickets By'=>'票券排序依據','Order by'=>'排序依據','Order by %s'=>'依%s排序','Order by end date, end time, then event name'=>'依結束日期、結束時間，再依活動名稱排序','Order by event name, then event start time'=>'依活動名稱排序，再依活動開始時間排序','Order by event start time, then event name'=>'依活動開始時間排序，再依活動名稱排序','Order by name'=>'依名稱排序','Order by name, end date, then end time'=>'依名稱、結束日期，再依結束時間排序','Order by name, start date, then start time'=>'依名稱、開始日期，再依開始時間排序','Order by start date, start time'=>'依開始日期、開始時間排序','Order by start date, start time, then event name'=>'依開始日期、開始時間，再依活動名稱排序','Order of the locations'=>'地點順序','Organizer'=>'主辦者','Organizer name'=>'主辦者名稱','Organizer names'=>'主辦者名稱','Organizers'=>'主辦者','Organizers are shared between events and hold contact details. Show them with #_EVENTORGANIZERS or #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST.'=>'主辦者可在多個活動之間共用,並保存聯絡資料。使用 #_EVENTORGANIZERS 或 #_EVENTORGANIZERSLIST 顯示。','Organizers imported from CSV files'=>'從 CSV 檔案匯入的主辦者','Orphaned events may show on your event lists but not point to real event pages, and can be deleted.'=>'孤立活動可能會顯示在你的活動清單中，卻沒有指向實際的活動頁面，這些活動可以刪除。','Other'=>'其他','Our CSS file will be EXCLUDED on all of these pages. Takes precedence over inclusion rules.'=>'我們的 CSS 檔案將排除在所有這些頁面之外。優先於包含規則。','Our CSS file will only be INCLUDED on all of these pages.'=>'我們的 CSS 檔案只會包含在所有這些頁面上。','Our theme has multiple CSS variables that can be overriden easily. The options below could be overriden just as easily via one line of CSS in your %s settings area, for example %s'=>'我們的佈景主題有多個可輕鬆覆寫的 CSS 變數。以下選項同樣可以透過你的%s設定區中的一行 CSS 輕鬆覆寫，例如 %s','Output format (advanced)'=>'輸出格式（進階）','Override Default Formats?'=>'覆寫預設格式？','Override Defaults'=>'覆寫預設值','Override Excerpts with Formats?'=>'以格式覆寫摘要？','Override calendar on events page?'=>'在活動頁面覆蓋月曆？','Override calendar shortcode?'=>'覆蓋月曆短代碼？','Override with Formats?'=>'以格式覆寫？','Overrides the default calendar shortcode. You can also use [events_fullcalendar] instead.'=>'覆蓋預設的月曆短代碼。你也可以改用 [events_fullcalendar]。','Owner'=>'擁有者','PDF tickets and invoices'=>'PDF 票券和發票','PHP mail function'=>'PHP mail 函式','Page heading'=>'頁面標題','Pages'=>'頁面','Pages using TEC shortcodes or blocks'=>'使用 TEC 短代碼或區塊的頁面','Pardon the interruption... we hope you\'re enjoying Events Manager, and if so, we\'d really appreciate a positive review on the wordpress.org repository!'=>'抱歉打擾了... 希望你喜歡 Events Manager，若是如此，我們非常感謝你在 wordpress.org 外掛目錄給予好評！','Parent %s'=>'上層%s','Parent %s:'=>'上層%s：','Parent Event'=>'父層活動','Parent Event Categories'=>'父層活動分類','Parent Event Category:'=>'父層活動分類:','Parent Event Tag:'=>'父層活動標籤:','Parent Event Tags'=>'父層活動標籤','Parent Location'=>'父層地點','Parent Repeating Event'=>'父層重複活動','Password'=>'密碼','Password Lost and Found'=>'找回遺失的密碼','Past'=>'已過期','Past And Present Bookings'=>'過去與目前的預訂','Past Events'=>'過去的活動','Past events'=>'過去的活動','Pause'=>'暫停','Paused'=>'已暫停','Payment Information'=>'付款資訊','Payment and Confirmation'=>'付款與確認','Payments with PayPal, Stripe, Square, Authorize.net or offline'=>'透過 PayPal、Stripe、Square、Authorize.net 或線下付款','Pending'=>'待審閱','Pending Spaces'=>'待處理名額','Pending and Approved'=>'待審閱與已核准','Pending booking email'=>'預訂待審閱電子郵件','Pending reschedule via primary recurrence.'=>'透過主要重複項目待重新排程。','Pending reschedule.'=>'待重新排程。','Pending review'=>'待審閱','Performance Optimization'=>'效能最佳化','Permalink Slug'=>'永久連結代稱','Permalink Slugs'=>'永久連結代稱','Permalink slug must contain only lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens and forward slashes.'=>'永久連結代稱只能包含小寫字母、數字、連字號和斜線。','Permanently deletes an Events Manager booking.'=>'永久刪除 Events Manager 預訂。','Personal Details'=>'個人資料','Personal details have successfully been modified.'=>'個人資料已成功修改。','Phone'=>'電話','Phone Number'=>'電話號碼','Phone Numbers'=>'電話號碼','Phone number'=>'電話號碼','Phone numbers can be used for further contact for both those that make bookings and submit events. We offer an advanced international-compatible phone input field with multiple options which standardize and ensure valid/consistent international phone numbers are provided by your users.'=>'電話號碼可用於進一步聯絡預訂者和活動提交者。我們提供支援國際格式的進階電話輸入欄位，並有多個選項，可標準化並確保使用者提供有效且一致的國際電話號碼。','Physical'=>'實體','Physical Locations'=>'實體地點','Physical Spaces'=>'實體名額','Physical Venue'=>'實體場地','Pie Chart'=>'圓餅圖','Pills'=>'膠囊','Pixelite'=>'Pixelite','Placeholders for customizing event pages'=>'用於自訂活動頁面的預留位置','Placeholders: %1$s and %2$s plus the usual booking placeholders.'=>'預留位置：%1$s 與 %2$s，以及一般的預訂預留位置。','Please <a href="%s">Log In</a> to view your bookings.'=>'請<a href="%s">登入</a>以檢視你的預訂。','Please add a User ID.'=>'請新增使用者 ID。','Please check the communications consent box so we can contact you if necessary.'=>'請勾選聯繫同意方塊，以便我們在必要時與你聯絡。','Please check the consent box so we can collect and store your submitted information.'=>'請勾選同意方塊，以便我們收集並儲存你提交的資訊。','Please choose a virtual platform for this event.'=>'請為此活動選擇虛擬平台。','Please confirm that you wish to withdraw from the following booking. This step submits your declaration of withdrawal.'=>'請確認你要撤回下列預訂。此步驟將提交你的撤回聲明。','Please enter a valid URL for this event location.'=>'請為此活動地點輸入有效的網址。','Please enter a valid URL.'=>'請輸入有效的網址。','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'請輸入有效的電子郵件地址。','Please enter a valid phone number.'=>'請輸入有效的電話號碼。','Please enter a valid ticket price e.g. 10.50 (no currency signs)'=>'請輸入有效的票券價格，例如 10.50（不含貨幣符號）','Please enter dates and times for your first recurrence pattern in the recurrence section.'=>'請在重複區段中輸入第一個重複模式的日期與時間。','Please enter your Location ID, or leave blank for no location.'=>'請輸入你的地點 ID，若無地點請留空。','Please enter your Location ID.'=>'請輸入你的地點 ID。','Please fill in all required fields correctly.'=>'請正確填寫所有必填欄位。','Please provide a dashicons class, url to a png/svg file, or leave blank for default menu icon.'=>'請提供 dashicons 類別、PNG/SVG 檔案的網址，或留空使用預設選單圖示。','Please provide a valid phone number.'=>'請提供有效的電話號碼。','Please provide some link text for this event location URL.'=>'請為此活動地點網址提供連結文字。','Please select a valid location.'=>'請選取有效的地點。','Please select at least one space to proceed with your booking.'=>'請至少選擇一個名額才能繼續預訂。','Please specify what days of the week this event should occur on.'=>'請指定此活動在每週的哪幾天舉行。','Please supply a valid email format.'=>'請提供有效的電子郵件格式。','Please update your network and when you\'re happy with the changes you can also finalize the migration by deleting unecessary data in the %s page.'=>'請更新你的網路，確認變更無誤後，也可以在 %s 頁面刪除不必要的資料來完成遷移。','Please upload a valid txt file containing Events Manager import settings.'=>'請上傳包含 Events Manager 匯入設定的有效 txt 檔案。','Please visit the %s to see migration options.'=>'請前往 %s 查看遷移選項。','Please wait while the booking is being submitted.'=>'預訂送出中，請稍候。','Plural'=>'複數','Plural version of the Custom Post Type (CPT) name, used internally.'=>'自訂文章類型（CPT）名稱的複數版本，供內部使用。','Plural version of the Custom Post Type name, used internally.'=>'自訂文章類型名稱的複數版本，供內部使用。','Plural version of the Type Key, used internally. For example, workshop would be workshops.'=>'類型索引碼的複數版本，供內部使用。例如，workshop 的複數為 workshops。','Popular %s'=>'熱門%s','Popular Event Categories'=>'熱門活動分類','Popular Event Tags'=>'熱門活動標籤','Post Classes'=>'文章類別','Postcode'=>'郵遞區號','Preparing'=>'準備中','Prevent unnecessary loading of JavaScript files on pages where they are not needed.'=>'避免在不需要的頁面上載入不必要的 JavaScript 檔案。','Preview Formats'=>'預覽格式','Preview Start Times'=>'預覽開始時間','Preview mode is enabled. Only site admins will see the difference, our new default formats will be used instead of your current formats. You can continue to edit/save this settings page without overwriting saved settings.'=>'預覽模式已啟用。只有網站管理員會看到差異，系統會使用我們的新預設格式取代你目前的格式。你仍可繼續編輯/儲存此設定頁面，不會覆寫已儲存的設定。','Previous Period'=>'上一期間','Previous Year'=>'去年','Previous page'=>'上一頁','Price'=>'價格','Pricing'=>'價格','Privacy Consent'=>'隱私權同意','Privacy Policy and Consent'=>'隱私權政策與同意','Pro Add-On'=>'Pro 附加元件','Pro installs alongside the free Events Manager plugin. Every license includes one year of updates and Pro support.'=>'Pro 與免費版 Events Manager 外掛一同安裝。每個授權都包含一年的更新和 Pro 支援。','Processing ...'=>'處理中...','Profile'=>'個人資料','Progress'=>'進度','Provide one of `id`, `source_url`, `content_base64`, or a multipart `file` upload.'=>'請提供 `id`、`source_url`、`content_base64` 或多部分 `file` 上傳其中之一。','Published'=>'已發佈','Published Event'=>'已發佈的活動','Push notifications for the <a href="%s">mobile app</a>. When enabled, registered devices receive real-time pushes for bookings and events on this site, and the app exposes per-type notification preferences to the user.'=>'<a href="%s">行動應用程式</a>的推播通知。啟用後，已註冊的裝置會即時收到此網站預訂和活動的推播，且應用程式會向使用者提供各類型通知的偏好設定。','QR code check-in from your phone'=>'用手機掃描 QR code 報到','Quantity'=>'數量','RSS'=>'RSS','RSS Scope'=>'RSS 範圍','RSS description format'=>'RSS 說明格式','RSS limit'=>'RSS 上限','RSS main description'=>'RSS 主說明','RSS main title'=>'RSS 主標題','RSS title format'=>'RSS 標題格式','RSVP'=>'回覆出席','RSVP - %s'=>'回覆出席 - %s','RSVP Modifications'=>'回覆出席修改','RSVP Status'=>'回覆出席狀態','RSVP Syncing'=>'回覆出席同步','Re-Check Updates'=>'重新檢查更新','Re-Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'已重新送出，等待核准的活動','Re-order.'=>'重新排序。','Read more on our blog'=>'在我們的部落格閱讀更多內容','Read our announcement'=>'閱讀我們的公告','Read-only abilities for retrieving Events Manager events, locations, bookings, categories, and tags.'=>'用於擷取 Events Manager 活動、地點、預訂、分類和標籤的唯讀功能。','Reason (optional)'=>'原因 (選填)','Received on: %s'=>'收到時間：%s','Received: %s'=>'收件時間：%s','Recent Bookings'=>'最近的預訂','Recent Events Manager updates have made security improvements to how events are output, specifically with Shortcodes. The result is that some shortcode created prior to these updates will be displayed as raw/escaped HTML rather than content.'=>'近期的 Events Manager 更新強化了活動輸出的安全性，特別是短代碼的部分。因此，在這些更新之前建立的部分短代碼，可能會顯示為原始/跳脫的 HTML，而不是內容。','Reconnect'=>'重新連線','Recurrence %s'=>'重複 %s','Recurrence %s cannot start after they end.'=>'重複項目的%s不能在結束之後才開始。','Recurrence Interval'=>'重複間隔','Recurrences'=>'重複','Recurrences last all day.'=>'重複項目為全天進行。','Recurrences that currently take place within new unavailable dates will be %s'=>'目前落在新不開放日期內的重複項目將被%s','Recurrences will end on:'=>'重複項目的結束時間：','Recurrences will span between:'=>'重複項目的涵蓋期間：','Recurrences will start from:'=>'重複項目的開始時間：','Recurring'=>'週期性','Recurring %s'=>'週期性%s','Recurring Event'=>'週期性活動','Recurring Events'=>'週期性活動','Recurring Events Picker'=>'週期性活動選擇器','Recurring events (Pro)'=>'週期性活動(Pro)','Recurring events allow you to create one event page with recurring dates on the same page. Recurrences have their own bookings assigned to them, but can be linked with shared tickets.'=>'週期性活動可讓你建立一個活動頁面，並在同一頁面上包含重複的日期。每次重複都有各自的預訂，但可以透過共用票券連結。','Recurring events have a picker in order to load the right booking form, choose your picker style for your booking forms.'=>'週期性活動需要選擇器才能載入正確的預訂表單，請為你的預訂表單選擇選擇器樣式。','Redirect any other old addresses, such as single dates of recurring events, series pages and calendar views, once The Events Calendar is deactivated'=>'停用 The Events Calendar 後,重新導向其他舊網址,例如週期性活動的單一日期、系列頁面和月曆檢視','Refresh'=>'重新整理','Region'=>'地區','Region:'=>'區域:','Registration Email Templates'=>'註冊電子郵件範本','Registration Information'=>'註冊資訊','Registration email'=>'註冊電子郵件','Registration email subject'=>'註冊電子郵件主旨','Reject'=>'拒絕','Rejected'=>'已拒絕','Rejected booking email'=>'預訂遭拒絕電子郵件','Remember Me'=>'保持登入','Remember and hide checkbox'=>'記住並隱藏核取方塊','Remember and show checkbox'=>'記住並顯示核取方塊','Remember filtering options'=>'記住篩選選項','Remember these settings'=>'記住這些設定','Remembering Consent'=>'記住同意','Remove'=>'移除','Remove Image'=>'移除圖片','Remove Orphaned Events'=>'移除孤立活動','Remove or reorder columns below.'=>'在下方移除欄位或重新排序。','Remove this recurrence.'=>'移除此重複項目。','Remove this ticket booking'=>'移除此票券預訂','Rename %s?'=>'要重新命名%s嗎？','Renew license'=>'續訂授權','Renew or upgrade'=>'續訂或升級','Repeat a number of times'=>'重複指定次數','Repeat interval "%s" is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'重複間隔「%s」不是大於或等於 1 的整數。','Repeat interval (every 1, 2, 3 ...)'=>'重複間隔(每 1、2、3 ...)','Repeat on day of the month (1 to 31, or last)'=>'在每月的某一天重複(1 至 31,或 last)','Repeat on these dates'=>'在這些日期重複','Repeat on week of the month (first to fourth, or last)'=>'在每月的第幾週重複(first 至 fourth,或 last)','Repeat on weekdays'=>'在星期幾重複','Repeat rules Events Manager does not have'=>'Events Manager 沒有的重複規則','Repeat until (date)'=>'重複至(日期)','Repeat value "%s" is not understood. Use daily, weekly, monthly or yearly.'=>'無法識別重複值「%s」。請使用 daily、weekly、monthly 或 yearly。','Repeated events are similar to recurrences, but each event is independent of each other with its own page on your site and entirely separate bookings. You can mass-edit the recurrences by editing your repeating event.'=>'重複活動與重複類似，但每場活動彼此獨立，在你的網站上有各自的頁面，預訂也完全分開。你可以編輯重複活動來大量編輯各次重複。','Repeating'=>'重複','Repeating %s'=>'重複的%s','Repeating Event'=>'重複活動','Repeating Events'=>'重複活動','Repeating Events Template'=>'重複活動範本','Repeats'=>'重複','Repeats (daily, weekly, monthly or yearly)'=>'重複(daily、weekly、monthly 或 yearly)','Replace TEC shortcodes and blocks in posts and pages with Events Manager equivalents'=>'將文章和頁面中的 TEC 短代碼和區塊取代為 Events Manager 的對應項目','Require locations for events?'=>'活動必須有地點？','Required'=>'必填','Required?'=>'是否必填？','Reschedule'=>'重新排程','Reschedule %s Times?'=>'要重新排程%s時間嗎？','Reschedule Events'=>'重新安排活動','Reschedule Recurrences?'=>'要重新排程重複項目嗎？','Resend Email'=>'重新寄送電子郵件','Reserved unconfirmed spaces?'=>'保留未確認的名額？','Reset'=>'重設','Reset Event Timezones'=>'重設活動時區','Reset Events Manager'=>'重設 Events Manager','Reset Timezones'=>'重設時區','Reset this form to create a location or search again.'=>'重設此表單以建立地點或重新搜尋。','Reset to default value?'=>'重設為預設值？','Resheduled recurrences that fall outside new pattern will be %s'=>'重新排程後落在新模式外的重複項目將被%s','Responsive'=>'響應式','Responsive Behaviour'=>'響應式行為','Restrict to'=>'限制對象','Restrict uploads to a specific type of file. Leave as "Any Type" to allow all.'=>'限制上傳為特定檔案類型。保留為「任何類型」則允許所有類型。','Result'=>'結果','Results per Page'=>'每頁結果數','Resume'=>'繼續','Resume Previous Attempt (All Blogs)'=>'恢復先前的嘗試（所有部落格）','Retrieves Events Manager %s.'=>'擷取 Events Manager %s。','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager events.'=>'擷取經篩選的 Events Manager 活動集合。','Retrieves a filtered collection of Events Manager locations.'=>'擷取經篩選的 Events Manager 地點集合。','Retrieves booking availability, spaces, and ticket availability for one event.'=>'擷取單一活動的預訂名額狀況、名額和票券可用狀況。','Retrieves bookings visible to the current user.'=>'擷取目前使用者可檢視的預訂。','Retrieves one Events Manager %s by ID.'=>'依 ID 擷取一個 Events Manager %s。','Retrieves one Events Manager event by ID.'=>'依 ID 擷取一個 Events Manager 活動。','Retrieves one Events Manager location by ID.'=>'依 ID 擷取一個 Events Manager 地點。','Retrieves one Events Manager ticket by ID.'=>'依 ID 擷取一張 Events Manager 票券。','Retrieves one booking by ID if visible to the current user.'=>'若目前使用者可檢視，則依 ID 擷取一筆預訂。','Retrieves tickets for one Events Manager event.'=>'擷取單一 Events Manager 活動的票券。','Returns countries with their ISO-3166 alpha-2 code and translated display name. By default returns the full ISO list — useful for populating a country picker. Pass `only_available: true` to narrow the result to countries that have at least one stored location row.'=>'傳回國家/地區及其 ISO-3166 alpha-2 代碼和已翻譯的顯示名稱。預設傳回完整的 ISO 清單，適合用來填入國家/地區選擇器。傳入 `only_available: true` 可將結果縮小為至少有一筆已儲存地點資料的國家/地區。','Returns the distinct list of region names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` to narrow results to one country.'=>'傳回 Events Manager 地點中出現的不重複區域名稱清單。傳入 `country` 可將結果縮小至單一國家/地區。','Returns the distinct list of state/province names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country` and/or `region` to narrow results.'=>'傳回 Events Manager 地點中出現的不重複州/省名稱清單。傳入 `country` 和/或 `region` 可縮小結果。','Returns the distinct list of town/city names present in Events Manager locations. Pass `country`, `region`, and/or `state` to narrow results.'=>'傳回 Events Manager 地點中出現的不重複鄉鎮市名稱清單。傳入 `country`、`region` 和/或 `state` 可縮小結果。','Returns the exact fields, payload locations, payment options, and a ready-to-submit example payload needed to create a booking for one event. Call this before create-booking.'=>'傳回為單一活動建立預訂所需的確切欄位、資料位置、付款選項，以及可直接提交的範例資料。請在 create-booking 之前呼叫此功能。','Revert to viewing your previously saved fromats.'=>'還原為檢視先前儲存的格式。','Revoked'=>'已撤銷','Right of Withdrawal (EU)'=>'撤回權（歐盟）','Rings'=>'圓環','Roll back'=>'還原','Rollback'=>'還原','Rolled back'=>'已還原','Row'=>'列','Rows imported'=>'已匯入的列','Rows skipped'=>'已略過的列','Run again (sync changes)'=>'再次執行(同步變更)','Running…'=>'正在執行…','SMTP Encryption'=>'SMTP 加密','SMTP authentication is often needed. If you use Gmail, make sure to set this parameter to Yes'=>'通常需要 SMTP 驗證。如果你使用 Gmail，請務必將此參數設為「是」','SMTP password'=>'SMTP 密碼','SMTP username'=>'SMTP 使用者名稱','Sale Averages'=>'銷售平均值','Sales'=>'銷售額','Same as <em>Date Format</em>, but this is used for the datepickers used by Events Manager.'=>'與<em>日期格式</em>相同，但用於 Events Manager 所使用的日期選擇器。','Same concept as the body classes option, but some themes also use the <code>post_class()</code> function within page content to differentiate styling between post types.'=>'概念與 body 類別選項相同，但部分佈景主題也會在頁面內容中使用 <code>post_class()</code> 函式，來區分不同文章類型的樣式。','Sanitize shortcode content?'=>'要清理短代碼內容嗎？','Save'=>'儲存','Save %d%%'=>'省下 %d%%','Save Changes'=>'儲存設定','Save Settings'=>'儲存設定','Save Ticket'=>'儲存票券','Save imported events and locations as'=>'將匯入的活動和地點儲存為','Save your settings for this to take effect!'=>'請儲存設定以使其生效！','Saved, but the featured image could not be attached: %s. To fix it: call upload-media (use content_base64 if the source blocks server-side fetches, e.g. Unsplash), then either pass featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location on that same upload-media call, or pass the returned attachment id as featured_image to update-event / update-location.'=>'已儲存，但無法附加精選圖片：%s。修正方式：呼叫 upload-media（若來源會阻擋伺服器端擷取，例如 Unsplash，請使用 content_base64），然後在同一個 upload-media 呼叫中傳入 featured_image_for_event/featured_image_for_location，或將傳回的附件 ID 作為 featured_image 傳給 update-event / update-location。','Scope'=>'範圍','Scope of the locations'=>'地點範圍','Scope of the locations?'=>'地點範圍?','Search'=>'搜尋','Search %s'=>'搜尋%s','Search %s...'=>'搜尋 %s...','Search Event Categories'=>'搜尋活動分類','Search Event Tags'=>'搜尋活動標籤','Search Events'=>'搜尋活動','Search Filter Label'=>'搜尋篩選標籤','Search Form'=>'搜尋功能','Search Forms'=>'搜尋表單','Search Locations'=>'搜尋地點','Search Repeating Events'=>'搜尋重複活動','Search Results View Type'=>'搜尋結果檢視類型','Search bookings'=>'搜尋預訂','Search button text'=>'搜尋按鈕文字','Search form will be pre-selected with this country.'=>'搜尋表單會預先選取此國家/地區。','Search forms'=>'搜尋表單','Searching...'=>'搜尋中…','See All'=>'查看全部','See original translation.'=>'查看原始翻譯。','Select Location'=>'選取地點','Select a Timezone to reset all your blog events to.'=>'選取要將所有部落格活動重設為的時區。','Select a blog and click the button next to it to clean up that specific blog. You must clean up one blog at a time.'=>'選取一個部落格並點擊旁邊的按鈕，即可清理該部落格。你必須一次清理一個部落格。','Select a blog...'=>'選取部落格……','Select a date'=>'選擇日期','Select a group you admin to attach this event to it. Note that all other admins of that group can modify the booking.'=>'選取你管理的社團，將此活動附加到該社團。請注意，該社團的其他管理員都能修改此預訂。','Select a time'=>'選擇時間','Select date range'=>'選取日期範圍','Select dates'=>'選取日期','Select number of spaces'=>'選擇名額數量','Select the booking you wish to withdraw from.'=>'請選擇你要撤回的預訂。','Select the editor type you\'d like to use for submitting content in your dashboard.'=>'選取你要在控制台中用來提交內容的編輯器類型。','Select the method to send email notification.'=>'選擇寄送電子郵件通知的方式。','Select the options below and export all the records you have currently filtered (all pages) into a spreadsheet format.'=>'請選取下方選項，將目前已篩選的所有記錄（所有頁面）匯出為試算表格式。','Select the view types a user can select to display on the default search form, you can override this selection using the %s argument in shortcodes and PHP functions.'=>'選取使用者可在預設搜尋表單中選擇顯示的檢視類型，你可在短代碼與 PHP 函式中使用 %s 引數覆寫此選擇。','Select which archetypes this site will use and choose a default type.'=>'選取此網站要使用的原型，並選擇預設類型。','Select yes to allow bookings and tickets for events.'=>'選擇「是」可允許活動的預訂和票券。','Select yes to disable Events Manager from enabling thumbnails (some themes may already have this enabled, which we cannot be turned off here).'=>'選擇「是」可停止 Events Manager 啟用縮圖（部分佈景主題可能已啟用此功能，而我們無法在此關閉）。','Select yes to enable the attributes feature'=>'選擇「是」可啟用屬性功能','Select yes to enable the category features'=>'選擇「是」可啟用分類功能','Select yes to enable the tag features'=>'選擇「是」可啟用標籤功能','Select yes to select location from a drop-down menu; location selection will be faster, but you will lose the ability to insert locations with events'=>'選擇「是」可從下拉選單中選取地點；地點選取會更快，但你將無法隨活動一併插入地點','Sell event tickets through your WooCommerce cart and checkout, with bookings kept in sync with orders, and take payment with any gateway WooCommerce supports. Sold separately on Woo.com and not included in Pro Plus.'=>'透過 WooCommerce 購物車和結帳販售活動票券,預訂與訂單保持同步,並可使用 WooCommerce 支援的任何金流收款。在 Woo.com 單獨販售,不包含在 Pro Plus 中。','Send Email'=>'寄送電子郵件','Send HTML Emails?'=>'寄送 HTML 電子郵件？','Send cancelled booking email?'=>'寄送預訂取消電子郵件？','Sends a general email to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled, which is customized in your %s setings.'=>'對已取消活動的所有已確認和待審閱預訂，寄送一封一般電子郵件，內容可在你的 %s 設定中自訂。','Sent to the consumer as the legally-required acknowledgment of receipt. It records the withdrawal statement and the exact date and time of receipt, and confirms receipt only — not the validity of the withdrawal.'=>'會傳送給消費者，作為法律要求的收件通知。內容記錄撤回聲明及收件的確切日期與時間，僅確認已收到，不代表撤回有效。','Separate %s with commas'=>'以逗號分隔%s','Separate Range Inputs?'=>'分開的範圍輸入欄位？','Separate event categories with commas'=>'以逗號分隔活動分類','Separate event tags with commas'=>'以逗號分隔活動標籤','Series pass, paid with booking #%d'=>'系列通行證,透過預訂 #%d 付款','Server API Credentials'=>'伺服器 API 憑證','Set booking status'=>'設定預訂狀態','Setting this to no will allow you to submit events without locations. You can use the <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> or <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> conditional placeholder to selectively display location information.'=>'設為「否」可讓你提交沒有地點的活動。你可以使用 <code>{no_location}...{/no_location}</code> 或 <code>{has_location}..{/has_location}</code> 條件預留位置，選擇性地顯示地點資訊。','Setting this to yes will also make your images crop efficiently with the %s feature in the %s plugin.'=>'將此項設為「是」，也能讓你的圖片搭配 %s 外掛中的 %s 功能有效率地裁剪。','Setting this to yes will make all events save in the main site event tables (EM must also be activated). This allows you to share events across different blogs, such as showing events in your network whilst allowing users to display and manage their events within their own blog. Bear in mind that activating this will mean old events created on the sub-blogs will not be accessible anymore, and if you switch back they will be but new events created during global events mode will only remain on the main site.'=>'設為「是」會讓所有活動都儲存在主站台的活動資料表中（Events Manager 也必須在主站台啟用）。這能讓你在不同部落格之間共用活動，例如在網路中展示活動，同時讓使用者在自己的部落格內顯示與管理活動。請注意，啟用後，先前在子部落格建立的舊活動將無法再存取；若切換回來，舊活動即可再次存取，但在全域活動模式下建立的新活動只會保留在主站台。','Setting this to yes will make categories display as a page rather than an archive.'=>'設為「是」會讓分類以頁面而非彙整頁的方式顯示。','Settings'=>'設定','Settings > Emails'=>'設定 > 電子郵件','Settings Page'=>'設定頁面','Settings have been reset back to default. Your events, locations and categories have not been modified.'=>'設定已重設為預設值。你的活動、地點與分類並未被修改。','Settings imported.'=>'設定已匯入。','Shortcode HTML Entity Decoding'=>'短代碼 HTML 實體解碼','Shortcodes and blocks'=>'短代碼和區塊','Shorten the calendar headings containing the days of the week, use 0 for the full name.'=>'縮短包含星期的月曆標題，輸入 0 則顯示全名。','Show'=>'顯示','Show "all events" link at bottom'=>'在底部顯示「所有活動」連結','Show Advanced Options'=>'顯示進階設定','Show Advanced Search'=>'顯示進階搜尋','Show Flags'=>'顯示旗幟','Show Long Events?'=>'顯示長期活動？','Show Search'=>'顯示搜尋','Show Selected Dialcode'=>'顯示所選的國際電話區碼','Show all events link'=>'顯示所有活動連結','Show all events link at bottom?'=>'在底部顯示「所有活動」連結？','Show categories?'=>'顯示分類？','Show countries?'=>'顯示國家/地區？','Show date range?'=>'顯示日期範圍？','Show dates in timeslots?'=>'在時段中顯示日期？','Show distance options?'=>'顯示距離選項？','Show events search?'=>'顯示活動搜尋？','Show footer link?'=>'顯示頁尾連結？','Show form again?'=>'再次顯示表單？','Show fully booked timeslots?'=>'顯示已額滿的時段？','Show geolocation search?'=>'顯示地理位置搜尋？','Show hide/show trigger?'=>'顯示隱藏/顯示觸發圖示？','Show how many locations?'=>'顯示多少個地點?','Show label'=>'顯示標籤','Show list on day with single event?'=>'單一活動的日期顯示清單？','Show locations search?'=>'顯示地點搜尋？','Show long events'=>'顯示長期活動','Show main search bar?'=>'顯示主要搜尋列？','Show member-only tickets?'=>'顯示會員專屬票券？','Show multiple tickets if logged out?'=>'登出時顯示多張票券？','Show number of locations'=>'顯示地點數量','Show regions?'=>'顯示地區？','Show search filters on page load'=>'頁面載入時顯示搜尋篩選條件','Show some love?'=>'表達一點支持？','Show sorting icon?'=>'顯示排序圖示？','Show spaces left?'=>'顯示剩餘名額？','Show states?'=>'顯示州/省？','Show tags?'=>'顯示標籤？','Show text search?'=>'顯示文字搜尋？','Show the flag of the selected country code and in the country selection list of the phone input field.'=>'在電話輸入欄位中顯示所選國家/地區代碼的旗幟，並顯示在國家/地區選取清單中。','Show the join link publicly, for example on the event page and in calendar feeds'=>'公開顯示加入連結,例如顯示在活動頁面和月曆訂閱源中','Show the sorting icon to change the ordering of search results.'=>'顯示排序圖示，以變更搜尋結果的排序。','Show ticket table in single ticket mode?'=>'在單一票券模式下顯示票券表格？','Show towns/cities?'=>'顯示鄉鎮/城市？','Show unavailable tickets?'=>'顯示無法使用的票券？','Show upcoming timeslots on the initial booking form load before a visitor chooses a calendar date.'=>'在訪客選擇月曆日期之前，於預訂表單初次載入時顯示即將到來的時段。','Show upcoming timeslots?'=>'顯示即將到來的時段？','Show virtual events filter?'=>'顯示虛擬活動篩選器?','Show/Hide Filters'=>'顯示/隱藏篩選條件','Shown in place of the link until then. %s is replaced with the number of minutes.'=>'在此之前顯示以取代連結。%s 會被替換為分鐘數。','Shows events, posts or other post types in an AJAX month, week or day calendar that visitors can filter by category or tag. Events Manager integrates with it automatically.'=>'在 AJAX 月、週或日月曆中顯示活動、文章或其他內容類型,訪客可依分類或標籤篩選。Events Manager 會自動與其整合。','Sign In'=>'登入','Sign Up'=>'註冊','Similar to label but used in instances when referring to one single %s type.'=>'與標籤類似，但用於指稱單一%s類型時。','Since the event is recurring, you must specify an event end date greater than the start date.'=>'由於此活動為週期性活動，你必須指定晚於開始日期的活動結束日期。','Single'=>'單數','Single %s Format'=>'單一 %s 格式','Single %s Page'=>'單一%s頁面','Single %s page format'=>'單一%s頁面格式','Single %s title format'=>'單一%s標題格式','Single Location/Event Map Format'=>'單一地點/活動地圖格式','Single dot'=>'單點','Single ticket mode?'=>'單一票券模式？','Site Categories'=>'網站分類','Site admins will be allowed to rename the base event and location %s on their individual sites.'=>'網站管理員將可在各自的網站上重新命名基礎活動與地點的%s。','Skip rows already on this site: events with the same name and start, locations with the same name'=>'略過此網站上已有的列:名稱和開始時間相同的活動、名稱相同的地點','Skip the row'=>'略過該列','Skipped'=>'已略過','Slug'=>'代稱','Slugs'=>'代稱','Small'=>'小型','Small Calendar'=>'小型月曆','Sold Out'=>'已售完','Some WordPress themes don\'t follow best practices when generating navigation menus, and so the automatic title rewriting feature may cause problems, if your menus aren\'t working correctly on the event pages, try setting this to \'Yes\', and provide an appropriate HTML title format below.'=>'部分 WordPress 佈景主題在產生導覽選單時未遵循最佳做法，因此自動標題改寫功能可能會造成問題。如果你的選單在活動頁面上無法正常運作，請嘗試將此項設為「是」，並在下方提供適當的 HTML 標題格式。','Something went wrong saving your %s to the index table. Please inform a site administrator about this.'=>'將你的%s儲存到索引表時發生問題。請通知網站管理員。','Something went wrong with the recurrence update...'=>'更新重複項目時發生問題…','Sorting'=>'排序','Sorting Order'=>'排序順序','Spaces'=>'名額','Spaces confirmed'=>'已確認名額','Split by timeslots?'=>'依時段拆分？','Spreadsheet'=>'試算表','Stack By'=>'堆疊依據','Stacked metaboxes'=>'堆疊式中繼框','Standard'=>'標準','Standard Ticket'=>'標準票券','Start'=>'開始','Start Date'=>'開始日期','Start Time'=>'開始時間','Start comparison date'=>'比較起始日期','Start date'=>'開始日期','Start import'=>'開始匯入','Start migration'=>'開始遷移','Start time'=>'開始時間','Start time is required.'=>'必須填寫開始時間。','Start/End'=>'開始/結束','Started'=>'已開始','State'=>'州/省','State or province'=>'州或省','State/County'=>'州/縣','State/County:'=>'州/縣:','Statistic Averages/Totals'=>'統計平均值/總計','Status'=>'狀態','Status reason'=>'狀態原因','Status: %s'=>'狀態：%s','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager by subscribing to our newsletter!'=>'訂閱電子報，隨時掌握 Events Manager 的最新功能、技巧與消息！','Stay updated with the latest features, tips, and news about Events Manager!'=>'隨時掌握 Events Manager 的最新功能、技巧與消息！','Step 1 button'=>'第 1 步按鈕','Stopped on an error'=>'因錯誤而停止','Styling Options'=>'樣式選項','Sub Total'=>'小計','Submit %s'=>'送出 %s','Submit Booking'=>'送出預訂','Submit Changes'=>'送出變更','Submit button text'=>'送出按鈕文字','Submit button text (payment)'=>'送出按鈕文字（付款）','Submit button text (processing)'=>'送出按鈕文字（處理中）','Submitted Event Awaiting Approval'=>'已送出，等待核准的活動','Subscribe'=>'訂閱','Subscribe Now'=>'立即訂閱','Subscribe to Our Newsletter'=>'訂閱電子報','Subscribe to our newsletter to receive exclusive content, early access to new features, and helpful event management tips directly to your inbox.'=>'訂閱電子報即可直接在收件匣收到專屬內容、新功能搶先體驗，以及實用的活動管理技巧。','Subsite Archetype Mode'=>'子網站原型模式','Subsites choose from network list'=>'子網站從網路清單中選擇','Subtotals will exclude taxes and display taxes separately.'=>'小計將不含稅金，稅金會另外顯示。','Success Message'=>'成功訊息','Successful booking'=>'預訂成功','Successful pending booking'=>'預訂成功（待審閱）','Successfully Updated Message'=>'更新成功訊息','Successfully deleted all timeranges.'=>'已成功刪除所有時間範圍。','Successfully saved %d timeranges.'=>'已成功儲存 %d 個時間範圍。','Successfully saved %s'=>'已成功儲存%s','Successfully updated %s'=>'已成功更新%s','Super Advanced Mode'=>'超級進階模式','Surcharges (After Taxes)'=>'附加費（稅後）','Surcharges Before Taxes'=>'稅前附加費','Tabbed metaboxes'=>'分頁式中繼框','Tag'=>'標籤','Tag Related Placeholders'=>'標籤相關預留位置','Tag pages'=>'標籤頁面','Tags'=>'標籤','Tags dropdown label'=>'標籤下拉選單標籤','Tags list page'=>'標籤清單頁面','Take bookings and payments on your own site, through your own payment gateway account, with no commission taken.'=>'在您自己的網站上透過您自己的金流帳號處理預訂和付款,不收取任何佣金。','Tax'=>'稅金','Tax Rate'=>'稅率','Taxes'=>'稅金','Taxes included'=>'含稅','Taxonomy not found.'=>'找不到分類法。','Term could not be deleted.'=>'無法刪除詞彙。','Term name is required.'=>'必須提供詞彙名稱。','Term not found.'=>'找不到詞彙。','Test Email Settings'=>'測試電子郵件設定','Text shown in place of the link until then'=>'在此之前顯示以取代連結的文字','Text with link to calendar day page with all events for that day if there are more events than the limit above, leave blank for no link as the day number is also a link.'=>'若活動數量超過上方限制，此文字會連結至顯示當天所有活動的月曆日期頁面；由於日期數字本身也是連結，留空則不顯示連結。','That is not a CSV file. In your spreadsheet program, save or export the sheet as CSV first.'=>'這不是 CSV 檔案。請先在試算表程式中將工作表另存或匯出為 CSV。','That was tried a moment ago. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'剛剛已嘗試過此操作。請等待一分鐘後再試。','The %s account that hosts this event is no longer connected. Reconnect it or choose another account for the event.'=>'主辦此活動的 %s 帳號已不再連線。請重新連線,或為該活動選擇其他帳號。','The Events Calendar is still active. It doesn\'t need to be: Events Manager reads its data directly, so you can deactivate it and its add-ons first. Once migrated, Events Manager uses the same web addresses, so the two plugins compete for them until The Events Calendar is deactivated. Your Events Calendar data is not changed either way.'=>'The Events Calendar 仍處於啟用狀態。其實不必如此:Events Manager 直接讀取其資料,因此您可以先停用它及其附加元件。遷移後,Events Manager 使用相同的網址,因此在停用 The Events Calendar 之前,這兩個外掛會爭用這些網址。無論哪種情況,您的 Events Calendar 資料都不會被變更。','The SMTP host. Usually it corresponds to \'localhost\'. If you use Gmail, set this value to \'tls://smtp.gmail.com:587\'.'=>'SMTP 主機。通常為「localhost」。如果你使用 Gmail，請將此值設為「tls://smtp.gmail.com:587」。','The add-on list can be refreshed once a day. Please try again tomorrow.'=>'附加元件清單每天只能重新整理一次。請明天再試。','The advanced search can be styled in a section-based format, with expandable sections, or directly inline with static headings. If you want headings for some sections and not others, choose Headings and leave specific section heading labels blank in settings further down.'=>'進階搜尋可採用以區段為基礎的格式（可展開的區段），或直接內嵌並顯示固定標題。若希望部分區段有標題、部分沒有，請選擇「標題」，並在下方設定中將特定區段的標題標籤留空。','The bundled OAuth library is not loaded, so the AI / MCP setup screen is unavailable.'=>'未載入隨附的 OAuth 程式庫，因此無法使用 AI / MCP 設定畫面。','The calendar headings uses abbreviated weekdays'=>'月曆標題使用縮寫星期','The country'=>'國家/地區','The country "%s" is not recognized and was left empty.'=>'無法識別國家/地區「%s」,已留空。','The date "%s" in the list of dates is not understood.'=>'無法識別日期清單中的日期「%s」。','The day of the month "%s" is not understood. Use 1 to 31, or last.'=>'無法識別每月的日期「%s」。請使用 1 至 31,或 last。','The default minimum width, in pixels, that each grid item can shrink to fit on one line.'=>'每個格狀項目為了維持在同一行而可縮小到的預設最小寬度（以像素為單位）。','The default value is blank so that the booking submission button appears just below the %s section.'=>'預設值為空白，讓預訂送出按鈕顯示在 %s 區段的正下方。','The description of the event that will appear in the calendar.'=>'將顯示於行事曆中的活動說明。','The email "%s" is not an email address and was left out.'=>'「%s」不是電子郵件地址,已被略過。','The end date "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別結束日期「%s」。','The end is before the start.'=>'結束時間早於開始時間。','The end time "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別結束時間「%s」。','The event name. Example: Birthday party'=>'活動名稱。範例: 生日派對','The featured image was left out: %s'=>'精選圖片已被略過:%s','The file content does not match its file extension.'=>'檔案內容與其副檔名不符。','The file could not be read.'=>'無法讀取該檔案。','The file did not upload. Choose a CSV file and try again.'=>'檔案未上傳。請選擇 CSV 檔案後再試。','The file does not appear to be a valid Microsoft Office document.'=>'此檔案似乎不是有效的 Microsoft Office 文件。','The file does not appear to be a valid PDF.'=>'此檔案似乎不是有效的 PDF。','The file has no column named "%s".'=>'檔案中沒有名為「%s」的欄位。','The file is empty.'=>'檔案是空的。','The file is too big! Maximum allowed size: '=>'檔案太大了！允許的大小上限: ','The file needs a first row of column names and at least one row below it.'=>'檔案的第一列需為欄位名稱，且其下至少要有一列資料。','The first row holds the column names. On the next screen you match each column to a field and see how the first rows will import, before anything is saved. A file made for the CSV importer of The Events Calendar works as it is.'=>'第一列為欄位名稱。在下一個畫面中，您可以將每個欄位對應到相應的項目，並在儲存任何內容之前預覽前幾列的匯入結果。為 The Events Calendar 的 CSV 匯入工具製作的檔案可直接使用。','The following blog timezones could not be successfully reset:'=>'下列部落格的時區無法成功重設：','The following booking is %s :'=>'以下預訂為 %s:','The following options will re-enable this behaviour. If you notice escaped content (raw HTML) displayed on your site, you can enable these temporarily whilst you fix the underlying issue.'=>'以下選項可重新啟用先前的行為。如果你發現網站上顯示跳脫內容（原始 HTML），可以暫時啟用這些選項，同時排除根本問題。','The format of a single %s in a list.'=>'清單中單一%s的格式。','The format of a single %s page title.'=>'單一%s頁面標題的格式。','The format of a single %s page.'=>'單一 %s 頁面的格式。','The format of a single category page title.'=>'單一分類頁面標題的格式。','The format of a single tag page title.'=>'單一標籤頁面標題的格式。','The format of any events in a list.'=>'清單中每個活動的格式。','The format of each event when displayed in the full calendar.'=>'活動在完整月曆中顯示時的格式。','The format of the description of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'活動 RSS 資訊提供中每個項目的說明格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the category page through the %s element.'=>'透過 %s 元素插入分類頁面的活動清單格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the location page through the %s element.'=>'透過 %s 元素插入地點頁面的活動清單格式。','The format of the events the list inserted in the tag page through the <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> element.'=>'透過 <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>、<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> 和 <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> 元素插入標籤頁面的活動清單格式。','The format of the month/year header of the calendar.'=>'月曆月份/年份標題的格式。','The format of the next upcoming event in this %s.'=>'此 %s 中下一場即將舉行的活動格式。','The format of the text appearing in the balloon describing the location.'=>'描述地點的氣泡中所顯示文字的格式。','The format of the title of each item in the events RSS feed.'=>'活動 RSS 資訊提供中每個項目的標題格式。','The format used to display %s content on single pages or elsewhere on your site.'=>'用於在單一頁面或網站其他位置顯示%s內容的格式。','The image is too big! Maximum allowed dimensions: '=>'圖片太大了！允許的尺寸上限: ','The image is too small! Minimum allowed dimensions: '=>'圖片太小了！允許的尺寸下限: ','The image uploaded successfully but was not set as a featured image: %s The attachment ID is in this response — pass it to update-event/update-location `featured_image` once the target is editable.'=>'圖片已成功上傳，但未設為精選圖片：%s 附件 ID 位於此回應中，待目標可編輯後，請將其傳給 update-event/update-location 的 `featured_image`。','The input field is an example of our phone number input field. Play with the settings below and the it will update automatically to show you a preview.'=>'此輸入欄位是我們電話號碼輸入欄位的範例。調整下方設定後，它會自動更新以顯示預覽。','The language used to make this booking was %s'=>'此預訂所使用的語言為 %s','The largest share of an event\'s spaces, as a percentage, that all visitors\' holds together can take at once, so nobody can hold a whole event. Once it is reached, visitors can still book the remaining spaces but they are not held for them. Enter 100 for no limit.'=>'所有訪客的保留合計可同時佔用的活動名額最大百分比，以避免有人保留整個活動。達到上限後，訪客仍可預訂剩餘名額，但不會為其保留。輸入 100 表示不限制。','The last date the event can fall on.'=>'活動可能發生的最後一個日期。','The latitude and longitude are not a pair of coordinates and were left out.'=>'緯度和經度不是一組有效的座標，已略過。','The link will be shown %s minutes before the event starts.'=>'連結將在活動開始前 %s 分鐘顯示。','The location "%1$s" could not be created: %2$s'=>'無法建立地點「%1$s」：%2$s','The location "%s" was not on this site, so it was created with its name only. Add its address, or import a locations file first.'=>'此網站上沒有地點「%s」，因此僅以名稱建立。請新增其地址，或先匯入地點檔案。','The location address'=>'地點地址','The location information that will appear in the calendar.'=>'將顯示於行事曆中的地點資訊。','The location town'=>'地點所在城鎮','The main description of your RSS events feed.'=>'活動 RSS 資訊提供的主說明。','The main title of your RSS events feed.'=>'活動 RSS 資訊提供的主標題。','The maximum allowed size for images uploaded, in bytes'=>'上傳圖片允許的大小上限（位元組）','The maximum height an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上傳圖片的最大高度。較大的圖片將被拒絕。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The maximum number of files a user can upload at once. Leave blank for unlimited.'=>'使用者一次最多可上傳的檔案數量。留空表示不限制。','The maximum size in bytes per uploaded file.'=>'每個上傳檔案的大小上限（位元組）。','The maximum width an uploaded image can have. Larger images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上傳圖片的最大寬度。較大的圖片將被拒絕。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The message displayed when no %s are available.'=>'沒有可用的 %s 時顯示的訊息。','The message displayed when no events are available.'=>'沒有可用活動時顯示的訊息。','The message to be displayed in the list generated by %s when no events are available.'=>'沒有可用活動時，%s 所產生的清單中要顯示的訊息。','The message to be displayed in the list generated by <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>, <code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> and <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> when no events are available.'=>'沒有可用活動時，<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code>、<code>#_TAGNEXTEVENTS</code> 和 <code>#_TAGALLEVENTS</code> 所產生的清單中要顯示的訊息。','The minimum height an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上傳圖片的最小高度。較小的圖片將被拒絕。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The minimum width an uploaded image can have. Smaller images will be rejected. Leave blank to allow any size.'=>'上傳圖片的最小寬度。較小的圖片將被拒絕。留空表示不限制尺寸。','The name is empty.'=>'名稱是空的。','The name of the location'=>'地點名稱','The number of times to repeat, "%s", is not a whole number of 1 or more.'=>'重複次數「%s」不是 1 或以上的整數。','The numerical units shown to those searching by distance. Use comma-separated numbers, such as "25,50,100".'=>'提供給依距離搜尋者的數值單位。請使用以逗號分隔的數字，例如「25,50,100」。','The option below allows you to disable user accounts, yet you will still see the supplied personal information for each booking.'=>'下方選項可讓你停用使用者帳號，但你仍會看到每筆預訂所提供的個人資訊。','The options below are applied to the %s placeholders.'=>'以下選項會套用於 %s 預留位置。','The page containing the %s shortcode. Create a page with that shortcode and select it here.'=>'包含 %s 短代碼的頁面。請建立含有該短代碼的頁面，並在此選取。','The port through which you e-mail notifications will be sent. Make sure the firewall doesn\'t block this port'=>'寄送電子郵件通知所使用的通訊埠。請確認防火牆未封鎖此通訊埠','The provider rate limit was reached, so this will be retried shortly.'=>'已達到供應商的速率限制，稍後將重試。','The repeat rule and the extra dates were combined into a list of %d dates.'=>'重複規則與額外日期已合併為包含 %d 個日期的清單。','The repeat rule gives more than %d dates.'=>'重複規則產生的日期超過 %d 個。','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date, so the event has no dates yet.'=>'重複規則在開始日期與重複截止日期之間沒有產生任何日期，因此此活動目前沒有日期。','The repeat rule gives no dates between the start date and the repeat-until date.'=>'重複規則在開始日期與重複截止日期之間沒有產生任何日期。','The repeat-until date "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別重複截止日期「%s」。','The repeat-until date is before the start date.'=>'重複截止日期早於開始日期。','The repeating event has been converted into a recurring event.'=>'重複活動已轉換為週期性活動。','The repeating events have been converted into recurring events.'=>'重複活動已轉換為週期性活動。','The right-of-withdrawal feature is currently disabled in Events Manager settings.'=>'Events Manager 設定中目前已停用撤回權功能。','The selected country code will also show the dialcode, such as +1 for the US.'=>'所選的國家/地區代碼也會顯示國際電話區碼，例如美國的 +1。','The selected country will be chosen by default if auto-detect is disabled, additionally any numbers submitted whilst Phone Numbers were disabled will be considered as belonging to this country and reformatted accordingly when used for communication or display purposes.'=>'若停用自動偵測，預設會選取所選的國家/地區；此外，在電話號碼功能停用期間提交的任何號碼，都會視為屬於此國家/地區，並在用於通訊或顯示時據此重新格式化。','The setting above is new, due to our new calendar display options. Your previous format was %s'=>'由於推出新的月曆顯示選項，上方的設定為新增項目。你先前的格式為 %s','The settings below are used when using the %s placeholder'=>'使用 %s 預留位置時會套用以下設定','The start date "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別開始日期「%s」。','The start date is empty.'=>'開始日期是空的。','The start time "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別開始時間「%s」。','The statutory cooling-off period is 14 days. Late submissions are still accepted and flagged for your review rather than silently rejected.'=>'法定的冷靜期為 14 天。逾期提交的申請仍會被接受，並標記供你審閱，而不會被悄悄拒絕。','The text shown when a booking is being submitted, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'預訂送出中時顯示的文字，%s 會被取代為應付總額。','The text shown when a booking is not free, %s will be replaced by the total amount due.'=>'預訂需付費時顯示的文字，%s 會被取代為應付總額。','The text used by the submit button. To use an image instead, enter the full url starting with %s or %s.'=>'送出按鈕所使用的文字。若要改用圖片，請輸入以 %s 或 %s 開頭的完整網址。','The ticket %s is no longer available.'=>'票券 %s 已無法使用。','The time zone "%s" is not recognized. Use a name such as America/New_York or an offset such as UTC+2.'=>'無法識別時區「%s」。請使用如 America/New_York 的名稱，或如 UTC+2 的位移。','The tip text that is shown for the advanced search trigger.'=>'進階搜尋觸發圖示所顯示的提示文字。','The title that will appear in the calendar.'=>'將顯示於行事曆中的標題。','The unique name (singular) used to identify %s in the database. Use lowercase alphanumeric characters, dashes and underscores only.'=>'用於在資料庫中識別%s的唯一名稱（單數）。僅限使用小寫英數字元、連字號與底線。','The uploaded file is no longer on the server. Upload it again.'=>'上傳的檔案已不在伺服器上，請重新上傳。','The uploads folder is not writable.'=>'上傳資料夾無法寫入。','The virtual location for this event is not ready yet. Please try again shortly.'=>'此活動的虛擬地點尚未就緒，請稍後再試。','The website "%s" is not a web address and was left out.'=>'網站「%s」不是有效的網址，已略過。','The week of the month "%s" is not understood. Use first, second, third, fourth or last.'=>'無法識別該月的週次「%s」。請使用 first、second、third、fourth 或 last。','The weekday "%s" is not understood.'=>'無法識別星期「%s」。','Theme Templates'=>'佈景主題範本','There are not enough physical spaces left for this booking.'=>'實體名額不足，無法完成此預訂。','There are not enough virtual spaces left for this booking.'=>'虛擬名額不足，無法完成此預訂。','There is a newer version of Events Manager Pro which is recommended for this current version of Events Manager as new features have been added. Please go to the plugin website and download the latest update.'=>'Events Manager Pro 有較新的版本，因為已新增新功能，建議搭配目前版本的 Events Manager 使用。請前往外掛網站下載最新更新。','There was a problem adding custom fields to your recurring events.'=>'為你的週期性活動新增自訂欄位時發生問題。','There was a problem adding tickets to your recurrences.'=>'為你的重複項目新增票券時發生問題。','There was a problem creating a user account, please contact a website administrator.'=>'建立使用者帳號時發生問題，請聯絡網站管理員。','There was a problem deleting bookings for the event.'=>'刪除活動的預訂時發生問題。','There was a problem deleting the timerange.'=>'刪除時間範圍時發生問題。','There was a problem saving the booking.'=>'儲存預訂時發生問題。','There was a problem saving the event timeslots to the database. Please contact an administrator if the issue persists.'=>'將活動時段儲存到資料庫時發生問題。如果問題持續發生，請聯絡管理員。','There was a problem saving the recurring events.'=>'儲存週期性活動時發生問題。','There was a problem saving the ticket booking.'=>'儲存票券預訂時發生問題。','There was a problem saving the ticket.'=>'儲存票券時發生問題。','There was a problem saving the timerange.'=>'儲存時間範圍時發生問題。','There was a problem updating tickets to your recurrences.'=>'更新你的重複項目票券時發生問題。','There was an error connecting to %s: %s'=>'連線到%s時發生錯誤：%s','There was an error upgrading your site, please try again or contact support.'=>'升級網站時發生錯誤，請再試一次或聯絡技術支援。','There was an error uploading the image.'=>'上傳圖片時發生錯誤。','There was an error whilst migrating your times to our new timezone-aware formats. Below is a list of errors:'=>'將你的時間遷移至新的時區感知格式時發生錯誤。錯誤清單如下:','There were some errors saving your location.'=>'儲存你的地點時發生一些錯誤。','There were some issues whilst disconnecting from your %s account(s) :'=>'中斷與你的 %s 帳號連線時發生了一些問題：','These can be overridden when using shortcode or template tags.'=>'使用短代碼或範本標籤時可以覆寫這些設定。','These countries will be excluded from the country selection list.'=>'這些國家/地區將從國家/地區選取清單中排除。','These formats can be used on %s pages or on other areas of your site displaying an %s.'=>'這些格式可用於%s頁面，或網站上其他顯示%s的區域。','These formats can be used when WordPress automatically displays %s excerpts on your site and %s is enabled in your %s settings tab.'=>'當 WordPress 在你的網站上自動顯示%s摘要，且你的 %s 設定分頁中已啟用 %s 時，可使用這些格式。','These formats will be used on your events page. This will also be used if you do not provide specified formats in other event lists, like in shortcodes.'=>'這些格式將用於你的活動頁面。若其他活動清單（例如短代碼）未指定格式，也會使用這些格式。','These headings appear above sections of the booking form. Leave blank for no heading.'=>'這些標題會顯示在預訂表單各區段的上方。留空則不顯示標題。','These options are the defaults applied to lists being showing in Grouped List view mode and can be overriden in individual lists using shortcodes, blocks, widgets etc.'=>'這些選項是套用於分組清單檢視模式的預設值，可在個別清單中透過短代碼、區塊、小工具等覆寫。','These options have security implications and are intended for transition! For more information, please see our %s.'=>'這些選項會影響安全性，僅供過渡期使用！詳情請參閱我們的 %s。','These pages allow you to provide an event management interface outside the admin area on whatever page you want on your website. Bear in mind that this is overridden by BuddyPress if activated.'=>'這些頁面讓你可以在網站的任何頁面上，於管理區域之外提供活動管理介面。請注意，若啟用 BuddyPress，這些設定會被它覆蓋。','These spaces cannot be held for you right now, but you can still book them while they are available.'=>'目前無法為您保留這些名額，但只要仍可預訂，您就能預訂這些名額。','This %s has timeslots, you are viewing'=>'此%s有多個時段，你目前檢視的是','This %s was submitted by a guest. You will find their details in the <em>Anonymous Submitter Info</em> box'=>'此%s是由訪客提交的。你可以在<em>匿名提交者資訊</em>方塊中找到他們的詳細資料','This CPT name is already used by an existing WordPress post type. Please choose another name.'=>'此 CPT 名稱已被現有的 WordPress 文章類型使用，請選擇其他名稱。','This Month'=>'本月','This Year'=>'今年','This accepts %s and %s placeholders.'=>'這接受 %s 與 %s 預留位置。','This accepts %s placeholders.'=>'這接受 %s 預留位置。','This accepts %s, %s and %s placeholders.'=>'這接受 %s、%s 與 %s 預留位置。','This action aill be applied to every attendee belonging to the selected %s. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作將套用到所選%s的每位參加者。要繼續嗎？','This action will be applied to the entire booking the %s belongs to. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作將套用到該%s所屬的整筆預訂。要繼續嗎？','This action will be applied to the entire booking the selected %s belong to. Do you want to continue?'=>'此操作將套用到所選%s所屬的整筆預訂。要繼續嗎？','This booking form has expired, please reload the page and try again.'=>'此預訂表單已過期，請重新載入頁面後再試一次。','This booking has already been submitted, please check your email for its confirmation.'=>'此預訂已送出，請查看你的電子郵件以取得確認信。','This booking has already been submitted.'=>'此預訂已經送出。','This button text would be shown for a free booking'=>'免費預訂時會顯示此按鈕文字','This cannot be undone.'=>'此操作無法復原。','This confirms receipt of your declaration only. We will review it and contact you regarding any refund due.'=>'此通知僅確認我們已收到你的聲明。我們將進行審核，並就應退還的款項與你聯絡。','This content will appear just above your code for the %s list format below. Default is blank'=>'此內容會顯示在下方%s清單格式的程式碼正上方。預設為空白','This content will appear just above your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'此內容會顯示在預設活動清單格式的程式碼正上方。預設為空白','This content will appear just below your code for the %s list format above. Default is blank'=>'此內容會顯示在上方%s清單格式的程式碼正下方。預設為空白','This content will appear just below your code for the default event list format. Default is blank'=>'此內容會顯示在預設活動清單格式的程式碼正下方。預設為空白','This disables user registrations for bookings.'=>'這會停用預訂的使用者註冊。','This email already exists in our system, please log in to register to proceed with your booking.'=>'此電子郵件地址已存在於我們的系統中，請登入後再繼續預訂。','This event has been cancelled.'=>'此活動已取消。','This event has ended and can no longer be joined.'=>'此活動已結束，無法再加入。','This event has no virtual location to join.'=>'此活動沒有可加入的虛擬地點。','This event has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'此活動有驗證錯誤，在修正之前無法發佈：','This event is fully booked.'=>'此活動已額滿。','This event is not available or has been cancelled'=>'此活動無法使用或已取消','This event is not available or has been cancelled.'=>'此活動無法使用或已取消。','This event is not open for joining yet.'=>'此活動尚未開放加入。','This event spans every day between the beginning and end date, with start/end times applying to each day.'=>'此活動橫跨開始日期與結束日期之間的每一天，開始/結束時間適用於每一天。','This file holds'=>'此檔案包含','This is a %s event.'=>'這是%s活動。','This is a %s recurrence of %s.'=>'這是%s的重複%s。','This is a recurring %s. You can find all %s on this page, or click on individual %s to view recurrence-specific bookings.'=>'這是週期性%s。你可以在此頁面找到所有%s，也可以點擊個別%s以檢視該次重複專屬的預訂。','This is a translated event, therefore your time, location and booking information is handled by your original event translation.'=>'這是已翻譯的活動，因此時間、地點和預訂資訊由原始活動翻譯處理。','This is a translated location, so address information is handled by your original location translation. You can provide translations for certain fields which will override the original translation.'=>'這是已翻譯的地點，因此地址資訊由原始地點翻譯處理。你可以為特定欄位提供翻譯，以覆寫原始翻譯。','This is also the default setting for responsive calendars without a fixed size.'=>'這也是未固定尺寸之響應式月曆的預設設定。','This is for advanced users, you should know what you\'re doing here or things will not work properly. For more information on how these options work see our <a href="%s" target="_blank">optimization recommendations</a>'=>'這是給進階使用者的設定，你應該清楚自己在做什麼，否則功能可能無法正常運作。如需這些選項如何運作的詳細資訊，請參閱我們的<a href="%s" target="_blank">最佳化建議</a>','This is not a required step to enable any extra functionality, and therefore is not urgent. Only until you are happy with the upgrade and are confident you don\'t need to downgrade, finalize your upgrade by deleting and discontinuing these fields.'=>'這不是啟用任何額外功能的必要步驟，因此並不緊急。只有在你對升級感到滿意，並確定不需要降級後，才建議刪除並停用這些欄位來完成升級。','This is only applicable when %s is not active.'=>'僅在 %s 未啟用時適用。','This is only used when showing events from other blogs.'=>'僅在顯示其他部落格的活動時使用。','This is sent when a person\'s booking is confirmed. This will be sent automatically if approvals are required and the booking is approved. If approvals are disabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'當某人的預訂獲得確認時寄出。若需要核准，則在預訂獲得核准時自動寄出；若停用核准，則在使用者首次提交預訂時寄出。','This is sent when a person\'s booking is pending. If approvals are enabled, this is sent out when a user first submits their booking.'=>'當某人的預訂處於待審閱狀態時寄出。若啟用核准，則在使用者首次提交預訂時寄出。','This is specific to bookings made by the user, not bookings that may have been made to events they own.'=>'這僅適用於使用者自己做出的預訂，不包含對其所擁有活動所做的預訂。','This is the definite date after which bookings will be closed for this event, regardless of individual ticket settings above. Default value will be the event start date.'=>'此為此活動停止接受預訂的確切日期，不受上方個別票券設定影響。預設值為活動開始日期。','This is your primary recurrence, other recurring %s will use these advanced settings as their default settings if left blank.'=>'這是你的主要重複項目，其他週期性%s若留空，將使用這些進階設定作為預設值。','This join link is not valid. Please use the link from your booking confirmation.'=>'此加入連結無效。請使用預訂確認中的連結。','This link is invalid or has expired. Please request a new one.'=>'此連結無效或已過期。請重新申請。','This location has validation errors and cannot be published until they are fixed:'=>'此地點有驗證錯誤,在修正之前無法發佈:','This month'=>'本月','This network shares one set of event and booking tables, so uninstalling from this site would permanently delete the events and bookings of every site on the network. Uninstall from the %s instead.'=>'此網路共用一組活動與預訂資料表，因此從這個站台解除安裝會永久刪除網路中所有站台的活動與預訂。請改從%s解除安裝。','This only setting only matters if you selected \'Yes\' to above. You will notice the events page titles aren\'t being rewritten, and you have a new title underneath the default page name. This is where you control the HTML of this title. Make sure you keep the #_PAGETITLE placeholder here, as that\'s what is rewritten by events manager. To control what\'s rewritten in this title, see settings further down for page titles.'=>'此設定僅在你上方選擇「是」時才有作用。你會發現活動頁面標題並未被改寫，且預設頁面名稱下方多了一個新標題。你可以在這裡控制此標題的 HTML。請務必保留此處的 #_PAGETITLE 預留位置，因為 Events Manager 改寫的就是它。若要控制此標題中改寫的內容，請參閱下方的頁面標題設定。','This option allows you to select the default category when adding an event.'=>'此選項可讓你選取新增活動時的預設分類。','This option allows you to select the default location when adding an event.'=>'此選項可讓你選取新增活動時的預設地點。','This option allows you to select which page to use as an events page. If you do not select an events page, to display event lists you can enable event archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'此選項可讓你選取要用作活動頁面的頁面。如果你沒有選取活動頁面，要顯示活動清單，可以啟用活動彙整，或使用適當的短代碼和/或範本標籤。','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page.'=>'此選項可讓你選擇要將哪個頁面作為%s頁面。','This option allows you to select which page to use as the %s page. If you do not select a %s page, to display lists you can enable archives or use the appropriate shortcodes and/or template tags.'=>'此選項可讓你選擇要將哪個頁面作為%s頁面。若未選擇%s頁面，你可以啟用彙整頁，或使用適當的短代碼和/或範本標籤來顯示清單。','This options allows to display the full-sized calendar on the events page, instead of the default list.'=>'此選項可在活動頁面上顯示完整尺寸的月曆，而非預設的清單。','This page corresponds to the <strong>Events Manager</strong> %s page. Its content will be overridden by Events Manager, although if you include the word CONTENTS (exactly in capitals) and surround it with other text, only CONTENTS will be overwritten. If you want to change the way your events look, go to the <a href=\'%s\'>settings</a> page. '=>'此頁面對應 <strong>Events Manager</strong> 的%s頁面。其內容將由 Events Manager 覆寫，不過若你在內容中加入全大寫的 CONTENTS 一詞並以其他文字包圍，則只有 CONTENTS 會被覆寫。如果你想變更活動的顯示方式，請前往<a href=\'%s\'>設定</a>頁面。 ','This page is where people that have made bookings for an event can go and view their previous bookings.'=>'預訂過活動的人可以在此頁面檢視自己先前的預訂。','This section allows you to configure parts of this plugin that will improve performance on your site and increase page speeds by reducing extra files from being unnecessarily included on pages as well as reducing server loads where possible. This only applies to pages outside the admin area.'=>'此區段可讓你設定外掛中能提升網站效能的部分，透過減少不必要地載入頁面的額外檔案，並盡可能降低伺服器負載，來加快頁面速度。這僅適用於管理區以外的頁面。','This setting was not changed.'=>'此設定未變更。','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a fixed-size %s calendar.'=>'若你選擇特別顯示固定尺寸的%s月曆，則會套用此設定。','This setting will be applied if you choose to specifically show a size %s calendar.'=>'若你選擇特別顯示%s尺寸的月曆，則會套用此設定。','This setting will not apply to bookings using payment gateways, see individual gateways for approval settings.'=>'此設定不適用於使用付款閘道的預訂，請至各個閘道查看核准設定。','This site is activated under a license that has expired. Deactivate it from your licenses page, then activate it again here and choose your %s license.'=>'此網站是以已過期的授權啟用的。請從您的授權頁面停用，然後在此重新啟用並選擇您的 %s 授權。','This text will be shown only if the default (free) button is not an image.'=>'僅在預設（免費）按鈕不是圖片時，才會顯示此文字。','This ticket is the child of a recurring event ticket. Values can be overriden for this recurrence. Blank text values will default to the parent ticket value, checkboxes like this %s will inherit parent ticket values.'=>'此票券是週期性活動票券的子項目。數值可在此重複項目中覆寫。文字欄位留空時將沿用父票券的值，像 %s 這樣的核取方塊則會繼承父票券的值。','This uses a slightly different format to the others on here, for a list of characters to use, visit the <a href="%s">reference page</a>'=>'此格式與此處其他格式略有不同，可使用的字元清單請參閱<a href="%s">參考頁面</a>','This week'=>'本週','This will be sent automatically when a booking is rejected. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'當預訂遭拒絕時自動寄出。若預訂不需核准，則不適用。','This will be sent to event admins when a booking is rejected.'=>'當預訂遭拒絕時，會寄送給活動管理員。','This will be sent to the person when they first submit their booking. Not relevant if bookings don\'t require approval.'=>'當對方首次提交預訂時寄出。若預訂不需核准，則不適用。','This will be sent when a user cancels their booking.'=>'當使用者取消其預訂時寄出。','This will be used in admin menus and other areas identifying the type of %s you are working with.'=>'將用於管理選單及其他標示你正在處理的%s類型之處。','This will control how many %s are shown on one list by default.'=>'這會控制預設在單一清單中顯示多少個%s。','This will control how many events are shown on one list by default.'=>'這會控制預設情況下單一清單中顯示的活動數量。','This will delete all event recurrence posts/pages, and unify them into one URL. Any 404 pages resulting from these will automatically 302-redirect to the recurring event (which will be a new URL).'=>'這將刪除所有活動重複的文章/頁面，並將它們合併為單一網址。因此產生的任何 404 頁面都會自動以 302 重新導向至該週期性活動（這會是新的網址）。','Thousands Separator'=>'千位分隔符號','Thumbnails'=>'縮圖','Ticket'=>'票券','Ticket %s has a higher minimum spaces requirement than the maximum spaces allowed.'=>'票券 %s 的最低名額要求高於允許的最高名額。','Ticket Capacity'=>'票券容量','Ticket Description'=>'票券說明','Ticket ID'=>'票券 ID','Ticket ID.'=>'票券 ID。','Ticket Name'=>'票券名稱','Ticket Name (Ascending)'=>'票券名稱（遞增）','Ticket Name (Descending)'=>'票券名稱（遞減）','Ticket Options'=>'票券選項','Ticket Price'=>'票券價格','Ticket Price (Ascending)'=>'票券價格（遞增）','Ticket Price (Descending)'=>'票券價格（遞減）','Ticket Spaces'=>'票券名額','Ticket Total'=>'票券總計','Ticket Type'=>'票券類型','Ticket UUID'=>'票券 UUID','Ticket booking created'=>'已建立票券預訂','Ticket could not be deleted.'=>'無法刪除票券。','Ticket could not be saved.'=>'無法儲存票券。','Ticket created'=>'已建立票券','Ticket for %s'=>'%s的票券','Ticket not found.'=>'找不到票券。','Tickets'=>'票券','Tickets / Booking'=>'票券/預訂','Tickets and RSVPs'=>'票券和 RSVP','Tickets with bookings cannot be deleted.'=>'已有預訂的票券無法刪除。','Tickets within recurrences that already have bookings WILL NOT be deleted, the ticket will be deactivated instead to prevent further bookings.'=>'重複項目中已有預訂的票券「不會」被刪除，而是改為停用該票券，以避免後續預訂。','Tickets within recurrences without any bookings will be deleted.'=>'重複項目中沒有任何預訂的票券將會被刪除。','Time Format'=>'時間格式','Time Separator'=>'時間分隔符號','Time zone'=>'時區','Timerange'=>'時間範圍','Timeranges cannot overlap with each other.'=>'時間範圍不得互相重疊。','Times'=>'時間','Timeslot date format'=>'時段日期格式','Timeslot time format'=>'時段時間格式','Timeslots'=>'時段','Timeslots require %s and has been disabled automatically to prevent undesired results.'=>'時段需要 %s，且已自動停用以避免產生非預期的結果。','Timezone'=>'時區','Title'=>'標題','To help with the transition, we\'re providing you with a Preview mode you can activate below, which will temporarily use our new formatting options only for you to see (other site visitors will see your site as usual). If you\'re happy with the changes, you can switch over completely, or revert individual formats within these settings pages.'=>'為了協助你順利過渡，我們提供預覽模式，你可在下方啟用，暫時只讓你看到我們的新格式選項 (其他網站訪客看到的仍是原本的網站)。若你滿意這些變更，可以完全切換，也可以在這些設定頁面中還原個別格式。','To manage the whole set, <a href="%s">edit the repeating event template</a>.'=>'若要管理整組活動，請<a href="%s">編輯重複活動範本</a>。','To update your network blogs with the latest Events Manager automatically, click the update button below.'=>'若要自動將網路中的所有部落格更新為最新的 Events Manager，請點擊下方的更新按鈕。','To view your bookings, please visit %s after logging in.'=>'若要檢視你的預訂，請在登入後前往 %s。','Today'=>'今天','Today\'s events'=>'今天的活動','Tomorrow\'s events'=>'明天的活動','Tooltip'=>'工具提示','Total'=>'總計','Total Bookings'=>'預訂總數','Total Price'=>'總價','Total Sales'=>'總銷售額','Total Spaces'=>'名額總數','Total Tickets'=>'票券總數','Town'=>'鄉鎮市','Translated Event Information'=>'已翻譯的活動資訊','Translated Location Information'=>'已翻譯的地點資訊','Try again'=>'重試','Trying to perform an illegal action.'=>'嘗試執行不合法的操作。','URL'=>'網址','URLs'=>'網址','Uh Oh! For some reason WordPress could not create an events page for you (or you just deleted it). Not to worry though, all you have to do is create an empty page, name it whatever you want, and select it as your events page in your <a href="%s">settings page</a>. Sorry for the extra step! If you know what you are doing, you may have done this on purpose, if so <a href="%s">ignore this message</a>'=>'糟糕！WordPress 因故無法為你建立活動頁面（或是你剛好將它刪除了）。別擔心，你只需要建立一個空白頁面，名稱任意，然後在<a href="%s">設定頁面</a>中將它選為活動頁面即可。很抱歉要多一個步驟！如果你很清楚自己在做什麼，也許這是你刻意為之，這種情況下請<a href="%s">忽略此訊息</a>','Unapprove'=>'駁回','Unauthorized Access'=>'未經授權的存取','Unavailable Dates'=>'不開放日期','Unconfirm'=>'取消確認','Unconfirmed'=>'未確認','Undo'=>'復原','Undo Changes'=>'復原變更','Undo Migration'=>'復原遷移','Uninstall'=>'解除安裝','Uninstall Events Manager'=>'解除安裝 Events Manager','Uninstall and Deactivate'=>'解除安裝並停用','Uninstall/Reset'=>'解除安裝/重設','Unknown migration source.'=>'未知的遷移來源。','Unless overriden with the %s parameter in shortcode or PHP arguments, the calendar will by default split events by timeslot if on the same day or show one event for the day which includes the whole range of timeslots.'=>'除非在短代碼或 PHP 引數中以 %s 參數覆寫，否則若同一天有多個時段，月曆預設會依時段拆分活動，或將當天顯示為涵蓋所有時段範圍的單一活動。','Unless speficied with the %s parameter, the calendar will by default remain the chosen size regardless of calendar width. Responsive calendar size will adjust from small to large according to the calendar width on screen.'=>'除非以 %s 參數指定，否則月曆預設會維持所選尺寸，不受月曆寬度影響。響應式月曆尺寸則會依月曆在螢幕上的寬度，在小型到大型之間自動調整。','Unrecognized file format, could not match file MIME type according to file extension.'=>'無法辨識的檔案格式，無法依副檔名比對檔案的 MIME 類型。','Unrecognized image format, corrupted or non-present image EXIF header data.'=>'無法辨識的圖片格式，圖片的 EXIF 標頭資料已損毀或不存在。','Up to %d%% off'=>'最高折扣 %d%%','Upcoming'=>'即將舉行','Upcoming %s'=>'即將舉行的 %s','Upcoming Events'=>'即將舉行的活動','Upcoming timeslot limit'=>'即將到來的時段數量上限','Update %s'=>'更新%s','Update 7.3.7 also includes improvements to the block (Gutenberg) editor. Check out our %s for the details.'=>'7.3.7 更新也包含區塊 (Gutenberg) 編輯器的改進。詳情請參閱我們的 %s。','Update Blogs'=>'更新部落格','Update Event Category'=>'更新活動分類','Update Event Tag'=>'更新活動標籤','Update Network'=>'更新網路','Update booking'=>'更新預訂','Update event'=>'更新活動','Update location'=>'更新地點','Update preview'=>'更新預覽','Update process has finished.'=>'更新程序已完成。','Update ticket'=>'更新票券','Update your address information above to generate a preciese map location.'=>'請更新上方的地址資訊，以產生精確的地圖位置。','Updated'=>'已更新','Updates an Events Manager %s.'=>'更新 Events Manager %s。','Updates an Events Manager booking. The payment gateway cannot be changed after the booking is made: sending a different gateway is rejected, and resending the current one is ignored.'=>'更新 Events Manager 預訂。預訂完成後無法變更付款閘道：傳送不同的閘道會被拒絕，重新傳送目前的閘道則會被忽略。','Updates an Events Manager event.'=>'更新 Events Manager 活動。','Updates an Events Manager location.'=>'更新 Events Manager 地點。','Updates an Events Manager ticket.'=>'更新 Events Manager 票券。','Updates and support until %s'=>'更新與支援至 %s','Upgrade to %s'=>'升級至 %s','Upgrade to %s for more options!'=>'升級至 %s 以獲得更多選項！','Upload Limits'=>'上傳限制','Upload a file'=>'上傳檔案','Upload a file first.'=>'請先上傳檔案。','Upload and match columns'=>'上傳並對應欄位','Upload media'=>'上傳媒體','Upload the zip under Plugins > Add New Plugin, then activate your license from its settings.'=>'請在「外掛 > 安裝外掛」下上傳 zip 檔，然後從其設定中啟用您的授權。','Upload/change picture'=>'上傳/變更圖片','Uploaded file type not allowed. Permitted file types are: %s'=>'不允許上傳此檔案類型。允許的檔案類型: %s','Uploads'=>'上傳','Uploads an image (or other media) to the WordPress media library and returns its attachment ID. Accepts a `source_url` to sideload a public image, base64-encoded bytes via `content_base64` + `filename`, or an existing `id` to look up an existing attachment. If a public URL blocks server-side fetches (e.g. Unsplash) use `content_base64` instead. To make the upload an event/location featured image in one call, pass `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`; otherwise pass the returned ID as `featured_image` to update-event / update-location, or as `image` to update-category / update-tag. (Note: `post_id` only files the attachment under a post in the library — it does NOT set the featured image.)'=>'將圖片（或其他媒體）上傳至 WordPress 媒體庫並傳回其附件 ID。可接受 `source_url` 以匯入公開圖片、透過 `content_base64` + `filename` 提供 base64 編碼的位元組，或提供現有的 `id` 以查詢現有附件。若公開網址會阻擋伺服器端擷取（例如 Unsplash），請改用 `content_base64`。若要在一次呼叫中將上傳內容設為活動/地點的精選圖片，請傳入 `featured_image_for_event` / `featured_image_for_location`；否則請將傳回的 ID 作為 `featured_image` 傳給 update-event / update-location，或作為 `image` 傳給 update-category / update-tag。（注意：`post_id` 只會將附件歸檔至媒體庫中的某篇文章，並不會設定精選圖片。）','Use 24h Format?'=>'使用 24 小時制？','Use Defaults'=>'使用預設值','Use SMTP authentication?'=>'使用 SMTP 驗證？','Use Visual Editor?'=>'使用視覺化編輯器？','Use abbreviations, e.g. Friday = Fri. Useful for certain languages where abbreviations differ from full names.'=>'使用縮寫，例如星期五 = 週五。適用於縮寫與全名不同的某些語言。','Use dropdown for locations?'=>'地點使用下拉選單？','Use international format starting with `+` and a country code, e.g. `+447400123456`.'=>'請使用國際格式，以 `+` 和國碼開頭，例如 `+447400123456`。','Use the UI builder below to create and manage additional event types (archetypes).'=>'使用下方的 UI 建構器建立及管理額外的活動類型（原型）。','Use the buttons below to uninstall Events Manager completely from your system or reset Events Manager to original settings and keep your event data.'=>'使用下方按鈕可將 Events Manager 從系統中完全解除安裝，或將 Events Manager 重設為原始設定並保留你的活動資料。','Used if an excerpt has been defined.'=>'在已定義摘要時使用。','Used if an excerpt has not been defined.'=>'在未定義摘要時使用。','Used to format each event in a list when previewing a single date in a modal popup.'=>'在彈出視窗中預覽單一日期時，用來格式化清單中的每個活動。','Used to show a single event when preview mode is set to %s.'=>'當預覽模式設為 %s 時，用來顯示單一活動。','User Capabilities'=>'使用者權限','User Fields'=>'使用者欄位','User can book'=>'使用者可預訂','User can create and edit %s'=>'使用者可以建立並編輯%s','User can delete %s categories and tags.'=>'使用者可以刪除%s分類與標籤。','User can delete other users %s'=>'使用者可以刪除其他使用者的%s','User can delete their own %s'=>'使用者可以刪除自己的%s','User can edit %s categories and tags.'=>'使用者可以編輯%s分類與標籤。','User can edit other users %s'=>'使用者可以編輯其他使用者的%s','User can manage other users individual bookings and event booking settings.'=>'使用者可以管理其他使用者的個別預訂與活動預訂設定。','User can upload images along with their events and locations.'=>'使用者可以隨活動與地點一併上傳圖片。','User can use and manage bookings with their events.'=>'使用者可以在自己的活動中使用並管理預訂。','User can use other user locations for their events.'=>'使用者可以在自己的活動中使用其他使用者的地點。','User can view private %s'=>'使用者可以檢視私密%s','User must log in'=>'使用者必須登入','Username'=>'使用者名稱','Username: %s'=>'使用者名稱: %s','Users can manage bookings for their events on this page.'=>'使用者可以在此頁面管理自己活動的預訂。','Users can now use the WordPress editor for easy HTML entry in the submission form.'=>'使用者現在可以在提交表單中使用 WordPress 編輯器，輕鬆輸入 HTML。','Users can publish %s and skip any admin approval'=>'使用者可以發佈%s並略過管理員審核','Users can view their bookings for other events on this page.'=>'使用者可以在此頁面檢視自己對其他活動的預訂。','Users can view, add and edit their %s on this page.'=>'使用者可以在此頁面檢視、新增和編輯自己的%s。','Users will be able to create additional custom event post types on their own sub-sites.'=>'使用者將可在自己的子網站上建立額外的自訂活動文章類型。','Users with accounts (which would be created by other means when this mode is enabled) will still be able to log in and make bookings linked to their account as normal.'=>'擁有帳號的使用者（啟用此模式後，帳號會透過其他方式建立）仍可正常登入，並進行與其帳號連結的預訂。','Users with the relevant permissions can manage their own events and bookings to these events on the following pages.'=>'具備相關權限的使用者可以在以下頁面管理自己的活動，以及這些活動的預訂。','Value'=>'值','Venue capacity, shared by all tickets that include physical access. Leave blank for no limit.'=>'場地容量，由所有包含實體入場的票券共用。留空表示無限制。','Venues'=>'場地','View'=>'檢視','View %s'=>'檢視%s','View As'=>'檢視方式','View Bookings'=>'檢視預訂','View Event'=>'檢視活動','View Event Bookings'=>'檢視活動預訂','View Location'=>'檢視地點','View Range'=>'檢視範圍','View Timeslot'=>'檢視時段','View Types'=>'檢視類型','View all posts in %s'=>'檢視%s中的所有文章','View event details'=>'檢視活動詳細資料','View license'=>'檢視授權','View/Edit Event'=>'檢視/編輯活動','Viewing a general WordPress taxonomy page such as %s will show a list of events just like it would regular posts for a regular category or tag. Below you can edit things such as the order events are displayed, or completely override the archive look with our formats feature.'=>'檢視 %s 等一般 WordPress 分類法頁面時，會像一般文章的分類或標籤一樣顯示活動清單。你可以在下方編輯活動的顯示順序等項目，或使用我們的格式功能完全覆蓋彙整頁的外觀。','Views'=>'檢視','Virtual'=>'虛擬','Virtual Events'=>'虛擬活動','Virtual Locations'=>'虛擬地點','Virtual Platform'=>'虛擬平台','Virtual Spaces'=>'虛擬名額','Virtual Venue'=>'虛擬場地','Virtual and Hybrid Events'=>'虛擬與混合活動','Virtual capacity, shared by all tickets that include virtual access. Leave blank for no limit, or the limit of your virtual platform if it has one.'=>'虛擬容量，由所有包含虛擬入場的票券共用。留空表示無限制，若您的虛擬平台有上限，則以該上限為準。','Virtual events only'=>'僅限虛擬活動','WARNING : Restrict your API key to prevent unauthorized use and quota theft. See our %s page for more information.'=>'警告：請限制你的 API 金鑰，以防止未經授權的使用和配額遭竊。詳情請參閱我們的%s頁面。','WARNING! This cannot be undone and will overwrite all event timezones, you may want to back up your database first!'=>'警告！此動作無法復原，並會覆寫所有活動時區，建議你先備份資料庫！','WARNING! You will delete ALL recurrences of this event, including booking history associated with any event in this recurrence. To keep booking information, go to the relevant single event and save it to detach it from this recurrence series.'=>'警告！你將刪除此活動的所有重複項目，包括此重複系列中任何活動相關的預訂記錄。若要保留預訂資訊，請前往相關的單一活動並儲存，以將其與此重複系列解除關聯。','WARNING: This action cannot be undone.'=>'警告：此操作無法復原。','WARNING: This is a %s.'=>'警告：這是一個%s。','WARNING: This is a event belonging to the group "%s". Other group admins can also modify this event.'=>'警告：這是屬於群組「%s」的活動。其他群組管理員也可以修改此活動。','WARNING: This is a recurrence in a set of repeating events.'=>'警告：這是一組重複活動中的其中一個重複項目。','WP FullCalendar'=>'WP FullCalendar','WPML Compatibility'=>'WPML 相容性','Waiting to sync with the provider.'=>'正在等待與供應商同步。','Waitlist'=>'候補名單','Waitlist Approved'=>'候補已核准','Waitlist Expired'=>'候補已過期','Want to use the block editor? You can now enable this on your %s page.'=>'想使用區塊編輯器嗎？現在可以在你的 %s 頁面啟用。','Warning!'=>'警告！','Warning: Changing the CPT name can have wider implications and may affect any other plugins that specifically work with this custom post type name. Are you sure you want to continue?'=>'警告：變更 CPT 名稱可能造成更廣泛的影響，並可能影響任何專門使用此自訂文章類型名稱的其他外掛。確定要繼續嗎？','Warning: Changing these values may result in exposing previously hidden information to all users.'=>'警告：變更這些值可能會讓先前隱藏的資訊對所有使用者公開。','We are going to use %s for searching.'=>'我們將使用 %s 進行搜尋。','We collect and store information you submit to us about events (and corresponding locations) you would like to publish on our site.'=>'我們會收集並儲存你提交給我們、希望在本網站發佈的活動（及相應地點）資訊。','We collect and store information you submit to us when making a booking, for the purpose of reserving your requested spaces at our event and maintaining a record of attendance.'=>'我們會收集並儲存你在預訂時提交的資訊，用於為你保留活動名額並保存出席記錄。','We could not find a booking matching that reference and email address. Please check both and try again.'=>'找不到符合該參考編號與電子郵件地址的預訂。請檢查兩者後再試一次。','We could not find any active bookings for your email address.'=>'找不到與你的電子郵件地址相關的任何有效預訂。','We could not verify that booking. Please start again.'=>'無法驗證該預訂。請重新開始。','We impose some theme styling rules which help normalize the look of Events Manager accross themes and overrides general theming. This is limited to our components but will prevent your theme from taking over things like fonts, font-sizes, form structures etc. You can also disable strict styling for individual components below.'=>'我們會套用一些佈景主題樣式規則，協助統一 Events Manager 在不同佈景主題間的外觀，並覆寫一般的佈景主題樣式。這僅限於我們的元件，但會防止你的佈景主題接管字型、字型大小、表單結構等項目。你也可以在下方停用個別元件的嚴格樣式。','We may use cookies to temporarily store information about a booking in progress as well as any error/confirmation messages whilst submitting or managing your events and locations.'=>'我們可能會使用 Cookie 暫時儲存進行中的預訂資訊，以及你在提交或管理活動與地點時的任何錯誤/確認訊息。','We recommend enabling this feature, as all numbers are stored in the international standard %s. Even if you require national numbers from one country, to ensure compatibility with all phone-related features, otherwise a simple text field is provided for phone input.'=>'我們建議啟用此功能，因為所有號碼都會以國際標準 %s 儲存。即使你只要求某個國家/地區的本地號碼，也建議如此，以確保與所有電話相關功能相容，否則電話輸入只會提供一般文字欄位。','We recommend leaving this on unless you are experiencing issues configuring your email.'=>'除非設定電子郵件時遇到問題，否則建議保持開啟。','We recommend you back up your database! Once the upgrade is finalized, you cannot downgrade to an earlier version of the plugin. This cannot be undone.'=>'我們建議你備份資料庫！升級完成後，你將無法降級至舊版外掛，且此操作無法復原。','We strongly recommend you check out our %s before disabling any styling here, in most cases you can make profound changes with a few line of CSS or PHP'=>'在停用此處任何樣式之前，我們強烈建議你先查看我們的%s，多數情況下只需幾行 CSS 或 PHP 就能做出大幅的變更','We strongly suggest you back up your database before proceding with this action, it cannot be undone otherwise!'=>'強烈建議你在執行此動作前先備份資料庫，否則將無法復原！','We use Google services to generate maps and provide autocompletion when searching for events by location, which may collect data via your browser in accordance to Google\'s <a href="%s">privacy policy</a>.'=>'我們使用 Google 服務來產生地圖，並在依地點搜尋活動時提供自動完成功能，瀏覽器可能會依據 Google 的<a href="%s">隱私權政策</a>收集資料。','We will attempt to detect the location of the user based on their browser timezone and auto-select the corresponding country accordingly.'=>'我們會嘗試根據使用者的瀏覽器時區偵測其所在位置，並自動選取對應的國家/地區。','We\'re always making improvements, adding features and fixing bugs between releases. We incrementally make these changes in between updates and make it available as a development version. You can download these manually, but we\'ve made it easy for you. <strong>Warning:</strong> Development versions are not always fully tested before release, use wisely!'=>'我們隨時都在改進、新增功能並修正錯誤。這些變更會在正式發佈之間逐步完成，並以開發版本的形式提供。你可以手動下載，不過我們讓這件事更簡單。<strong>警告:</strong>開發版本在發佈前不一定經過完整測試，請謹慎使用！','Website'=>'網站','Week %d'=>'第 %d 週','Weekly'=>'每週','Welcome to Events Manager v6! This latest update includes some major UI improvements, which requires you to update your formats.'=>'歡迎使用 Events Manager v6！此次更新包含重大的使用者介面改進，需要你更新格式。','What the file holds'=>'檔案內容','When'=>'時間','When Events Manager displays lists of events the default behavior is ordering by start date in ascending order. To change this, modify the values above.'=>'當 Events Manager 顯示活動清單時，預設行為是依開始日期遞增排序。若要變更，請修改上方的值。','When a booking cannot be made due to an error when filling the form. Below this, there will be a dynamic list of errors.'=>'因填寫表單時發生錯誤而無法預訂時。此訊息下方會動態列出錯誤清單。','When a booking cannot be made due to lack of spaces.'=>'因名額不足而無法預訂時。','When a booking is made by a user, a feedback message is shown depending on the result, which can be customized below.'=>'使用者進行預訂後，會依結果顯示回饋訊息，你可以在下方自訂。','When a booking is registered and confirmed.'=>'預訂已登記並確認時。','When a booking is registered but pending.'=>'預訂已登記但仍待審閱時。','When a guest tries to book using an email registered with a user account.'=>'訪客使用已註冊使用者帳號的電子郵件地址進行預訂時。','When a guest user makes a booking for the first time in Events Manager, a new user account is created for them and they are sent their credentials in a separate email, which can be modified below.'=>'當訪客首次在 Events Manager 中進行預訂時，系統會為其建立新的使用者帳號，並以另一封電子郵件寄送登入資料，該郵件可在下方修改。','When a user cancels their booking, this message will be displayed confirming the cancellation.'=>'使用者取消預訂時，會顯示此訊息以確認已取消。','When a user chooses to cancel a booking, this warning is displayed for them to confirm.'=>'使用者選擇取消預訂時，會顯示此警告供其確認。','When a user modifies a previously published event, it will be put back into pending review status and will not be published until you re-approve it.'=>'當使用者修改先前已發佈的活動時，該活動會回到待審閱狀態，在你重新核准之前不會發佈。','When a user must log in before making a booking.'=>'使用者必須先登入才能預訂時。','When a user submits their event, you can display a new event form again.'=>'使用者提交活動後，你可以再次顯示新的活動表單。','When an event is cancelled, a general email is sent to all confirmed and pending bookings to an event that has been cancelled.'=>'當活動被取消時，系統會寄送一封通知信給該活動所有已確認及待審閱的預訂。','When creating a new event, this timezone will be applied by default.'=>'建立新活動時，預設會套用此時區。','When creating events, would you like your times to be shown in 24 hour format?'=>'建立活動時，是否希望以 24 小時制顯示時間？','When displaying embedded maps for a location, choose what information Google will use to generate a map from, each producing varying results.'=>'顯示地點的嵌入式地圖時，請選擇 Google 要用哪些資訊來產生地圖，不同選擇會有不同的結果。','When displaying global %s on the main site you have the option of users viewing the %s details on the main site or being directed to the sub-site.'=>'在主站台顯示全域%s時，你可以選擇讓使用者在主站台檢視%s詳細資料，或導向至子站台。','When displaying ticket prices and booking totals, include the tax automatically?'=>'顯示票券價格與預訂總額時，是否自動包含稅金？','When enabled, phone number fields will include special international (or national) formatting and validation.'=>'啟用後，電話號碼欄位將包含特殊的國際（或本地）格式與驗證。','When enabled, the mobile app can register devices and receive push notifications. Turning this off stops all outgoing pushes and hides the notification options in the app for this site.'=>'啟用後，行動應用程式即可註冊裝置並接收推播通知。關閉此功能會停止所有外送推播，並在應用程式中隱藏此網站的通知選項。','When enabled, users can custom-order their tickets using drag and drop. If enabled, saved ordering supercedes the default ticket ordering below.'=>'啟用後，使用者可以透過拖放自訂票券的順序。啟用時，已儲存的順序會優先於下方的預設票券排序。','When listing categories, this order is applied.'=>'列出分類時，會套用此順序。','When listing event archives for a %s, this order is applied.'=>'列出%s的活動彙整時，會套用此順序。','When listing tags, this order is applied.'=>'列出標籤時，會套用此順序。','When no tickets are selected, this text will appear in place of a booking summary, prompting users to select a ticket.'=>'未選取任何票券時，此文字會取代預訂摘要顯示，提示使用者選取票券。','When selecting tickets on a booking form, the price will dynamically be broken down in a summary before the booking confirmation button.'=>'在預訂表單上選取票券時，價格會動態細分並顯示在預訂確認按鈕前的摘要中。','When submitting events, you can choose to use a single date picker for start/end dates, or separate fields for each date.'=>'提交活動時，你可以選擇使用單一日期選擇器設定開始/結束日期，或為每個日期使用獨立欄位。','When the booking is cancelled, the cancellation status email can also be sent independently of a general event cancellation notification.'=>'預訂取消時，也可以獨立於一般活動取消通知，另外寄送取消狀態電子郵件。','When the size of the %s is less than %s, the search fields and buttons in the main bar can either remain on one line and resize accordingly, or break into multiple lines. If you want to keep all your search terms options, multiple lines will look better as they will look squashed on smaller screens and provide a worse search exprience. You can also hide individual search fields in settings further down to reduce screen clutter as the search from shrinks.'=>'當%s小於 %s 時，主要列中的搜尋欄位與按鈕可維持在同一行並隨之縮放，也可拆成多行。若想保留所有搜尋條件選項，多行顯示效果較佳，因為在較小的螢幕上單行會顯得擁擠，搜尋體驗較差。你也可以在下方設定中隱藏個別搜尋欄位，以便在搜尋表單縮小時減少畫面雜亂。','When the size of the %s is less than %s, this field can be hidden on the main search form to save viewing space. You can still enable this field to show in advanced search settings.'=>'當%s小於 %s 時，可在主要搜尋表單中隱藏此欄位以節省顯示空間。你仍可在進階搜尋設定中啟用此欄位以顯示。','When you save this %s, all recurrences of this set will be deleted. Would you like to proceed?'=>'儲存此%s後，這組的所有重複項目都會被刪除。要繼續嗎？','Where'=>'地點','Whether this ticket lets attendees attend physically, virtually, or both, on a hybrid event.'=>'在混合活動中，此票券是讓參加者以實體、虛擬或兩種方式參加。','Why'=>'原因','Will be imported'=>'將會匯入','Will be skipped'=>'將會略過','With the %s placeholder, the below texts will be used.'=>'使用 %s 預留位置時，將採用以下文字。','Withdrawal page'=>'撤回頁面','Withdrawal period (days)'=>'撤回期限（天）','Withdrawal policy / instructions'=>'撤回政策/說明','Withdrawal received for booking #%d'=>'已收到預訂 #%d 的撤回申請','Within'=>'範圍','Within the network admin area, only network-specific settings will be exported or imported. For individual site settings please visit the relevant site within your network.'=>'在多站網路管理中心中，只會匯出或匯入網路專屬的設定。個別網站的設定，請前往網路中的對應網站。','WooCommerce sold separately on Woo.com'=>'WooCommerce 需另於 Woo.com 購買','WooCommerce ticket orders become'=>'WooCommerce 票券訂單變為','WordPress %s Archives'=>'WordPress %s 彙整','Work it out from the file'=>'從檔案自動判斷','Would you like to allow users to submit bookings anonymously? If so, you can use the new [event_form] shortcode or <code>em_event_form()</code> template tag with this enabled.'=>'你是否要允許使用者匿名提交預訂？若是，啟用後即可使用新的 [event_form] 短代碼或 <code>em_event_form()</code> 範本標籤。','Yearly'=>'每年','Yes'=>'是','Yesterday'=>'昨天','You <strong>must</strong> have assigned a %s page in your <a href="%s">main blog settings</a> for this to work.'=>'你<strong>必須</strong>在<a href="%s">主部落格設定</a>中指定%s頁面，此功能才能運作。','You already have booked a seat at this event.'=>'你已經預訂了此活動的座位。','You are adding unavailable dates.'=>'你正在新增不開放日期。','You are currently attending this event.'=>'你目前已報名參加此活動。','You are currently viewing options for an archetype. These can override the default options with the follwoing available options.'=>'你目前正在檢視某個原型的選項。這些選項可用下列可用選項覆寫預設選項。','You are currently viewing your public page, this is what other users will see.'=>'你目前正在檢視自己的公開頁面，這就是其他使用者會看到的內容。','You are in Events Manager debug mode. To turn debug mode off, go to the <a href="%s">settings</a> page.'=>'你目前處於 Events Manager 偵錯模式。若要關閉偵錯模式，請前往<a href="%s">設定</a>頁面。','You are successfully connected to the following %s account:'=>'你已成功連線到以下%s帳號：','You are switching location type, if you update this event your event previous location data will be deleted.'=>'你正在切換地點類型，若更新此活動，活動先前的地點資料將被刪除。','You are trying to book a non-existent ticket for this event.'=>'你正在嘗試預訂此活動中不存在的票券。','You are viewing individual recurrences of %s.'=>'你正在檢視%s的各個重複項目。','You can add private notes below for internal reference that only event managers will see.'=>'你可以在下方新增私人備註作為內部參考，只有活動管理員看得到。','You can add styles to your maps to give them a unique look. Build one using the %s or choose from the many free templates on %s paste the generated JSON code here.'=>'你可以為地圖加入樣式，讓它有獨特的外觀。請使用%s自行製作，或從 %s 上眾多免費範本中選擇，然後將產生的 JSON 程式碼貼在這裡。','You can allow different location types which can be assigned to an event. For more information see our %s.'=>'你可以允許不同的地點類型指派給活動。詳情請參閱我們的%s。','You can allow users to publicly submit events on your blog by using the %s shortcode, and enabling anonymous submissions below.'=>'你可以使用 %s 短代碼並在下方啟用匿名提交，讓使用者在你的網站上公開提交活動。','You can also %s into a single recurring event.'=>'你也可以%s為單一週期性活動。','You can also add event attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_ATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on event pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'你也可以在此新增活動屬性，每行一個，格式為 <code>#_ATT{key}</code>。除非你將這些屬性插入下方的其他範本，否則不會顯示在活動頁面上，但你可能想儲存活動的額外資訊以供其他用途使用。<a href=\'%s\'>進一步了解預留位置。</a>','You can also add location attributes here, one per line in this format <code>#_LATT{key}</code>. They will not appear on location pages unless you insert them into another template below, but you may want to store extra information about an event for other uses. <a href=\'%s\'>More information on placeholders.</a>'=>'你也可以在此新增地點屬性，每行一個，格式為 <code>#_LATT{key}</code>。除非你將這些屬性插入下方的其他範本，否則不會顯示在地點頁面上，但你可能想儲存活動的額外資訊以供其他用途使用。<a href=\'%s\'>進一步了解預留位置。</a>','You can also request specific consent from your users to be contacted via supplied communication options (Email, Phone, SMS, WhatsApp, Facebook, Telegram etc.), this can be separate to your privacy policy, given that this relates to consenting to non-essential communication such as marketing or non-email-based reminders.'=>'你也可以另外請使用者同意透過所提供的通訊方式（電子郵件、電話、簡訊、WhatsApp、Facebook、Telegram 等）與其聯絡。由於這涉及同意接收行銷或非電子郵件提醒等非必要通訊，因此可與你的隱私權政策分開處理。','You can also reset all events of a blog to a new timezone in %s'=>'你也可以在 %s 將某個網站的所有活動重設為新的時區','You can change the permalink structure of your events, locations, categories and tags here. Be aware that you may want to set up redirects if you change your permalink structures to maintain SEO rankings.'=>'你可以在此變更活動、地點、分類和標籤的永久連結結構。請注意，如果變更永久連結結構，你可能需要設定重新導向，以維持 SEO 排名。','You can choose to show a popup modal or inline under the main search bar triggered by an icon on the main search bar.'=>'你可以選擇顯示彈出視窗，或透過主要搜尋列上的圖示觸發，顯示在主要搜尋列下方的內嵌區域。','You can choose whether or not to show unavailable tickets to visitors.'=>'你可以選擇是否向訪客顯示無法使用的票券。','You can create more than one "type" of event, which can have its own admin section, URL structure, calendar and formatting. For example, you may have events, appointments, and workshops all running under the Events Manager engine!'=>'你可以建立多種活動「類型」，每種類型都有自己的管理區、網址結構、月曆與格式。例如，你可以讓活動、預約和工作坊全都在 Events Manager 引擎下運作！','You can disable ALL styling altogether by setting this to \'no\'. By doing so, nothing will be styled, AT ALL, by Events Manager in the front-end. Basically, it\'s up to you and your theme!'=>'將此項設為「否」，即可完全停用所有樣式。這樣一來，Events Manager 在前端完全不會套用任何樣式，一切都由你和你的佈景主題決定！','You can disable this email by leaving the subject blank.'=>'將主旨留空即可停用此電子郵件。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with a %s to prevent getting overwritten.'=>'你可以編輯各個重複項目，並解除它們與%s的關聯，以避免被覆寫。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this %s.'=>'你可以編輯各個重複項目，並解除它們與此%s的關聯。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this recurring event.'=>'你可以編輯個別的重複項目，並解除它們與此週期性活動的關聯。','You can edit individual recurrences and disassociate them with this repeating event.'=>'你可以編輯各個重複項目，並解除它們與此重複活動的關聯。','You can have single or multiple tickets, where certain tickets become available under certain conditions, e.g. early bookings, group discounts, maximum bookings per ticket, etc.'=>'你可以設定單一或多種票券，並讓特定票券在特定條件下開放，例如提早預訂、團體折扣、每種票券的預訂上限等。','You can hide or leave the consent box checked for registered users who have provided consent previously.'=>'對於先前已提供同意的已註冊使用者，你可以隱藏同意方塊，或讓它維持勾選狀態。','You can join from %s.'=>'您可以從 %s 開始加入。','You can log into our site here : %s'=>'你可以在這裡登入我們的網站 : %s','You can now give fine grained control with regards to what your users can do with events. Each user role can have perform different sets of actions.'=>'你現在可以細部控制使用者對活動的操作權限。每個使用者角色可以執行不同的操作。','You can only convert a repeating %s'=>'你只能轉換重複的%s','You can reset your events to a new timezone and also complete the final migration step by deleting unecessary data in %s'=>'你可以將活動重設為新的時區，並在 %s 刪除不必要的資料來完成最後的遷移步驟','You can use Google Maps to show where your events are located. For more information on using maps, <a href="%s">see our documentation</a>.'=>'你可以使用 Google 地圖顯示活動的所在位置。如需地圖使用的詳細資訊，請<a href="%s">參閱我們的說明文件</a>。','You can view your event here:'=>'你可以在這裡檢視你的活動:','You cannot RSVP to this booking with %s'=>'你無法以 %s 回覆出席此預訂','You cannot book more than %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'票券 %2$s 最多只能預訂 %1$d 個名額。','You cannot book more than %d spaces for this event.'=>'此活動最多只能預訂 %d 個名額。','You cannot change the CPT type of %s to %s. This custom post type already exists.'=>'你無法將 %s 的 CPT 類型變更為 %s。此自訂文章類型已存在。','You cannot delete a ticket that has a booking on it.'=>'你無法刪除已有預訂的票券。','You cannot delete tickets if there are any bookings associated with them. Please delete these bookings first.'=>'若票券有任何相關預訂，你就無法刪除。請先刪除這些預訂。','You cannot edit saved locations here.'=>'你無法在此編輯已儲存的地點。','You cannot manage this %s.'=>'你無法管理此%s。','You cannot read private %s'=>'你無法讀取私密的 %s','You cannot view others %s'=>'你無法檢視他人的 %s','You do not have any bookings.'=>'你沒有任何預訂。','You do not have permission to attach media to that post.'=>'你沒有將媒體附加至該文章的權限。','You do not have permission to change this booking status.'=>'你沒有變更此預訂狀態的權限。','You do not have permission to create bookings through the API.'=>'你沒有透過 API 建立預訂的權限。','You do not have permission to create/edit %s.'=>'你沒有建立/編輯%s的權限。','You do not have permission to delete %s'=>'你沒有刪除 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to delete event terms.'=>'你沒有刪除活動詞彙的權限。','You do not have permission to delete others %s'=>'你沒有刪除他人 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to delete this booking.'=>'你沒有刪除此預訂的權限。','You do not have permission to delete this event.'=>'你沒有刪除此活動的權限。','You do not have permission to delete this location.'=>'你沒有刪除此地點的權限。','You do not have permission to delete this ticket.'=>'你沒有刪除此票券的權限。','You do not have permission to do that.'=>'您沒有執行此操作的權限。','You do not have permission to edit %s'=>'你沒有編輯 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to edit others %s'=>'你沒有編輯他人 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to edit that event, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'你沒有編輯該活動的權限，因此上傳的圖片未設為其精選圖片。','You do not have permission to edit that location, so the uploaded image was not set as its featured image.'=>'你沒有編輯該地點的權限，因此上傳的圖片未設為其精選圖片。','You do not have permission to edit this attachment.'=>'你沒有編輯此附件的權限。','You do not have permission to edit this event.'=>'你沒有編輯此活動的權限。','You do not have permission to manage %s'=>'你沒有管理 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to manage event terms.'=>'你沒有管理活動詞彙的權限。','You do not have permission to manage others %s'=>'你沒有管理他人 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to manage this booking.'=>'你沒有管理此預訂的權限。','You do not have permission to manage tickets for this event.'=>'你沒有管理此活動票券的權限。','You do not have permission to migrate data.'=>'您沒有遷移資料的權限。','You do not have permission to publish %s'=>'你沒有發佈 %s 的權限','You do not have permission to save this booking.'=>'你沒有儲存此預訂的權限。','You do not have permission to save this event.'=>'你沒有儲存此活動的權限。','You do not have permission to save this location.'=>'你沒有儲存此地點的權限。','You do not have permission to send a test email, or this page has expired. Please reload the settings page and try again.'=>'你沒有寄送測試電子郵件的權限，或此頁面已過期。請重新載入設定頁面後再試一次。','You do not have permission to update this ticket.'=>'你沒有更新此票券的權限。','You do not have permission to upload images'=>'你沒有上傳圖片的權限','You do not have permission to upload media.'=>'你沒有上傳媒體的權限。','You do not have permission to view this booking.'=>'你沒有檢視此預訂的權限。','You do not have permission to view this event.'=>'你沒有檢視此活動的權限。','You do not have permission to view this location.'=>'你沒有檢視此地點的權限。','You do not have permission to view this ticket.'=>'你沒有檢視此票券的權限。','You do not have the rights to manage this %s.'=>'你沒有管理此 %s 的權限。','You do not have the rights to manage this event.'=>'你沒有管理此活動的權限。','You do not have the rights to manage this ticket.'=>'你沒有管理此票券的權限。','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Events Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'你在 Events Manager 的任何範本設定中都沒有定義自訂屬性。請前往<a href=\'%s\'>設定頁面</a>新增','You don\'t have any custom attributes defined in any of your Locations Manager template settings. Please add them the <a href=\'%s\'>settings page</a>'=>'你在 Locations Manager 範本設定中尚未定義任何自訂屬性。請前往<a href=\'%s\'>設定頁面</a>新增。','You have %s confirmed bookings'=>'你有 %s 筆已確認的預訂','You have %s pending bookings'=>'你有 %s 筆待審閱的預訂','You have a confirmed booking'=>'你有一筆已確認的預訂','You have a pending booking'=>'你有一筆待審閱的預訂','You have chosen to add or edit your current unavailable dates for all recurrences. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'你選擇新增或編輯所有重複項目目前的不開放日期。請仔細閱讀此警告！','You have chosen to edit your %s times. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'你選擇編輯%s時間。請仔細閱讀此警告！','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. If you shorten the date range, any recurrences falling outside the new date range will be cancelled or deleted.'=>'你選擇編輯重複日期範圍。如果縮短日期範圍，落在新日期範圍之外的任何重複項目都會被取消或刪除。','You have chosen to edit your recurrence date ranges. Please read this warning carefully!'=>'你選擇編輯重複日期範圍。請仔細閱讀此警告！','You have confirmed your attendance.'=>'你已確認出席。','You have currently disabled %s'=>'你目前已停用 %s','You have currently enabled %s'=>'你目前已啟用 %s','You have declined your attendance, your booking is now cancelled.'=>'你已婉拒出席，你的預訂現已取消。','You have declined your attendance.'=>'你已婉拒出席。','You have not defined a date range long enough to create a recurrence.'=>'你定義的日期範圍不夠長，無法建立重複項目。','You have not definitively confrimed your attendance.'=>'你尚未明確確認是否出席。','You have successfully created an account at %s'=>'你已成功在 %s 建立帳號','You have successfully disconnected from your %s account.'=>'你已成功中斷與 %s 帳號的連線。','You have successfully finalized upgrading your site.'=>'你已成功完成網站升級。','You have successfully migrated to Events Manager v6 formatting! We hope you enjoy the changes. In case you had some special formatting you realize you needed, there\'s the undo option below, it will reset all your migrated formats to how they were previoiusly. You can migrate again or individuall migrate each option within the settings page.'=>'你已成功遷移至 Events Manager v6 格式！希望你喜歡這些變更。若你發現需要某些特殊格式，可使用下方的復原選項，它會將所有已遷移的格式重設為先前的狀態。你可以再次遷移，也可以在設定頁面中個別遷移各個選項。','You have successfully submitted your event, which will be published pending approval.'=>'你已成功送出活動，核准後將會發佈。','You have successfully updated to Events Manager %s'=>'你已成功更新至 Events Manager %s','You have successfully updated your event, which will be republished pending approval.'=>'你已成功更新活動，核准後將會重新發佈。','You must allow us to collect and store your data in order for us to process your booking.'=>'你必須允許我們收集並儲存你的資料，我們才能處理你的預訂。','You must be logged in to view bookings.'=>'你必須登入才能檢視預訂。','You must book at least %1$d spaces for the ticket %2$s.'=>'票券 %2$s 至少需預訂 %1$d 個名額。','You must check the box allowing us to communicate with you via your provided contact methods.'=>'你必須勾選此方塊，允許我們透過你提供的聯絡方式與你聯繫。','You must log in or register to make a booking.'=>'你必須登入或註冊才能進行預訂。','You must log in to cancel your booking.'=>'你必須登入才能取消預訂。','You must log in to view and manage your bookings.'=>'你必須登入才能檢視和管理你的預訂。','You must log in to view and manage your events.'=>'你必須登入才能檢視和管理你的活動。','You must log in to view and manage your locations.'=>'你必須登入才能檢視和管理你的地點。','You must request at least one space to book an event.'=>'你必須至少申請一個名額才能預訂活動。','You nave successfully migrated to the default v6 formatting options, enjoy! We have an undo option, just in case...'=>'你已成功遷移至預設的 v6 格式選項，祝你使用愉快！我們也提供復原選項，以防萬一...','You will also need supply an OAuth redirect url to %s. Your url for this site is : %s'=>'你還需要向%s提供 OAuth 重新導向網址。此網站的網址為：%s','You\'ll need to create an App with %s and obtain the App credentials by going to %s.'=>'你需要使用 %s 建立應用程式，並前往 %s 取得應用程式憑證。','Your %s details are incorrect and cannot be published, please correct these errors first:'=>'你的%s詳細資料有誤，無法發佈，請先修正這些錯誤：','Your %s license includes this add-on.'=>'您的 %s 授權已包含此附加元件。','Your Details'=>'你的詳細資料','Your account has been successfully connected with %s!'=>'你的帳號已成功與 %s 連線！','Your booking does not include virtual access to this event, or it is not confirmed yet.'=>'您的預訂不包含此活動的虛擬入場，或尚未確認。','Your booking emails show the venue to every attendee, including those with virtual-only tickets. Use %1$s for the Where line in %2$s so each attendee sees the venue, their join link or both.'=>'您的預訂電子郵件會向每位參加者顯示場地，包括僅持虛擬票券的參加者。請在 %2$s 的「地點」行使用 %1$s，讓每位參加者看到場地、其加入連結或兩者。','Your booking has been recorded'=>'你的預訂已記錄','Your booking is now unconfirmed'=>'你的預訂目前為未確認狀態','Your confirmed booking email has no join link, so attendees with virtual access will not receive one by email. Add %1$s to it in %2$s.'=>'您的預訂確認電子郵件沒有加入連結，因此具有虛擬入場資格的參加者不會收到電子郵件通知。請在 %2$s 中將 %1$s 加入其中。','Your current settings will be saved for this selected view.'=>'你目前的設定將儲存至此檢視。','Your declaration of withdrawal has been received.'=>'我們已收到你的撤回聲明。','Your event #_EVENTNAME on #_EVENTDATES has been approved.'=>'你的活動 #_EVENTNAME (#_EVENTDATES) 已核准。','Your event details are incorrect and recurrences cannot be created, please correct these errors first:'=>'你的活動詳細資料有誤，無法建立重複項目，請先修正這些錯誤：','Your hold on these spaces has ended. You can still book them while they are available.'=>'這些名額的保留已結束。只要仍有空位，你還是可以預訂。','Your last attempt to reset all blogs to a certain timezone did not complete successfully. You can attempt to reset only those blogs that weren\'t completed by selecting your desired timezone again and then %s from the dropdowns below'=>'你上一次將所有部落格重設為特定時區的嘗試未順利完成。你可以重新選擇所需時區，再從下方下拉選單選擇 %s，僅重設尚未完成的部落格','Your name'=>'您的姓名','Your own legal withdrawal policy and model withdrawal form, shown on the withdrawal page. Events Manager does not generate legal text — paste your own from your legal adviser.'=>'你自己的法定撤回政策與撤回表單範本，會顯示在撤回頁面上。Events Manager 不會產生法律文字，請貼上法律顧問提供的內容。','Your plan'=>'您的方案','Your search filter settings will be selected automatically.'=>'你的搜尋篩選設定將會自動選取。','Your session expired, please try again.'=>'你的工作階段已到期，請再試一次。','Your spaces are held for %s while you complete your booking.'=>'在你完成預訂期間，你的名額將保留%s。','Your user account cannot publish events or locations in Events Manager. Run the import as an administrator.'=>'您的使用者帳號無法在 Events Manager 中發佈活動或地點。請以管理員身分執行匯入。','Your withdrawal policy text'=>'你的撤回政策文字','Zip or postal code'=>'郵遞區號','Zoom Integration'=>'Zoom 整合','[%s] New User Registration'=>'[%s] 新使用者註冊','[%s] Your username and password'=>'[%s] 你的使用者名稱和密碼','[No %s Page]'=>'[無 %s 頁面]','[Select a page]'=>'[選取頁面]','`color` must be a valid hex colour (e.g. `#80b538`).'=>'`color` 必須是有效的十六進位色彩（例如 `#80b538`）。','`example_payload` is the minimal valid booking (required fields only). `example_payload_full` additionally shows every optional field at its correct location — the values are illustrative placeholders, so replace them with the booker\'s real input and omit any field they did not provide.'=>'`example_payload` 是最精簡的有效預訂（僅包含必填欄位）。`example_payload_full` 則另外在正確位置顯示所有選填欄位，其中的值僅為示意用的預留位置，請替換為預訂者的實際輸入內容，並省略他們未提供的欄位。','all day'=>'全天','all events'=>'所有活動','and'=>'和','at'=>'於','booking'=>'預訂','bookings'=>'預訂','cancelled'